(47024,'Investing in Shellcoin can change your life. It changed mine. I was once an outcast, ostricized by society for being a half breed. Nobody would give me a chance to prove my worth. I slaved away as a simple gold mining peon, until the day I met Marlos Catos and became his associate.\n\nYou too can take control of your destiny, by investing in your future. Are you ready?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'投资贝壳币可以改变您的生活。 它改变了我的。 我曾经是一个被社会抛弃的人，因为我是混血儿而被社会排斥。 没有人会给我机会证明我的价值。 我作为一名简单的金矿苦工，一直辛苦工作，直到有一天我遇到了马洛斯·卡托斯并成为他的同事。\n\n您也可以通过投资自己的未来来掌控自己的命运。 你准备好了吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Investing in Shellcoin can change your life. It changed mine. I was once an outcast, ostricized by society for being a half breed. Nobody would give me a chance to prove my worth. I slaved away as a simple gold mining peon, until the day I met Marlos Catos and became his associate.\n\nYou too can take control of your destiny, by investing in your future. Are you ready?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'投资贝壳币可以改变您的生活。 它改变了我的。 我曾经是一个被社会抛弃的人，因为我是混血儿而被社会排斥。 没有人会给我机会证明我的价值。 我作为一名简单的金矿苦工，一直辛苦工作，直到有一天我遇到了马洛斯·卡托斯并成为他的同事。\n\n您也可以通过投资自己的未来来掌控自己的命运。 你准备好了吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(47025,'Can you believe how we are being treated? The warchief has accused us of being spies and imprisoned us in here!\n\nI came to Orgrimmar to help bring economic prosperity to it\'s citizens, and this is how they repay us.\n\nPlease help us get out of here. My employers will reward you handsomely.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，未来的合作伙伴！ 在奥格瑞玛看到侏儒感到惊讶吗？\n\n好吧，别这样！ 我们都是贝壳币公司的朋友。你看，世界分为两种人。\n\n不，我不是指联盟和部落。 这是人为的划分。 我说的是我们，有远见的企业家，还有可怜无知的老百姓。\n\n你是我们中的一员，对吧？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，未来的合作伙伴！ 在奥格瑞玛看到侏儒感到惊讶吗？\n\n好吧，别这样！ 我们都是贝壳币公司的朋友。你看，世界分为两种人。\n\n不，我不是指联盟和部落。 这是人为的划分。 我说的是我们，有远见的企业家，还有可怜无知的老百姓。\n\n你是我们中的一员，对吧？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(51239,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'They took everything. My friends are in jail. What did we do to deserve this treatment?\r\n\r\nK\'ron Tusk was trying to help people. We were going to eliminate poverty. Make everyone rich.\r\n\r\nAsk yourself what kind of Warchief would be against that?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
