(47030,'You there, I see you have brought yourself to the Shell Co. Trading Company!\n\nA new currency has reached our ears in Orgrimmar, one that is taking the humans by storm. It is a magical coin that will change Azeroth forever. Highly time to invest your spoils, young one.\n\nLook at me, I was once a pathetic druid, nothing to my name, and now I am one of the biggest shareholders of Shellcoin. Invest early, and you\'ll get returns you wouldn\'t dare dreaming of.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你呀，我看你是来壳牌贸易公司了！\n\n一种新的货币已经传入奥格瑞玛的耳朵，它正在席卷人类。 这是一枚将永远改变艾泽拉斯的神奇硬币。 是时候投资你的战利品了，年轻人。\n\n看看我，我曾经是一个可怜的德鲁伊，一无所有，现在我是贝壳币的最大股东之一。 尽早投资，您将获得意想不到的回报。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
