(50000,'We are Ancients: protectors of this once great forest.\n\nOur physical forms were destroyed ten thousands years ago when Archimonde and the Burning Legion marched upon Hyjal.\n\nOur spirits, however, remain intact.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们是古老的树人：曾经守护这片伟大森林的存在。\n\n在一万年前，当阿克蒙德和燃烧军团进军海加尔山时，我们的肉体被摧毁。\n\n然而，我们的灵魂依然完整。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
