(51673,'Welcome to the Caverns of Time, $N.\n\nYou have been granted permission to enter due to what you have done or what you will do.\n\nThe Caverns of Time are the home of my people, the Bronze Dragonflight. We are the guardians of time, and thus our home is connected to the time stream.\n\nMake no mistake Mortal, this place is not for a vacation. If you go rogue expect to never leave. In the Caverns you follow our rules and directions to the letter.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到时间之穴，$N。\n\n由于您已经做过或将要做的事情，您已被授予进入许可。\n\n时光之穴是我的人民青铜龙军团的家园。 我们是时间的守护者，我们的家也因此与时间流相连。\n\n别搞错了，凡人，这个地方不是用来度假的。 如果你走上邪路，就永远无法离开。 在洞穴中，您要严格遵守我们的规则和指示。\n\n如果你明白的话我会将你传送进去，但记住，我们可以在你做什么之前看到你打算做什么。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(51674,'The path to the caverns is long arduous. Mayhap I can ease your burdens and take you deeper in the Cavern.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'通往时光之穴的道路漫长二艰辛。也许我可以减轻你的负担，带你深入时光之穴。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(51680,'It appears that this dwarf wasn’t only killed but also mutilated, the jaw was missing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'看来这个矮人不仅被杀，而且还被肢解，下巴不见了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(51681,'The canister was empty, its contents most likely were poured over what was still seemingly aflame.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'罐子是空的，里面的东西很可能被倒在似乎还在燃烧的东西上。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(51682,'You are now certain that the new recruits were the ones to slaughter these dwarves.\n\nThe missing jaw however is something that raises your suspicions, your next thought would be to ask the Goblin that camps south of where you are, at the Crossroads if he was the one to sell them the oil.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你现在可以确定，新兵们就是屠杀这些矮人的凶手。\n\n然而，失踪的下巴是令你怀疑的地方，你下一个想法可能是询问位于你所在地以南的交叉路口的那个地精，是否是他卖给他们这种油。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(51683,'I am taking responsibility for what I have done, don\'t worry, I will follow you and behave.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我会为自己的行为负责，不要担心，我会跟随你并且表现得很好。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(51684,'What are they going to do to me? I am sorry for all I have done, I really am.\n\nI regret all of it, and given the chance I will surely make amends.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'他们会对我做什么？对于我所做的一切，我感到非常抱歉，真的。\n\n我为所有这些都感到后悔，如果有机会，我肯定会弥补过错。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(51685,'Please, don\'t kill me, please!\n\nI don\'t know anything else, please! I just want to go home.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'求你了，别杀我，求你了！\n\n其他的我就不知道了，请教！ 我只是想回家。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
