(51691,'Maverick seems to be in a deep slumber nothing would be able to wake him up.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'马弗里克似乎正处于沉睡之中，任何事情都无法唤醒他。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
