(52072,'Would you look at the tail on her! Ya know in my prime they used to call me Brick Willy because of my-- Well I won\'t go into the details but you get the idea. Bottoms up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你能看一下她身上的尾巴吗？ 你知道，在我的巅峰时期，他们曾经叫我布里克·威利，因为我——好吧，我不会详细介绍，但你明白了。 一饮而尽！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52073,'Yes, $c?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'是的, $c?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52074,'Yeah, okay, boss. No problem.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'是的，好的，老板。 没问题。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52075,'Oh to be young again. For me there were wars to fight, women to marry... never had the chance to be young.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，希望能再次年轻。对我来说，有战争要打，有女人要娶……再也没有机会年轻了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52076,'Good luck on your journey, kind stranger!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'祝你旅途好运，善良的陌生人!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52077,'What do you want?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你想要什么?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52078,'Start doing something before I replace that target dummy with you and begin a warm up session of my own!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在我用你代替那个目标假人开始我自己的热身之前，做点什么吧!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52079,'Oh, what a beautiful flower over there...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，那边的花真漂亮……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52080,'I love pie.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我喜欢馅饼。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52081,'Aye?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'机会?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52082,'Your mind is unfocused. Are you hiding something from me?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你的思绪不集中。 你有事瞒着我吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52083,'I\'ll get the last laugh... they\'ll see! Oh, hi $c, I didn\'t see you there.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我会笑到最后……他们会看到的！ 哦，嗨$c，我没在那里见到你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52084,'Hiccup!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'打嗝！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52085,'Dang! Fish aren\'t biting here either. I am gonna go back to my ol\' fishin\' hole!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'当当！ 这里的鱼也不咬钩。 我要回到我的老钓鱼洞去！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52086,'Did you see? That last firework almost caught that dwarf\'s shirt on fire! Hah!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你有没有看到？ 最后的烟花差点把那个矮人的衬衫烧着了！ 哈！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52087,'Show strength to your enemy, and we will prevail!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'向你的敌人展示力量，我们就会获胜！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52090,'Wha\'sh your name?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你叫什么名字？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52091,'Please, go on.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'请继续.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52092,'Hail traveler. If you want the latest news, head over to Vigil\'s Tavern. That\'s where most of us go to trade stories and gossip.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'冰雹旅行者。如果你想了解最新消息，请前往守夜酒馆。那是我们大多数人交换故事和八卦的地方。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52095,'Gods, this is country. I have half a mind to leave them all behind and keep going. What do you say, just you and me on the Kingsroad, swords at our sides, couple of tavern wenches to warm our beds tonight?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'诸神啊，这是乡村。我有点想把他们都抛在脑后，继续前进。你说呢，就你和我一起在国王大道上，我们身边有剑，今晚找几个酒馆的丫头帮我们暖床?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52096,'A friend once told me something that gave me great comfort. He said \'Life is only worth a damn because it\'s short! It\'s designed to be consumed, used, spent, lived, felt. We\'re supposed to fill it with every mistake and miracle we can manage. And then we\'re supposed to let go.\'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'一位朋友曾经告诉我一件事，给了我很大的安慰。 他说：“生命之所以有价值，是因为它很短暂！” 它被设计为被消费、使用、花费、生活、感受。 我们应该用我们能做到的每一个错误和奇迹来填补它。 然后我们应该放手。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52097,'What happened to our pigs?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们的猪怎么了?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52100,'Remember this laddie, pressure can either burst pipes or make diamonds.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'记住这个小伙子，压力要么会爆裂管道，要么会产生钻石。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52101,'I\'d talk to you if you smelled better. Cologne would be nice.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果你闻起来好点，我就跟你说话。科隆香水不错。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52102,'You lost?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你输了？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52103,'Do fish ever get thirsty?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'鱼会渴吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52104,'I just know my true love is out there somewhere! Medicine, law, business, engineering, these are noble pursuits, and necessary to sustain life... But poetry, beauty, romance, love, these are what we stay alive for.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我只知道我的真爱就在某个地方！ 医学、法律、商业、工程，这些都是崇高的追求，也是维持生命所必需的……但诗歌、美丽、浪漫、爱情，这些才是我们活着的理由。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52105,'You are an inspiration to us all, sir.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'先生，您是我们所有人的灵感来源。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52106,'Watch it, buddy!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'小心点，伙计！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52107,'Uh oh...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'呃哦...',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52108,'Unlike most ogres, I do know what an outhouse is for - giving you a swirlie. Now beat it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'与大多数食人魔不同，我确实知道户外厕所的用途——给你一个漩涡。 现在打败它。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52109,'Pleasure to meet you $n. Comin from the harbor? Next time you\'re there, give Sida my best, would ya?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'很高兴认识你。从港口来的?下次你去的时候，代我向西达问好，好吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52111,'*Gwenna gives you a sly wink.*',NULL,NULL,NULL,'*格温娜狡猾地向你眨眼。*',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52112,'A pleasure, $n. What can I do for you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'很荣幸，$n。我能为您做些什么?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52114,'Been a tough day? A nice ale should loosen those worries right up.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'今天过得很辛苦吗?一杯好喝的麦酒应该会让这些担忧立刻消失。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52115,'I\'ll tell you a secret. Something they don\'t teach you in your temple. The Gods envy us. They envy us because we\'re mortal, because any moment might be our last. Everything is more beautiful because we\'re doomed. You will never be lovelier than you are now. We will never be here again.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我告诉你一个秘密。这是寺庙里不会教你的东西。诸神都羡慕我们。他们羡慕我们，因为我们终有一死，因为任何时刻都可能是我们的最后一刻。一切都因为我们命中注定而更加美丽。你永远不会比现在更可爱。我们再也不会在这里了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52116,'Kiss me.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'吻我。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52117,'Yea?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'是吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52119,'What do you want?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你想要什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52125,'Greta the tittle tattle prattled on about the little metal bottle. She spat a bit of spittle on the moth that bit the cattle in a bitter battle.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'爱说闲话的葛丽塔喋喋不休地谈论那个小金属瓶。 在一场激烈的战斗中，她向咬牛的飞蛾吐了一口唾沫。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52128,'How are you doing?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52129,'This glyph is tailored to those whose love of adventure outweighs their desire to acquire power. Experience gains from creatures outside of dungeons will be reduced to 50% of normal, but for your patience and diligence, you will be rewarded every 10 levels with wonderful treasures. You will lose 5% of your current level\'s experience upon death, except in battlegrounds. This glyph can only be activated at Level 1.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这个雕文专为那些对冒险的热爱超过了追求力量的欲望的人而设计。在地下城以外的生物身上获得的经验将减少到正常值的50%，但作为对你耐心和勤奋的奖励，每达到10级时，你将获得美妙的宝藏。在死亡时，你将失去当前等级经验的5%，除了在战场之外。这个雕文只能在1级时激活。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52130,'This glyph is tailored to those who find the arduous journey more rewarding without stopping to rest. You will never again accumulate rested experience, but in exchange, you will master your weapon skills twice as fast.$B$BWhat\'s wrong? You don\'t see how this could be useful? Well, there\'s a rumor that those who reach the end of their journey exhausted and weary are those truly deserving of their achievement. Then again, that\'s just a rumor...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这个雕文是为那些发现艰苦的旅程更有价值而无需停下来休息的人量身定制的。 你将永远不会再积累休息经验，但作为交换，你掌握武器技能的速度会加倍。$B$B出了什么问题？ 你不明白这有什么用处吗？ 嗯，有传言说，那些在旅程结束时疲惫不堪的人才是真正值得取得成就的人。 话又说回来，这只是谣言……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52131,'The armistice between the Horde and the Alliance is tenuous at best, and though mercenaries and adventurers such as yourself are able to ally with whoever you wish regardless of race of faction, there still exists bad blood between those who recall the First and Second Wars. This glyph will raise your war banner for all to see, proclaiming that you will fight for the honor of your people. You will be permanently flagged for PvP, but in return, you will gain 20% more EXP and Honor from all sources.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'部落和联盟之间的停战协议是脆弱的，尽管像你这样的雇佣兵和冒险家愿意与任何你想结盟的人结盟，无论种族或派别，在那些回忆起第一次和第二次战争的人之间仍然存在着仇恨。这个雕文会让所有人都看到你的战争旗帜，宣告你将为你人民的荣誉而战。你将被永久标记为PvP直到60级，但作为回报，你将从所有任务和击杀中获得30%以上的经验。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60000,'Greetings, $N. Yes, I am the master of fashion and can help you change the look of your gear so it finally matches well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，$N。 是的，我是时尚大师，可以帮助您改变装备的外观，使其最终完美搭配。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60001,'Make your choice wisely from any of these, since any change per item will cost you one Fashion Coin.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'从其中任何一个中做出明智的选择，因为每件物品的任何改变都会花费您一枚时尚币。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60002,'Welcome to the Gnomeregan Reclamation Facility! I am High Tinker Gelbin Mekkatorque, King of Gnomeregan.$B$BWhile we are grateful for the hospitality of the dwarves, the terminal for the Deeprun Tram will no longer suffice as a home for the Gnomish people. Gnomeregan must be reclaimed, and this old factory has been refurbished into new quarters for the Gnomish people to do so. We can use this place as a staging ground to cleanse and reclaim Gnomeregan from the traitorous Lepers.$B$BWe will regain what is ours... and bring Thermaplugg to justice!$B$BNow, having said that. What can I help you with?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到诺莫瑞根回收设施！ 我是大工匠格尔宾·梅卡托克，诺莫瑞根之王。$B$B虽然我们感谢矮人的热情好客，但 深泉电车的终点站将不再足以作为侏儒人民的家。 诺莫瑞根必须被夺回，而这座旧工厂已被翻新成新的住所，以供侏儒人民居住。 我们可以利用这个地方作为一个集结地，从叛徒的麻风病人手中净化和夺回诺莫瑞根。$B$B我们将夺回属于我们的...并将瑟玛普拉格绳之以法！$B$B现在，话虽如此。 有什么可以帮您？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60010,'Welcome to the home of the Warsong Outriders.\n\nYou must be weary, honouring the Horde and our war efforts is thirsty work.\n\nStay a while and rest your bones.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到战歌前锋的家园。\n\n你一定很疲倦，为了荣耀部落和我们的战争努力是让人口渴的工作。\n\n稍作休息，让你的身体得以恢复。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60011,'It is not your words that give you weight, Your actions give you weight my friend.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'并不是你的言辞赋予你分量，我的朋友，而是你的行动赋予你分量。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60012,'To be stationed here? No greater honour.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'驻扎在这里?没有比这更大的荣誉了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60014,'This be our plot of land, it\'s not much, but we call it home and home is where the heart is.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这是我们的一块土地，虽然不大，但我们称之为家，家是心灵的归宿',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60015,'Greetings! Amro de Lux, Hunter Extraordinaire, at your service.\n\nWhile the boss is running around the world doing more exciting work, someone needs to stay behind and handle the boring parts of the job.\n\nWhat is it that I do? I manage this whole operation, of course.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好！我是猎人阿姆罗·德·卢克斯，非凡的猎人，随时为您效劳。\n\n当老板四处奔波，从事更刺激的工作时，总得有人留下来处理工作中的乏味部分。\n\n那么，我是做什么的？当然是管理整个行动。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60016,'Welcome, weary traveler!\n\nWhat will be your guilty pleasure this time? Drinking? Gossiping? Adventuring?\n\nWhats wrong?\n\nI\'m a mage and I serve drinks! Don\'t tell anyone, but it\'s the easiest way to make money that I\'ve ever heard of.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎你，疲惫的旅行者！\n\n这次你会选择什么令你心安的享受？喝酒？闲聊？冒险？\n\n怎么了？\n\n我是法师，我负责提供饮料！ 不要告诉任何人，但这是我听说过的最轻松的赚钱方式。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60017,'What?\n\nOf course Mojo isnt my real name... Only the boss knows it.\n\nAnd there is good reason for that. Now cease your interrogations and desist somewhere else!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'什么？\n\n当然了，\"莫吉\"并不是我的真名... 只有老板知道。\n\n而且有很充分的理由。现在停止你的询问，在别的地方找点事做吧！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60301,'I am not fond of having to turn down a good chunk of our autonomy, no. But as I said, my people\'s future comes first. Besides. The goddess of our ancestors has guided the Kaldorei well. Who am I to doubt their goddess? I\'ve seen her power first hand, and so have you. Whether she is the right thing for my people is another question. One only the future will answer.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我不喜欢不得不拒绝很大一部分自主权，不。 但正如我所说，我人民的未来是第一位的。 除了。 我们祖先的女神很好地引导了卡多雷。 我有什么资格怀疑他们的女神？ 我亲眼目睹了她的力量，你也一样。 她是否适合我的人民则是另一个问题。 只有未来才能回答。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60312,'The Kaldorei have arrived and have started preparations. Why not go and check up on their progress? They have setup in the Golden Dawn Institute. It is the floating building where our teleport to Stormwind resides. Once you are done return here.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'卡多雷已经抵达并开始准备工作。 为什么不去看看他们的进展呢？ 他们在金色黎明学院设立了据点。 这是我们传送到暴风城的浮动建筑。 完成后返回此处。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60313,'Hello again friend, I have heard of all the good you\'ve done for our cause. I take it you\'re here as Lady Windrunner\'s emissary for the summit?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'朋友，你好，我听说过你为我们的事业所做的一切善举。 我猜你是作为风行者女士登顶的使者而来的？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60314,'If you help me cleanse the Moonwell and bring retribution to the Ogres, then we may take some of the water. I will present your case to the High Priestess herself.\n\nUnder the supervision of the Sisterhoodand the Sentinels, I do not see why we could not try to guide some of the Quel\'dorei back in the warm embrace of the goddess. Even if they choose to reject the Goddess, proximity to the water should eventually help them wean off from their ailment. It may take thousands of years however.\n\nRemember that the Quel\'dorei lived with us for over two thousand years, and that was not enough for them to cease their use of magic. However, the modern Quel\'dorei are a different people from our wayward kin. Either way, that is my offer.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果你帮我净化月光井，报复食人魔，我们就可以喝点水。我会把你的案子交给女祭司本人。\n\n在姐妹会和哨兵的监督下，我不明白为什么我们不能尝试引导一些奎尔多雷回到女神温暖的怀抱中。即使他们选择拒绝女神，靠近水应该最终帮助他们摆脱他们的疾病。然而，这可能需要数千年的时间。\n\n记住，奎尔多雷和我们一起生活了两千多年，但这并不足以让他们停止使用魔法。然而，现代的奎尔多雷人与我们任性的亲戚是不同的人。不管怎样，这就是我的提议。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60315,'Splendid! Then meet me by the Well and be prepared, this will not be an easy task. Should you fail and we have to retreat, I will be ready to attempt this once more. I will place a bowl of sacred water by the well, when you are there I will arrive.\n\nThe cleansing will draw the attention of the brutes, so do not hesitate to fight! If they injure me, the cleansing will also fail, keep me safe! May Elune guide us.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'灿烂！ 然后在井边与我会合并做好准备，这不是一件容易的事。 如果你失败了，我们不得不撤退，我将准备再次尝试。 我会在井边放一碗圣水，你到了我就会到。\n\n净化会引起野兽的注意，所以不要犹豫，战斗吧！ 如果他们伤害了我，净化也会失败，保佑我！ 愿艾露恩指引我们。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60316,'Grrrr... Called Snarles Shadowpaw. Work is good if you need killing. Murky Waters take contract to do work others donӴ like doing. You want to have something kill you come to right place. Ask with bag of gold...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'咕噜咕噜……叫斯纳尔斯·影爪。 如果你需要杀戮，工作是好的。 浑水公司接受合同去做别人不喜欢做的工作。 你想要杀死一些东西，那么你来对地方了。 拿着一袋金子去问...',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Grrrr... Called Snarles Shadowpaw. Work is good if you need killing. Murky Waters take contract to do work others donӴ like doing. You want to have something kill you come to right place. Ask with bag of gold...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Grrrr... Called Snarles Shadowpaw. Work is good if you need killing. Murky Waters take contract to do work others donӴ like doing. You want to have something kill you come to right place. Ask with bag of gold...',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60350,'You will die before the might of Gilneas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你将在吉尔尼斯的力量面前死去。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60351,'You won\'t leave here alive, outsider!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你不会活着离开这里的，外来者！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60352,'I fight for my king, you fight for your life!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我为我的国王而战，你为你的生命而战！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60353,'My sword is stained with the blood of my enemies, and yours will soon join them.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的剑沾上了敌人的血，你的也会加入他们。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60354,'You and the other rebels will be hunted like the cattle you are.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你和其他叛乱分子将会像牲畜一样被追捕。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60355,'You will find no mercy here, just the wrath of Greymane.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在这里你不会发现任何怜悯，只有格雷迈恩的愤怒。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60356,'For the Crown!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'为了国王的荣耀！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60357,'In the name of Genn Greymane!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'以格恩·格雷迈恩之名！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60358,'In the name of the Light!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'以圣光之名!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60359,'Justice shall be served.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'正义必须得到伸张。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60360,'Back to the shadows!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'回到阴影里去！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60428,'Are you looking to join The Silver Crusade? Well, go out and be useful then.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'您想加入银色远征吗？ 好吧，那就出去做个有用的人吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60446,'A great power lurks, and I seek to combat it. Those who wronged me shall pay the ultimate price, and I will make sure they suffer. You are going to be the one who helps me, and perhaps I shall reward you for your efforts.\n\nWell, make yourself at home, there is much to do and much to discuss.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'一股强大的力量潜藏其中，我打算与之抗衡。那些冤枉了我的人将付出最终代价，我会确保他们受到痛苦的折磨。你将是帮助我的人，或许我会为你的努力给予回报。\n\n好了，随意自在，有很多事情要做，也有很多事情要讨论。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60447,'You\'re going to scare off all the fish!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你会吓跑所有的鱼的！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60448,'You wouldn\'t happen to have a few coin on you, huh? I need it for the next time we stop somewhere.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你身上不会碰巧有几枚硬币吧？ 下次我们停在某个地方时我需要它。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60449,'I will never care of your rank, I respect strength above else. Prove yourself to be worthy of my axe and I will die for you. Do not mistake these words for mutiny, I will respect your orders and will not question them.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我永远不会在乎你的军衔，我尊重力量胜过一切。证明自己值得我信任，我会为你而战。不要误解这些话是叛变，我会尊重你的命令，不会质疑它们。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60450,'Hey there friend, Gary is the name! If you\'re looking to spend your coin then heres the place, you could potentially even triple your money through me if you got luck on your side! So, what say you swashbuckler, got the heart for it?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，朋友，我叫加里！如果你想花钱，那么这里就是个好地方，如果运气好的话，你甚至可能通过我把钱翻三倍！ 那么，冒险家，有勇气尝试吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60452,'Welcome aboard, we Bloodsail treat eachother well at the least, if you remain loyal.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎加入，我们血帆海盗至少会友好对待彼此，如果你保持忠诚的话。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60454,'Just because I\'m old don\'t think I\'m weak, ye understand young one? Ye let yer guard down for but a moment and Old-Tide Sam will pull you under.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'别以为我老就代表我软弱，年轻人明白吗？你稍微放松警惕，老塔德·萨姆就会把你拽到水底下。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60455,'No better place to rest up then on the ship! The rocking of the waves is almost gentle don\'t you agree?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'没有比在船上更好的休息场所了！ 海浪的摇晃几乎是温和的，你不同意吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60459,'Ey mon, you be looking like you could use a few trinkets, let Vil\'do tell you what you be needing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，朋友，看起来你可能需要一些小玩意儿，让维尔多告诉你你需要什么。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60460,'Looking for the good stuff huh? You\'ll find it no where else.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'想找好东西吗?你在别的地方都找不到。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60465,'What brings a young $r all the way up here? I can only assume you seek my counsel.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'是什么把一个年轻的$r带到这里来？我只能猜测你在寻求我的建议。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60470,'Who are you?! Begone, this is my home, you do not belong here!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你是谁?!走开，这是我的家，你不属于这里!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60471,'The forests beauty is unmatched, the winds flowing through the trees, the moonlight dotting the landscape. Yet, beneath it all, there is a darkness that lurks, hidden beneath the veil of it all. This place used to be so full of life and harmony, but now there is more predators then we can count, and our allies in the forest have turned to nothing more then roaming thugs.\n\nYou can sense it, can\'t you, as if you could wake from the dream at any moment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'森林的美丽是无与伦比的，风穿过树木，月光点缀着大地。然而，在这一切之下，有一种黑暗在潜伏，在这一切的面纱下隐藏着。这个地方曾经充满了生机和和谐，但现在有更多的掠食者，我们数不清，而我们在森林中的盟友已经变成了四处游荡的暴徒。\n\n你能感觉到吗，仿佛你随时可以从梦中醒来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60472,'Ashenvale is growing more and more dangerous by the day.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'灰谷正变得越来越危险。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60473,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'We must remain ever vigilant of not only dangers from abroad, but from within. Teldrassil has seen an increase in domestic disturbances of late, demanding more of my forces be sent out on patrol and investigations opened all across the forest.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们必须始终对来自外部的危险保持警惕，也要警惕来自内部的威胁。最近，泰达希尔发生了越来越多的国内骚乱，需要我派遣更多的部队进行巡逻，并在整个森林开展调查。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60474,'Welcome to Darnassus, crown jewel of Teldrassil.$B$BThis city serves as the heart and soul of the Kaldorei, and for good reason. Its grace and beauty mirrors that of our culture, our legacy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到达纳苏斯，泰达希尔的皇冠明珠。$B$B这座城市是卡多雷的心灵之地，理由很充分。它的优雅和美丽反映了我们的文化，我们的传承。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60476,'What you doing all the way out here $R?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你怎么会来到这么远的地方，$R？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60477,'Be comfy, the fire pits here are warm, and you be warm too!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'舒适点吧，这里的火坑很暖和，你也会感到温暖的！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60478,'We Maul\'ogg have been here for long time, and we gonna stay here for long time! Just cause others think they can push us around doesn\'t mean anything! With Lord Cruk\'Zogg we can do anything that we want on the island.\n\nWe\'re stronger then all of them, and we\'re gonna be pushing them around soon!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们莫卢格族在这里已经待了很长时间，而且我们将继续留在这里！只因为其他人认为他们可以欺负我们，并不代表什么！在克鲁克祖格领主的带领下，我们可以在岛上做任何想做的事情。\n\n我们比所有人都更强大，我们很快就会把他们推到一边！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60479,'Hey there, I\'m Wincing Willy Pal! Heard good things about you, the only reason we\'re talking right now. My job is to oversee supplies coming from the great seas and keep them here until we can allocate them elsewhere.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，我是威辛·威利·帕尔！ 听说了你的好话，这是我们现在谈论的唯一原因。 我的工作是监督来自大海的物资并将它们留在这里，直到我们可以将它们分配到其他地方。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60480,'You look familiar, you one of the new crew members?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你看起来很眼熟，你是新船员之一吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60481,'Another Bloodsail huh? Not often someone wanders around out here and just shows up, what you looking to help?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'又一个血帆吧？ 很少有人在这里闲逛然后出现，你想帮忙什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60483,'The path ahead will be different for you, you no longer adapt to nature, nature adapts to you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'前面的路对你来说会不一样，不再是你适应自然，是自然适应你',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60484,'The path of a Forsaken hunter differs from that of others. We do not adapt to nature, but bend nature to adapt to us.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'亡灵猎人的道路与其他人不同。我们不是适应自然，而是让自然适应于我们。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60485,'The path ahead will be different for you, you no longer adapt to nature, nature adapts to you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'前方的道路对你来说将是不同的，你不再适应自然，而是自然适应于你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60486,'The path ahead will be different for you, you no longer adapt to nature, nature adapts to you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'前方的道路对你来说将是不同的，你不再适应自然，而是自然适应于你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60487,'The path ahead will be different for you, you no longer adapt to nature, nature adapts to you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'前方的道路对你来说将是不同的，你不再适应自然，而是自然适应于你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60488,'The beasts of this world do not trust the undead. The Cult of Forgotten Shadow possesses a solution for this, however.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这个世界的野兽不信任不死者。 然而，遗忘之影教派对此有一个解决方案。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60495,'Kargath is one of the farthest frontiers that the Horde has.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'卡加斯是部落最遥远的边境之一。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60496,'Ahoy matey, I am very curious to see what new chapter for the Bloodsail Buccaneers you will be painting. I will be watching the Cap\'n\'s lodge for a while but when ye come here to rest or spend some alone time I will be gone.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'啊，海盗伙计，我非常好奇你将为血帆海盗的新篇章画下什么。我会在船长的小屋里观察一段时间，但当你来这里休息或独处时，我会离开的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60500,'So much to do in such a short amount of time, not to mention all the competition, and those blasted Venture Co. lurking about.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在如此短的时间内有这么多事情要做，更不用说所有的竞争对手，还有那些该死的风险投资公司潜伏在周围。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60502,'Not many people come back here, you useful? Think you can do some handywork for a guy?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不多人会回到这里，你有用吗？想为我做点手工活吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60503,'I sense something about you, something.. Different. Perhaps we will meet again, until then, leave me be, I have much work to do, and I do not desire to be interfered.\n\nUnless you\'re looking for a fight mortal, if so, it can be arranged.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我感受到你身上有些不同寻常的东西。也许我们会再次相见，但在那之前，请让我专心工作，我有很多事情要做，不想被打扰。\n\n除非你是在找死，凡人，如果是这样的话，我可以满足你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60504,'You heard word from Booty Bay? I\'m expecting a shipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你听说过藏宝海湾的消息吗？我正在等待一批货物。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60507,'Stonetalon Peak may be a place of harmony, but we must be vigilant to keep it this way.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'石爪峰可能是一个和谐的地方，但我们必须保持警惕，以保持这种状态。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60510,'Nothing is greater than fishing!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'没有什么比钓鱼更伟大的了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60511,'Ey mon, you looking to learn to work with nature?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿伙计，你想学习与自然相处吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60512,'Well, this is new, I don\'t often get visitors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯，这是新的，我不常接待访客。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60526,'It is in the fringes of the world that hope shines the brightest, never forget that even a dim torch is still burning.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在世界的边缘，希望闪耀着最明亮的光芒;永远不要忘记，即使是暗淡的火炬也在燃烧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60527,'I am in my homeland, defending what is important to me, be it from those crazed zealots, or from the undead themselves, Light\'s Point will establish what once was.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我在我的家园，捍卫着对我重要的东西，不管是来自那些疯狂的狂热者，还是来自亡灵本身，光明之地将重建曾经的荣耀。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60528,'My family called Lordaeron home once, heh, believe it or not. Valueable money was to be made from ore and jewelcrafting that we Stonefury were once known for many years ago! Known all thats left of my families legacy is smoldering ruins and piles of stone and burnt wood, not to mention the corpses!\n\nIf I\'m going to fight for anything, it may as well be here.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的家人曾经把洛丹伦称为家，呵呵，不管你信不信。 有价值的钱可以从矿石和珠宝加工中赚到，我们石怒多年前就已经知道了！ 众所周知，我家族的遗产只剩下闷烧的废墟、成堆的石头和烧焦的木头，更不用说尸体了！\n\n如果我要为什么而奋斗，那就在这里吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60529,'Welcome to Light\'s Point, make yourself at home, should you not be tainted by either the plague of undeath, or the plague of zealotry.\n\nThe Scarlet Crusade that occupy the region are fervored in a bloodlust against all things, both living and dead. They view the world around them as hostile, and will need to be put down should the true light of what once was to shine through.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到圣光之地，随意自在，只要你没有被亡灵的瘟疫或狂热的瘟疫所污染。\n\n占据这个地区的血色十字军对所有事物都充满了狂热的嗜血之情，无论是活着还是死去。他们把周围的世界视为敌对，一旦真正的光芒再次闪耀，他们就需要被镇压。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60530,'Greetings, many folk around here have good reasons to be at the very frontier, I just hope yours is meaningful.\n\nIt\'s interesting to see Lordaeron not touched by the grip of undeath, even if the people who wield this land are as vile as the scourge.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，这里的许多人都有充分的理由来到边境，我只是希望你的理由有意义。\n\n有趣的是，洛丹伦没有受到亡灵的控制，即使统治这片土地的人们像天灾一样邪恶。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60531,'Well, you\'ve been a much more friendly face to us, not even our own comrades in arms were willing to simply come up and talk.\n\nI thought we would be lauded as heroes, or at the least returned to with open arms, and here we are, treated as villains after surviving the expedition to the north on behalf of the crusade. It sickens me to know how many died to bring the fight to the undead just for things to have fallen apart as they have here.\n\nEither way, apologies for my rudeness, I am Captain Haroldson, of the Embertide in the Scarlet Fleet, or at the least, what is left of it, anyway, after everything that happened with that doomed expedition.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯，你对我们更友好，甚至我们的战友也不愿意过来跟我们交谈。\n\n我以为我们会被奉为英雄，或者至少会受到欢迎，但在代表十字军远征北方后幸存下来的我们却被当作恶棍对待。 令我感到恶心的是，有多少人为了与不死族战斗而牺牲，只是为了让事情像这里一样分崩离析。\n\n不管怎样，为我的无礼道歉。我是哈罗德森船长，来自血色舰队的“烈潮号”，或者至少是剩下的部分，经过那场注定要失败的远征后，一切都变成了这个样子。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60532,'Out of all the ships to make it back we were the only one, you believe that luck?... Hic!\n\nThere were much better men then me, and honestly, I don\'t even want to be here after everything that happened up north. Just, toss me in the water already.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在所有成功返回的船只中，我们是唯一的一艘，你相信运气吗？... 哈！\n\n有比我更好的人，说实话，在经历了北方发生的一切之后，我什至不想待在这里。 快把我扔到水里吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60538,'I am a seasoned wyvern trainer, $c. It feels like just yesterday when the tauren and orcs liberated them from the harpies of Stonetalon. They have been loyal friends to the Horde ever since.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是一位经验丰富的双足飞龙训练师，$c。 牛头人和兽人将他们从石爪鹰身女妖手中解放出来的感觉就像是昨天一样。 从那时起他们就一直是部落忠实的朋友。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60539,'Bristlefur snarls as it would lay eyes upon you, yet refrains from attacking. The beast appears to be quite bored on the ground, perhaps a snack would convince Bristlefur to take flight with you as its rider',NULL,NULL,NULL,'鬃毛会咆哮，好像它会注视着你，但不会攻击。 这头野兽似乎在地面上很无聊，也许吃点零食就能说服鬃毛作为它的骑手与你一起飞行',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60540,'Well, not often we see outsiders! Come, shelter yourself, the winter can surely get harsh!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯，我们很少见到外人！ 来吧，躲起来吧，冬天肯定会很严酷！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60541,'Wow, what are you? Are you one of the people that Inunquaq was going to see in the southlands?!\n\nYou\'re lucky to come here, many travel to Kaneq\'nuun to see the great shiny spirit that flys through the sky, maybe you\'ll see it too!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哇，你是谁？你是因纳库克要去南部土地看望的人之一吗？！\n\n你来这里很幸运，许多人前来坎奎努恩看那个在天空飞舞的光辉灵魂，也许你也会看到它！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60542,'Welcome to Kaneq\'nuun, you certainly look much different than anything I\'ve seen, but as long as you\'re friendly, you are welcome. I am Panukuki, the elder here, if you have any questions, feel free to bring them to me.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到坎奎努恩，你的外表和我见过的任何人都很不一样，但只要你友善，就欢迎你。我是这里的长老帕努库基，如果你有任何问题，随时可以向我提问。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60543,'The fish are always biting out here',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这里的鱼总是咬人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60549,'Greetings traveler. If you are looking to reach our ancient homeland of Kalimdor to the west, you will need passage by boat. One of our ships from Auberdine makes regular stops here in Stormwind.$B$BDo not fret if the boat is not here; it will arrive in due time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，旅行者。 如果您想向西到达我们古老的家园卡利姆多，您将需要乘船。 我们从奥伯丁出发的一艘船定期停靠在暴风城。$B$B如果船不在这里，请不要担心；我们会为您提供帮助。 它会在适当的时候到达。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60606,'The growing magical energies surrounding Karazhan have been a great cause for concern within the Kirin Tor. I have ventured here of my own will to study the mysteries that seem to be growing more bold with the passing of time. Perhaps you are willing to assist the Kirin Tor in uncovering the unknown for the greater good?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'卡拉赞周围不断增长的魔法能量引起了肯瑞托内部的极大关注。 我出于自己的意愿冒险来到这里，研究那些随着时间的流逝而变得更加大胆的未知事物。 也许你愿意协助肯瑞托为了更大的利益而发现未知的事物？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60607,'I have traveled far in search of a great magic that crackles strong. I have sensed its power all the way from Orgrimmar, and I must know more.\n\n No doubt it is coming from the nearby Karazhan Tower, for what looms within is a mystery to all that must be uncovered. I could use your help, perhaps you are willing to lend assistance?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我走遍了很远的地方，寻找一种强大的噼啪声的伟大魔法。 我从奥格瑞玛一路就感受到了它的力量，而且我必须了解更多。\n\n  毫无疑问，它来自附近的卡拉赞塔，因为其中隐约可见的东西对所有必须揭开的谜团来说都是一个谜。 我需要你的帮助，也许你愿意提供帮助？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60611,'Well, it sure is a nice place, isn\'t it?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'那确实是个好地方，不是吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60621,'We have many allies across the Great Sea, located far to the east within the Eastern Kingdoms. The boat that arrives at this dock leads to the harbor of the human city of Stormwind, the heart of the Alliance.$B$BIf the boat is not here, have patience. It shall arrive shortly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们在大海的彼岸有许多盟友，位于东部王国的东部。抵达这个码头的船只会前往人类城市暴风城的港口，这是联盟的中心。 $B$B如果船不在这里，请耐心等待。 它很快就会到达。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60622,'It has been a long time since a mortal has walked these halls. As much as I have my distaste for you all, I understand that we require your aid.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'已经很久没有凡人走进这些大厅了。虽然我对你们这些人类不太感冒，但我明白我们需要你们的帮助。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60623,'This here boat will lead ye all the way to Sparkwater Port in Durotar, the goblins be needin\' all sorts a things from us, and we\'re more then happy to supply them for weapons.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这艘船将带你们一路前往杜隆塔尔的火花港口，那里的地精需要各种各样的东西，而我们乐意为他们提供武器。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60624,'Me and my brother Tizak run this zeppelin route! We could certainly use some new parts to repair the thing soon, but making the trip through the Badlands has been stressful! This zeppelin here leads all the way to Orgrimmar, back to the heartland of the Horde.\n\nCareful when the zeppelin is coming in, it can be a close call!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我和我兄弟特萨克经营着这条飞艇航线！我们肯定需要一些新零件来修理这艘飞艇，但穿越荒芜之地的旅程一直很紧张！这艘飞艇通往奥格瑞玛，返回部落的中心地带。\n\n齐柏林飞艇来的时候要小心，这可能是千钧一发!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60625,'Heh, this old rustbucket doesn\'t steer the greatest. Damn is it hard getting it through the rough jagged landscape of the Badlands, but it\'s managed well enough thus far! If you\'re looking for an express ticket to Kargath, then there is no better route then on this old girl, the zeppelin is certainly a faithful one!\n\nOh, and don\'t mind the bumpy ride, it needs some new parts, and doesn\'t really stop right.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，这艘老旧的锈斑飞艇的操控性并不是最好的。该死，将它驾驶穿越荒芜之地那崎岖的地形真是够困难的，但迄今为止，它还算能应付得过来！如果你正在寻找通往卡加斯的快速船票，那么没有比乘坐这艘老女孩更好的路线了，这架飞艇绝对是个可靠的伙伴！\n\n哦，还有别在颠簸的旅途中介意，它需要一些新的零件，而且不能很好地停下来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60626,'Hey there, you looking to head to the great plains of Mulgore? Well, then you\'re in luck, we set up a new route from Orgrimmar to Thunder Bluff, it\'s quite the scenic view, give it a go.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，朋友，你想前往莫高雷的大草原吗？那么你真是走运，我们刚刚设置了一条从奥格瑞玛到雷霆崖的新航线，风景非常迷人，不妨试试看。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60627,'Durotar is a hot, and sweltering place, that\'s for sure, I\'m happy to be posted here in Thunder Bluff, with the nice cool breeze and the beautiful view!\n\nIf you\'re wanting to head to Orgrimmar this zeppelin is stopping just outside of the city.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'杜隆塔尔是一个又热又闷热的地方，毫无疑问，我很高兴被派往雷霆崖，这里有凉爽的微风和美丽的景色！\n\n如果您想去奥格瑞玛，这艘飞艇将会在城市外停下。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60628,'Why, is there anything I can help you with? Unless you are seeking knowledge of the arcane, I may not be of assistance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，有什么我可以帮助你的吗？除非你正在寻求奥术知识，否则我可能无法提供帮助。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60629,'We dwarven mages are that of The Azurestone Order, long ago when the very caves of Ironforge were being mined, we came across an old, and rather magically potent stone. This stone was studied by the mages of Dalaran, and has been kept within our hands since that very day.\n\nIt is with this stone that many of the first dwarven mages had gotten their footing within the realm of arcana. If you see any of our kin that are naturally gifted with magic, guide them here.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们矮人法师属于“蔚石教团”，很久以前，当铁炉堡的洞穴被开采时，我们发现了一块古老而具有强大魔力的石头。这块石头被达拉然的法师们研究过，自从那一天以来，就一直在我们手中保管着。\n\n正是因为这块石头，许多最早的矮人法师在奥术领域中获得了立足之地。如果你看到我们的同族天生具有魔法天赋，可以引导他们到这里来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60631,'<N\'ribbi stares deep into your soul>.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<恩比凝视着你的灵魂深处>。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60636,'Welcome to Southfury Trading Company, friend! Did ya come here for business? If you need something shipped, our first-class caravaneers got ya covered.\n\nOr are ya carryin\' a bit too much coin around and expectin\' some good-for-nothin\'s to come after ya? No problem, we got some well-trained muscle to protect your pretty bottom! Or maybe you\'re lookin\' for some exotic wares from the South Seas? If money can buy it, we will get it for ya, promised!\n\nSouthfury Trading Company - You got coin and we want it!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到南辉贸易公司，朋友!你是来谈生意的吗?如果你需要运输什么东西，我们一流的商队会为你提供服务。\n\n还是你带了太多的金币，担心有些无赖会追上你？没问题，我们有训练有素的猛男保护你!或者你在寻找来自南海的异域商品?只要有钱，我们都能帮你买到，我保证!\n\n南辉贸易公司-你有金币，我们需要它！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60640,'The Hand of Wrath is a military unit led by Executor Rotheart. It is the iron hand of the Horde, crushing its enemies. The Hand serves the Warchief and the leaders of the races of the Horde.\n\nFounded out of the Forsaken Vanguard by the order of the Dark Lady as a way to forge brotherhood between all races of the Horde in the fires of war. Officers are straight down the tunnel if you\'re looking to join or have some business with us. If not then stop wasting my time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'愤怒之手是一支由执行官罗赛特率领的军事部队。它是部落的铁腕，粉碎敌人。愤怒之手服侍着大酋长和部落各种族的领袖。\n\n它是在黑暗女王的命令下，由被遗忘者先锋队创建的，旨在通过战争的烈火中，为部落各个种族之间锻造兄弟情谊。如果你想加入或者与我们有些业务，我们的军官们就在隧道尽头。如果不是，那就别再浪费我的时间。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60643,'Hands off my haul bub!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'别碰我的货物，伙计！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60644,'I bear the knowledge of the Shen\'dralar, I am a Highborne of Eldre\'thalas and I know a great deal about our world. Since you can aid me to gain even more knowledge I am at your service, Captain.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是沙德拉尔的知识传承者，我是艾德萨拉斯的上层精灵，我了解很多关于我们的世界的事情。既然你可以帮助我获取更多的知识，我愿意为你效劳，船长。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60645,'Welcome to the Golden Moon Circus, the home of the Golden Moon Traveling Troupe.\n\nEnjoy yourselves as we entertain you through our magical acts and trickery - but be wary that we are not responsible for any burning, choking, drowning, money loss, body loss or loss of mind that might or might not happen to you.\n\nThank you for your understanding and have a pleasant day.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到金月马戏团，金月巡回剧团的家园。\n\n在我们的神奇表演和诡计中尽情享受，但要小心我们不对可能发生在你身上的燃烧、窒息、溺水、金钱损失、失去身体或失去理智负责。\n\n感谢您的光临，祝您度过愉快的一天。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60648,'Greetings.\n\nOn this plane I am known as Olom, a fisher between the realms. You are a new face... I think?\n\nAs a younger orc I broke free from my demonic master, so I was overjoyed to finally discover there were others out there after so many years who have sided against the Legion. It gladdens my heart to know that a new age and style of warlock is growing.\n\nPipnam here reports many evils brewing. So we need to be ready for the worst, as our name suggests.\n\nWe are the Ered Ruin. The Doom Guard.\n\nWelcome.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好。\n\n在这个世界中，我被称为奥隆（Olom），是在不同位面之间徘徊的旅行者。您似乎是一个新面孔……如果我没有弄错的话？\n\n在我作为一名年轻的兽人时，我成功摆脱了我的恶魔主人。在经过多年之后发现还有其他人同样反抗军团，让我感到非常高兴。看到新一代术士以不同的方式出现，拥有不同的观点，让我感到欣慰。\n皮普南向我们汇报了许多令人不安的事件。因此，我们必须为潜在的挑战做好准备，正如我们的名字所暗示的那样。\n\n我们是艾瑞达·毁灭者。 末日卫士。\n\n欢迎加入我们。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60656,'All that I am: anger, cruelty, vengeance, death and decay - I bestow upon those who welcome the cold embrace of undeath.\n\nGaze now upon the lands before us.\n\nThe Scarlet Crusade scurries to undo my work, while Light\'s Hope stands defiantly against us - for they are but a blemish upon the Plaguelands.\n\nThey must all be shown the price of their defiance.\n\nWhere you tread, blight will follow.\n\nGo now and claim these lands in the name of Ner\'zhul and The Lich King. ALL. MUST. DIE!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我所拥有的一切：愤怒、残忍、复仇、死亡和腐朽，我将赐予那些接受不死族冰冷拥抱的人。\n\n现在注视眼前的土地。\n\n血色十字军急于破坏我所做的一切，而光之希望对抗我们，因为他们只是瘟疫之地上的瑕疵。\n\n他们必须付出反抗的代价。\n\n你所踏之处，荒芜将随之而来。\n\n现在前去，以耐奥祖和巫妖王的名义夺取这些土地。所有人，都必须死！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60660,'The School was not always quel’dorei you know, its origins are far more ancient than even Ranger-Lord Dragonstrider knew of. After the War of the Ancients, many worgen still roamed the forests of Kalimdor after their unfortunate release from the Scythe of Elune. Demons and satyrs also ran rampant as well, innocents slain constantly. Brave sentinels and highborne sorcerers alike put aside their differences and created a new order of warriors to wipe out the vicious monsters that stalked the night. The “Thero’anir” or “Dragonhawks” in your tongue were infused with draconic blood to match the ferocity of their foes.\n\nSadly, only Cydas and I are all that remain of the original Thero’anir. Perhaps with Ranger-Lord Bladesong’s resurgence of the order, the School will reach its zenith again.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这所学院并不总是奎尔多雷的，它的起源比游侠领主龙行者所知的还要古老。 上古之战结束后，许多狼人不幸从艾露恩之镰中被释放，仍然在卡利姆多的森林中漫步。 恶魔和萨特也同样猖獗，无辜者不断被杀戮。 勇敢的哨兵和上层精灵巫师都抛开了分歧，创建了一个新的战士组织来消灭夜行的邪恶怪物。 “Thero\'anir”在你们的语言中称为“龙鹰”它们被注入了龙血，以匹配他们敌人的凶猛。\n\n可悲的是，最初的Thero\'anir只剩下赛达斯和我了。 或许随着游侠领主刀歌的复兴，学院将再次达到顶峰。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60661,'Welcome Friend!\n\nThis sacred place is home to the Macrochelys of Azeroth, defenders of horde and alliance, elemental executioners, dragon hunters, and god slayers.\n\nThis is our home and home is where the heart is.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎，朋友！\n\n这个神圣的地方是艾泽拉斯的大螯龟之家，他们是部落和联盟的守护者，元素的执行者，屠龙者和诸神的杀手。\n\n这是我们的家，家就是心所在。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60662,'What? You don\'t know these black banners? Even I feared the Teeth when I was alive! The Grin serves the true Warchief, Blackhand. He sent us to open a new front against Stormwind. Boss Ruag knows that every blade, even the Dark Horde’s, is needed in the Swamp. The Peacechief’s pride may trump all in Durotar, but you’re in Azeroth’s armpit now, git. And we’re meaner than the mire. Just don’t mention us when you head home, eh?\n\n<He seems now to be speaking to himself.>\n\nThey just won’t let me die…',NULL,NULL,NULL,'什么？ 你不认识这些黑色横幅吗？ 连我活着的时候都害怕牙齿！ 咧嘴笑者服务于真正的大酋长黑手。 他派我们去开辟一条对抗暴风城的新战线。 鲁格大佬知道沼泽中需要每一把剑，甚至是黑暗部落的剑。 在杜隆塔尔，和平酋长的骄傲可能压倒一切，但你现在已经在艾泽拉斯的腋下了，混蛋。 而我们比泥沼还卑鄙。 你回家的时候别再提我们了，好吗？\n\n<他现在似乎在自言自语。>\n\n他们就是不让我死……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60668,'Lok\'tar ogar!\n\nIn this camp we do not draw blood from each other, no matter what clan you come from. Here we heal our wounds and rest.\n\nTo prepare for the next battle ahead, against the pinkskins.\n\nThru blood, fire and death!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'洛克塔奥加尔！\n\n在这个营地里，无论你来自哪个部落，我们都不会互相残杀。我们在这里疗伤休息。\n\n为了迎接即将到来的下一场战斗，与那些粉色皮肤的敌人。\n\n经历血、火和死亡！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60670,'Glad you are with us! There is no telling what awaits us on Shalandis, but we cannot let our new allies down.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'很高兴你能加入我们！在夏兰蒂斯岛上，我们无法预测会有什么等待着我们，但我们不能辜负我们的新盟友。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60700,'I\'ve found my calling after the injuries of the last war in preparing the finest meals I can provide. \n\nCome and have your fill before heading back to work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在上一场战争的创伤之后，我找到了自己的使命，就是准备我所能提供的最美味的餐食。\n\n在返回工作之前，来享用一顿丰盛的餐点吧！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60701,'You\'ve found an interesting looking feather.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你找到了一根看起来很有趣的羽毛。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'You\'ve found an interesting looking feather.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'You\'ve found an interesting looking feather.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60702,'Everyone wants to know the secret to my brew, but it’s something I can\'t teach.\n\nI learned from an eccentric man riding a turtle a few years back.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'每个人都想知道我的酿造秘诀，但这是我无法教授的东西。\n\n几年前，我从一个骑在海龟上的古怪人那里学到的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60703,'It\'s really inconvenient to come here to eat every day, but I just can\'t get enough of Sarn\'s brew.\n\nHave you seen Nantai work? I could watch that all day.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'每天都来这里吃饭真的很不方便，但我就是无法抵挡萨恩的酿酒技艺。\n\n你见过南泰工作吗？我可以整天都看他做那些。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60704,'<She claps excitedly in your face before giggling wildly.>\n\nStep carefully around this estate! Lots of questionable types around, even the flowers are scared!\n\nCan you hear them?!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<她兴奋地拍了拍你的脸，然后狂笑起来。>\n\n在这个庄园周围小心行走！ 周围有很多可疑的类型，连花都害怕了！\n\n你能听到他们的声音吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60710,'A foul darkness encroaches in these lands, growing ever more potent. It is up to us to stop the demonic taint.\n\nDo you have what it takes to stalk demons, and rid them from the world?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'邪恶的黑暗侵蚀着这片土地，并且变得越来越强大。 我们有责任阻止恶魔的污染。\n\n你有能力追踪恶魔并将其从世界上赶走吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60727,'Welcome to Theramore, make yourself at ease. I am Colonel Breen, commander of the defense of Theramore.\n\nWe are always looking for a pair of brave hands. If you\'re looking for work, perhaps you could be of assistance to the Theramore Guard.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到塞拉摩，让自己轻松自在。 我是布林上校，塞拉摩防御指挥官。\n\n我们一直在寻找一双勇敢的手。 如果您正在找工作，也许您可以为塞拉摩卫队提供帮助。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60728,'Someones gotta keep this lighthouse running, and I suppose that someone is me.\n\nI got a lot of work to do, you need anything?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'总得有人来维护这座灯塔的运转，而我想那个人就是我。\n\n我有很多工作要做，你需要什么吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60729,'It\'s dangerous out here, no doubt about that! Especially with all of the wildlife lurking around.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这里很危险，毫无疑问！尤其是有这么多野生动物潜伏在周围。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60730,'We have a lot of work to do here on the frontier, so unless you\'re here to help, please do let me work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们在这片前线有很多工作要做，所以除非你是来帮忙的，请不要打扰我工作。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60731,'We have all sorts of books stored, chaptering much of the things we have come across within Kalimdor. If you\'re seeking some rare knowledge, you\'ve certainly come to the right place.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们储存了各种各样的书籍，记录了我们在卡利姆多大陆所遇到的许多事物。如果你正在寻找一些珍贵的知识，你肯定来对了地方。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60732,'The shores have been growing more concerning as of late, let us pray that things will not escalate further.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'近来海岸的情况越来越令人担忧，让我们祈祷事态不会进一步恶化。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60733,'The docks are my domain, if you have anything that needs to be sent, or delivered, let me know.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'码头是我的地盘，如果你有任何需要发送或交付的东西，请告诉我。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60748,'Do you know where you are walking mortal? This place has been here long before your races existence. The Emerald Sanctum is a hallowed ground. Your mere steps upon the verdant grass tarnishes the beauty of this place. Your vile smell lingers upon the air.$B$BYou must leave, it will not be long until the rest of the Green Dragonflight is awoken.$B$BOur eternal duty has arrived, and as The Awakener, I have put out the call to stir those lost in slumber. They will arrive, it is only a matter of time now, and you will not get in the way, $r.$B$BDarkness swirls, festering upon the sleepless realm, I will put an end to it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你知道自己正步入何处吗，凡人？这个地方在你们种族存在之前就已经存在了。翡翠圣所是神圣的地方。你的脚步踏在青翠的草地上，玷污了这片美景。你恶臭的气味弥漫在空气中。$B$B你必须离开，绿龙之族的其他成员很快就会被唤醒。$B$B我们永恒的使命已经到来，作为唤醒者，我已发出号召，唤醒那些陷入沉睡的人。他们将会到来，现在只是时间的问题，而你不会阻挡在他们面前，$r。$B$B黑暗的漩涡，在这个不眠之境上酝酿，我将会终结它。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60749,'So, you be from the Horde, yes?\n\nMy name be Taza\'go, I once fought beneath Ukorz Sandscalp as his champion, but those times be long passed mon.\n\nThe Sandfury be scattered, and disillusioned. Others left before, and after we did, it not be long until Zul\'Farrak is left an abandoned ruin for everything evil, and cursed that took place in that city.\n\nPerhaps you can help us, for we need it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'那么，你来自部落，对吗？\n\n我叫塔扎戈，曾经作为乌克兹·沙顶的冠军而战斗过，但那些时光早已过去，朋友。\n\n沙怒部族已经四分五裂，我感到失望。在我们离开之前，还有其他人离开了。在我们离开后不久，祖尔法拉克就变成了一座被遗弃的废墟，充满了邪恶和诅咒。\n\n也许你能帮助我们，因为我们需要帮助。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60750,'Don\'t be scared, Viceclaw don\'t be pinchin\' nobody I don\'t tell em too!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'别怕，维克不会捏任何我没有命令的人！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60751,'Hey mon, we don\'t get many visitors in this village. I work on the leather here, you looking for anything specific?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗨，朋友，我们这个村庄很少有访客。我在这里做皮革工作，你有什么特别需要吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60752,'The ancestors be upset with our actions in the old city. I seek guidance for how to gain redemption, and to lead us to a new destiny, away from the taint of Sandfury evil.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'先祖对我们在旧城的行动感到不满。我寻求指引，如何获得救赎，引领我们走向新的命运，远离沙怒邪恶的污染。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60753,'Welcome to Sandmoon Village, this place is lead by Taza\'go, he is leader here, one I would trust to follow to the ends of this earth mon.\n\nIf anyone can restore our lost honor, it be him.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到沙月村，这个地方由塔扎戈领导，他是这里的领袖，我会毫不犹豫地跟随他到地球的尽头，朋友。\n\n如果有人能够恢复我们失去的荣誉，那就是他。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60754,'Be careful in Tanaris, it is a harsh place for outsiders, void of water.\n\nThe sun itself has withered away the strongest of our kind, don\'t think yourself immortal to the heat.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在塔纳利斯要小心，对外来者来说，那是一个严酷的地方，缺乏水源。\n\n太阳本身已经让我们中最强大的人枯萎，不要认为自己对于高温是不死之身。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60759,'Our mission here is of an utmost importance. The Dark Portal radiates with fel energy, who knows if it is even still active.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们在这里的使命极为重要。黑暗之门充满了邪能能量，谁知道它是否还在运作。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60760,'I hate ogres.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我讨厌食人魔。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60761,'I am Jaiymu, son of Taiymu. What do you need friend?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是贾伊穆，泰伊穆之子。朋友，你需要什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60762,'I am well versed crafting in the old methods, perhaps you could use a repair to let me refine my skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我精通古老的制作方法，也许你需要修理一下，让我可以提升我的技艺。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60763,'Dark magic aids us in battle, and empowers our spirits. The Blood Fury that flows through our veins is a resource that can be tapped, and aided by the powers I can conjure.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'黑暗魔法在战斗中助我们一臂之力，赋予我们力量。流淌在我们血脉中的血之狂怒是一种资源，可以通过我所召唤的力量来激发和增强。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60764,'There are darker powers at play, always, do not think yourself as smart enough to avoid their tricks, be wary, for you never know who, or what might be watching.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'总是有更黑暗的力量在发挥作用，千万不要认为自己足够聪明以避开它们的诡计，要保持警惕，因为你永远不知道是谁，或者什么可能在观察着你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60765,'I have ridden across many battle fields, and slain many foes, but it is only now that I feel caution for what lies ahead. I trust Karfang with every ounce of my blood, but I do not know if we share the same values with this \'New Horde\' across the world.\n\nPerhaps it is truly for the best, and perhaps it may be our downfall, we shall see in time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我曾跨越许多战场，击败过许多敌人，但现在我才感到对前方的情况要保持谨慎。我对卡芳毫不保留地信任，但我不确定我们是否与世界各地的这个\"新部落\"拥有相同的价值观。\n\n也许这真的是最好的选择，也许这可能导致我们的崩溃，只有时间会告诉我们。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60766,'What are you looking for outsider?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'外来者，你在寻找什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60769,'What is it that you want, can you not see that I am busy whelpling?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你想要什么，难道你看不出我正在忙着照顾幼龙吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60770,'My name is Karfang, I am leader here.\n\nMy people should cause you no harm, lest you insult, or bother them too much. There are many things to discuss, and many things to do for us to secure our place in this world.\n\nThe Blackrock Clan find themselves manipulated by greater forces. The Old Horde is a shell of what it once was, and I will not allow my people to follow them into madness.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我叫卡芳，我是这里的领袖。\n\n我的人民不会对你造成伤害，除非你侮辱了他们，或者过于打扰他们。有许多事情需要讨论，许多事情需要我们去做，以在这个世界上确保我们的地位。\n\n黑石部落发现自己受到更强大的力量操纵。旧部落已经变成了曾经的一片残影，我不会允许我的人民跟随他们走向疯狂。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60772,'I am Councillor to Karfang, I advise him on all matters. Both internal and foreign.\n\nPerhaps you bring news from beyond this charred valley?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是卡芳的议员，我就所有事务向他提供建议，无论是内部事务还是对外事务。\n\n也许你从这片焦土山谷之外带来了消息？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60773,'We have ale if you need it, or food if you need that, what will it be?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果你需要，我们有啤酒，或者如果你需要食物，它会是什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60774,'You are lucky we are on good terms outsider, hold your tongue and your ill words, I am used to killing those outside of the clan.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你很幸运，我们在外人关系很好，管好你的嘴，别说坏话，我习惯于杀死部落之外的人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60775,'I am the one that trains the worgs for hunting, killing, and roaming.\n\nI am responsible for our best specimens, and our most useful allies. Now, what is it you want outsider?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我负责训练座狼进行狩猎、杀戮和游荡。\n\n我负责培养我们最好的样本，以及最有用的盟友。那么，外来者，你想要什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60778,'A clenched fist speaks louder than a hundred words.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n握紧的拳头胜过百言千语。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60780,'Why hello there, and welcome to Livingstone Croft, make yourself at home, the only thing I ask is that you wipe your feet off outside before you come in!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗨，欢迎来到利文斯通农舍，随意自在，只有一件事我要求，就是进屋前请在外面擦净你的脚！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60781,'So many damned critters around here, keep disturbing the crops and making our lives even more difficult then it needs to be...\n\nAhh, sorry about that, what can I do for you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这里周围有那么多该死的小动物，不断扰乱庄稼，让我们的生活更加艰难，然后......\n\n啊，抱歉，刚才有点发牢骚。有什么我可以为你效劳的吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60782,'All of this work being done, its exciting, I can\'t wait to see the whole city finished!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'所有这些工作正在进行，真是令人兴奋，我迫不及待想看到整个城市完工！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60784,'Azeroth sure is a mystical place, the more you read the more you can find out.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'艾泽拉斯确实是一个神秘的地方，你阅读得越多，就能发现越多的事情。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60786,'I look after a lot of the horses for the Stromgarde Cavalrymen, no doubt you\'ve seen them around, they often keep the main road between here and Refuge Pointe secured, as much as they can, anyway.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我为激流堡骑兵照顾了很多马匹，毫无疑问你在附近见过他们，他们经常尽可能地保护这里和避难所之间的主要道路的安全。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60787,'It is only a matter of time until things get much better.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'情况好转只是时间问题。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60788,'Welcome to Gallant Square, our section of the city. Don\'t let your guard down, for as much progress as we are making it can all be destroyed within a matter of minutes.\n\nThe Ogres and Syndicate still lurk within other parts of the city, and cause us much nuisance, so keep your wits about you on the way in and out.\n\nSo, what can I do for you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到崇高广场，这是我们城市的一部分。不要放松警惕，尽管我们正在取得很大的进展，但一切都可能在几分钟内被摧毁。\n\n食人魔和辛迪加仍然潜伏在城市的其他地方，给我们造成了很多麻烦，所以在进出途中要保持警惕。\n\n那么，我能为你做些什么呢？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60789,'Don\'t be scared, come come! I sell all sorts of magical supplies and stuff, perhaps you\'re looking for what I\'m selling!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不要害怕，来吧来吧！我卖各种各样的魔法用品和物品，也许你正在寻找我在卖的东西！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60790,'No need to be shy, look around, and buy what you need.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不必害羞，四处看看，买你需要的东西。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60791,'Welcome, I hope you can find some rest within this hellish place.\n\nThis is Nethergarde Keep, established once the Dark Portal opened and the First War had begun years ago. We have been assigned to watch over it, and report magical irregularities should they arise.\n\nIf you see anything unusual, let us know.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎，我希望你能在这个地狱般的地方得到一些休息。\n\n这里是虚空之门要塞，是在黑暗之门打开并开始第一次战争多年前建立的。我们被派来监视它，并在出现魔法异常时进行报告。\n\n如果你看到任何异常的情况，请告诉我们。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60792,'We\'ve seen all manner of foe out there, from ogre, to orc, to demon. It is only a matter of time before they grow bold enough to strike at us.\n\nWe will be more then prepared for when they make such an action.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们在那里看到了各种各样的敌人，从食人魔到兽人，再到恶魔。他们变得足够大胆，最终会向我们发起进攻，只是时间的问题。\n\n当他们采取这样的行动时，我们将会做好充分的准备。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60793,'Make sure you don\'t cause any trouble here, we have more then enough problems with all of the fel-warped beasts lurking in the wasteland.\n\nOr maybe you\'ve come to this frontier in order to offer assistance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'确保你不要在这里惹麻烦，我们已经有足够的问题要应对荒原中潜伏的恶魔扭曲的野兽。\n\n或者也许你是来这片前线提供帮助的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60794,'So many magical fluctuations, so much warping of genetics, it almost makes a gnomes head spin with the possibilities of it all!\n\nThere\'s research to be done $R, Research to be done!\n\nOh, right. I\'m Wigglestip, Lead Analyst at Nethergarde, a pleasure to make your acquaintance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如此多的魔法波动，如此多的基因扭曲，这几乎让侏儒的脑袋因其中的可能性而眩晕！\n\n有研究要做，$R，有研究要做！\n\n哦，对了，我叫维格尔斯蒂普，是虚空之门的首席分析员，很高兴认识你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60795,'I\'m growing restless behind these blasted stone walls, I\'ve crushed too many demon skulls to be wasting away here.\n\nNames Harguf, I\'ve been here quite a long time, what can I do for you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我在这些的石墙后面感到不安，我已经粉碎了太多的恶魔头骨，不能在这里虚度光阴。\n\n我叫哈古夫，我在这里待了很长时间了，我可以为你做些什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60799,'You are surely wondering what we are doing here.\n\nUnderstand me correctly, we do not like the war.\n\nWe do not go into battle for pride or honor. We don\'t care about the squabble between the Alliance and the Horde.\n\nEach side has its children and each child should be able to grow up happily.\n\nThe brigade wants to preserve this world and protect their children.\n\nSo, now it\'s up to you to decide. If you join us, take this butterfly. It will sit on your heart and on your tabard. Then you will begin to understand.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们不是为了自豪或荣誉而参战。我们不关心联盟和部落之间的争斗。\n\n每一方都有自己的子孙，每个孩子都应该能够快乐地成长。\n\n他们想要保护这个世界，保护他们的子孙。\n\n所以，现在由你决定。如果你加入我们，拿着这只蝴蝶。它将停留在你的心里，也会在你的外袍上。然后你会开始理解。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60802,'Greetings, soldier. Have you come to fend off the nefarious black dragonflight? There’s tension in the air... I can feel it. The closer we get to taking down the new leaders of the flight, the closer we get to feeling safe again.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，士兵。你是来抵御邪恶的黑龙军团吗？空气中弥漫着紧张感...我能感觉到。我们越接近击败这个龙军团的新领袖，我们就离重新感到安全越近。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO `locales_broadcast_text` VALUES
(60806,'Until you rid your heart of anger, your growth will remain forever stunted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在你的心中消除愤怒之前，你的成长将永远停滞不前。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60813,'May your journies guide you to interesting places, what can I do for you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'愿你的旅途带你到有趣的地方，我可以为你做些什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60816,'Welcome to Red Cloud Roost, It is here we prepare many of the new and young wyvern to live as loyal companions to the Horde. If they are not trained properly they can become unruly, and savage.\n\nYou may find many untamed wyvern within Stonetalon Mountains if you desire to see just how vicious they can become.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到红云高地，我们在这里为许多新的年轻飞龙做准备，让它们成为部落的忠诚伙伴。如果它们没有得到适当的训练，它们可能会变得难以控制和野蛮。\n\n如果你想看看它们可能变得多么凶猛，你可以在石爪山脉找到许多未被驯服的飞龙。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60817,'I have been training the wyvern here for some time now, making sure that they keep their primal instincts in check.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我已经在这里训练飞龙有一段时间了，确保它们保持原始本能的控制。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60818,'Being new around here certainly has its ups and downs, at the least I learn from the best.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在这里是新手确实有其优势和劣势，至少我能向最优秀的人学习。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60822,'These damned Quillboar are always stronger than I anticipate, never underestimate a foe.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这些的刺背野猪人总是比我预料的强大，永远不要低估敌人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60823,'It is up to us to ensure that the spirits transition to the world beyond. We are to watch over them, and to keep their memories and experiences passed down from generation, to generation. In a way, we are the keepers of the past, and the present.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们有责任确保这些灵魂过渡到彼岸世界。我们要看守着它们，将它们的记忆和经历代代相传。在某种程度上，我们是过去和现在的守护者。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60824,'You can always feel the spirits no matter where you are, take comfort in knowing that your ancestors will guide the path ahead.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'无论你身在何处，你总是能感受到灵魂的存在，要知道你的祖先将引导前方的道路。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60825,'Too see, is to believe.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'亲眼所见，才会相信。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60826,'Do not fear what comes next, rejoice to share this experience with those around you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不要害怕接下来会发生的事情，要为能与周围的人分享这个经历而欢欣鼓舞。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60827,'Arathor has long been at war with the trolls, and we shall be the ones to end it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'阿拉索长期以来一直与巨魔战斗，我们将成为结束这一切的人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60832,'I put in a lot of work within Shadowforge, to think it all meant nothing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我在影牙要塞里做了很多工作，想想这一切都毫无意义。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60833,'Exiled, you believe that?!\n\nI was the foreman that looked after the Shadowforge Miner\'s Union. For years I carved the tunnels of the city itself and this is the thanks I get? They said I was lucky to have survived my failures. No doubt they expected me and my group to just die off to some Blackrock scum.\n\nThey will pay for this.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'被放逐，你竟然相信这个？\n\n我曾经是影牙矿工工会的工头。多年来，我开凿了这座城市的隧道，结果这就是我得到的回报？他们说我能够在失败中幸存是幸运的。毫无疑问，他们期望我和我的团队会死在黑石那些混蛋手里。\n\n他们会为此付出代价的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60834,'Oh, been loyal to ol\' Orvak\' me whole life, they tossed me out with the others, and we\'re all that remain.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，我一辈子都忠诚于老奥尔瓦克，他们把我和其他人一起赶出去了，而我们都是剩下的人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60846,'Baaaa!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'呸！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60850,'There are many things to learn, and much wisdom to be passed down.\n\nWe exiles have a lot to teach the other races of this world.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'有许多东西需要学习，还有很多智慧需要传承。\n\n我们这些被放逐者有很多东西可以教给这个世界的其他种族。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60851,'Your curious face tells me you want to know who we are or what we do...\n\n<Ley-Technician Vorthal sighs exasperatedly.>\n\nWe are the Thalassian Alliance, an organization with the noble goal of helping refugees, my people, the High Elves, and of course, supporting our new Alliance allies in whatever they do.\n\nNow, if you will excuse me, I need to fix this blasted orb, so, unless you happen to be an expert in ley lines or mana currents, go entertain yourself elsewhere and stop wasting my time!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好奇的表情告诉我你想知道我们是谁，或者我们在做什么...\n\n<魔网技师沃萨尔疲倦地叹了口气。>\n\n我们是萨拉斯联盟，一个崇高的组织，目标是帮助难民，我的族人，高等精灵，当然还有支持我们新的联盟盟友的一切。\n\n现在，请原谅我，我需要修复这个的水晶球，所以，除非你恰好是关于魔网或法力流的专家，去别的地方找点娱乐，不要浪费我的时间！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60854,'Get out of my shack.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'滚出我的小屋。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60855,'Watch yourself, the Garrison Armory has been over run.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'小心点，要塞军械库已经被攻陷了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60856,'The howling winds of Tanaris whisper things to me, and I can not speak back... Strange it is to be lost like this.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'塔纳利斯的呼啸风声对我低语，而我无法回应...这种迷失感真是奇怪。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60857,'Make yourself welcome here, there be a lot to do!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'随意自在地逗留在这里，这里有很多事情要做！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60858,'Westfall. Once, land of prosperity. Now, nothing more than a wasteland.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'西部荒野，曾经是繁荣之地。如今，不过是一片荒芜之地。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60859,'I\'m busy, pal.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n我很忙，朋友。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60860,'Saludos camarada. Me alegra ver a alguien con tanta energía y ganas como tú. Alguna vez me sentí vivo, ahora no soy más que escombros y no sé cómo puedo seguir aquí. Tengo la sensación de que he reencarnado varias veces en este mundo.$B$BRecuerdos borrosos vienen a mí... ¿Un cofre? ¡Cuidado! Está lleno de trampas, ¡es un suicidio!... Me ahogo, creo que en la próxima vida aprenderé a nadar...$B$BUff, no sé qué ha sido eso pero lo recuerdo y me dan escalofríos. Mejor ten eso en cuenta.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'“你好，同志。我很高兴看到有人像你一样充满活力和热情。我曾经觉得自己还活着，现在我只不过是瓦砾，我不知道如何继续在这里。我有一种感觉，我在这个世界上已经转世了好几次。$B$B模糊的记忆来到我身边...一个箱子？小心！它充满了陷阱，这是自杀...我快溺水了，我想下辈子我会学会游泳......$B$B呵呵，我不知道那是什么，但我记得它，它让我不寒而栗。最好暂时把它留在那里......”',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60862,'<The body lays unmoving.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<尸体静止不动。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60863,'<You can feel your ancestors gaze upon you>.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<你能感觉到你的祖先在凝视着你。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60864,'<You can feel your ancestors gaze upon you>.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<你能感觉到你的祖先在凝视着你。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60865,'<You can feel your ancestors gaze upon you>.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<你能感觉到你的祖先在凝视着你。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60869,'It\'s almost insulting being placed out here, you do one wrong thing and then you\'re sent out to the fringes to deal with problems...\n\nI guess someone has got to get their hands dirty.\n\nYou looking for work, cause we can use some help.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'被安排在这里几乎是一种侮辱，你做错一件事情，然后就被送到边缘地带去处理问题...\n\n我猜总得有人去弄脏手。\n\n你是来找工作的吗？因为我们可以用一些帮助。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60870,'All sorts of stuff be goin\' on just around the ridgeline, keep your eyes peeled, and ye be seein\' Dark Irons about.\n\nI\'m here to find out what they be up to.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'各种各样的事情都在山脊线附近发生，保持警惕，你会看到黑铁矮人在周围活动。\n\n我在这里是为了找出他们在干什么。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60872,'Ironforge is nice and all, but I kind of miss Gnomeregan, it was just, cozy, and offered all kinds of progress in many fields you know?\n\nWell, maybe not, but either way it isn\'t all bad, there are still things to figure out and mysteries to solve.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'铁炉堡很不错，但我有点怀念诺莫瑞根，它公正、舒适，并且在许多领域提供了各种进步，你知道吗？\n\n好吧，也许不是，但无论如何，也不全是坏事，仍然有一些事情需要弄清楚，还有一些谜团需要解决。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60873,'The wolf looks at you with fear in its eyes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'狼用害怕的眼神看着你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60874,'I hope you are well, is there anything that you require?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我希望你一切都好，你有什么需要吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60875,'Two plus three times four... What do you want?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'两加三乘以四...你想要什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60877,'The light watches over all, do not forget that.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'圣光守护着一切，不要忘记这一点。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60879,'What is it you want? I\'m busy, so move it along.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你想要什么？ 我很忙，所以就先走吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60880,'Since the death of Grommash Hellscream, our clan have been scattered around kalimdor, from Ashenvale down to the Thousand Needles.\n\nNowadays, only the most fierceful leaders of the Warsong Outriders are listened still. But one day, sooner or later... A new Warchief will arise! We are the ones who built Orgrimmar in a few days. All the citizens witness what have done the real sons of the Horde!\n\nWe\'ll never let some filthy night elves continue their outrageous sabotage.\n\nThe War-effort has no end. As long as the eternal nomadry will run the entire Kalimdor.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'自从格罗玛什·地狱咆哮死后，我们的部族就分散在卡利姆多各处，从灰谷一直到千针谷。\n\n如今，只有战歌突击队中最勇猛的领袖们还在被倾听。但总有一天，迟早……新的大酋长将会出现!是我们在几天内建造了奥格瑞玛。所有的公民都见证了部落真正的儿子们所做的一切!\n\n我们绝不会让那些肮脏的暗夜精灵继续他们无耻的破坏。\n\n战争没有尽头。只要永恒的游牧能统治整个卡利姆多。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60884,'Well look who stumbled on this hole in the wall! Ya found our hideaway, those who\'re lookin to get rich or die grindin. Ya got coin? We\'ll take it. Ya thirsty? Plenty o\'kegs inside.\n\nWork a bit on your skills, or just stare listlessly at a wall, we don\'t care here. Make do and lay low til they stop lookin for ya, then get back out there and find yer wealth!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'看看是谁偶然发现了墙上的这个洞！ 你找到了我们的藏身处，那些想要致富或死去的人。 你有金币吗？ 我们会接受它。 你渴吗？ 里面有很多小桶。\n锻炼一下你的技能，或者只是无精打采地盯着墙壁，我们在这里不在乎。 凑合着，保持低调，直到他们停止寻找你，然后回到那里，找到你的财富！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60888,'Aye there! Welcome to the Talon\'s base! The names Herodwartus. I\'m the guild\'s historian. I know all about it\'s history! The Talon\'s purpose is to hunt all loyal to the Scourge and to the Burning Legion. All their leaders followed this purpose, Nicholas Othmar, to the last and now deceased Ragnar Magnus.\n\nBut, let me tell ye, fallen leaders won\'t stop the Talon from hunting all Scourge beasts and Demons of Azeroth! Now the Talon\'s being led by Arnest. He\'s dumb, but he\'ll learn! Ye\'ll see.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'啊!欢迎来到魔爪的基地!名字是希罗德华图。我是公会的历史学家。我知道它的所有历史!魔爪的目的是猎杀所有忠于天灾军团和燃烧军团的人。他们所有的领袖都遵循这个目标，从尼古拉斯·奥斯玛，一直到最后的已故的拉格纳·马格努斯。\n\n但是，让我告诉你们，堕落的领袖不会阻止魔爪猎杀艾泽拉斯所有的天灾兽和恶魔!现在魔爪由阿内斯特领导。他很笨，但他会学会的!你们将会看到。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60893,'Are you looking to join The Silver Crusade? Well, go out and be useful then.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你想加入银色十字军吗?那就出去做个有用的人吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60899,'What brings you to Anchor\'s Edge of all places?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'什么风把你吹到锚边来了?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60900,'The Deep Tide has been a loyal vessel to Kul Tiras for many years.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'深潮号多年来一直是库尔提拉斯的忠诚船只。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60901,'Our journey has taken much longer than expected. It is about time that we bring our efforts against the Horde.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们的旅程比预期的要长得多。 现在是我们努力对抗部落的时候了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60902,'Keep your faith in the Light, and all shall reveal itself.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'保持你对圣光的信仰，一切都会显露出来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60903,'Welcome to the Shell Co. Trading Company!\n\nI\'m a genius! I have invented a brand new currency which will take Azeroth by storm! The magical Shellcoin will forever change the way we exchange goods, with every coin being unique a irreplaceable.\n\nDown on your luck? Now is the time to invest in Shellcoin! Watch the market and hit it big!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到壳牌贸易公司!\n\n我是个天才!我发明了一种全新的货币它将席卷艾泽拉斯!神奇的艾泽拉斯将永远改变我们交换商品的方式，每一枚硬币都是独一无二的，不可替代的。\n\n运气不好?现在是时候投资贝壳币了!关注市场，大赚一笔!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Welcome to the Shell Co. Trading Company!\n\nI\'m a genius! I have invented a brand new currency which will take Azeroth by storm! The magical Shellcoin will forever change the way we exchange goods, with every coin being unique a irreplaceable.\n\nDown on your luck? Now is the time to invest in Shellcoin! Watch the market and hit it big!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到壳牌贸易公司！\n\n我是天才！ 我发明了一种全新的货币，它将席卷艾泽拉斯！ 神奇的贝壳币将永远改变我们交换商品的方式，每一枚贝壳币都是独一无二且不可替代的。\n\n你的运气不佳吗？ 现在是投资贝壳币的时候了！ 观察市场并大赚一笔！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60916,'Long has it been since anyone has ventured to this place.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'已经很久没有人敢来这个地方了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60917,'My kingdom has crumbled to dust, my subjects long gone, and my memories fading. But yet, I remain here, a haunting reminder of the greatness that once was. What brings you to my forgotten realm?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的王国已化为尘埃，我的臣民早已不复存在，我的记忆也在消逝。 但我仍然留在这里，令人难以忘怀地提醒我曾经的伟大。 是什么让你来到了我被遗忘的国度？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60924,'We Redbrand fought alongside the king in the War of Three Hammers ages ago. We hold a proud legacy and should not be judged lightly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'很久以前，我们红标在三锤之战中与国王并肩作战。 我们拥有令人自豪的遗产，不应该被轻视。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60925,'My name is Nazgrim Redbrand, Lord of the noble Redbrand family. The Redbrands have suffered many tragedies of late, with our namesake crumbling around us. I will not stand idly by and watch my family\'s legacy tarnished by misfortune.$B$BThe reputation of a dwarf means a great deal here in Khaz Modan, and so long as I stand as the head of the Redbrand family, I shall see its honor restored.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的名字是纳兹戈林·雷德布兰德，高贵的雷德布兰德家族的领主。 红标最近遭受了许多悲剧，我们的同名者在我们周围崩溃了。 我不会袖手旁观，看着我家族的遗产被不幸玷污。$B$B矮人的声誉在卡兹莫丹意义重大，只要我作为红标家族的族长，我就会看到它的命运。 荣誉恢复了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60926,'My job is to understand the enemy and to find their weak points.\n\nI could comment on the many flaws of Stormwind, but that is not why I am here.\n\nWhat is it I can do for you, $R?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的工作是了解敌人并找到他们的弱点。\n\n我可以评论暴风城的许多缺陷，但这不是我来这里的原因。\n\n我能为你做什么，$R？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60927,'Stormwind was kind enough to offer us accomodations and a place to hold our Embassy. I feel it will be quite a while until the two kingdoms see eye to eye to stand together.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'暴风城很友善地为我们提供了住宿和大使馆所在地。 我觉得这两个王国需要相当长的时间才能达成一致并站在一起。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60928,'This harbor ain\'t too shabby for fishing!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这个港口不太破旧，不适合钓鱼!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60929,'It can be difficult to control the rabble of sailors and the animosity between them and the marines.\n\n It is where Petty Officers like myself come in.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'控制水手和他们与海军之间的敌意可以很困难。\n\n这就是像我这样的下士要发挥作用的地方。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60930,'The Nation of Kul Tiras is generous to its loyal subjects and those that swear fealty to it.\n\nOur loyalties and dedication lay with the Kingdom of Lordaeron and the Old Alliance.\n\nWhere do your loyalties lay?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'库尔提拉斯国家对其忠诚的臣民和那些宣誓效忠的人非常慷慨。\n\n我们的忠诚和奉献属于洛丹伦王国和旧联盟。\n\n你的忠诚在哪里？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60931,'Stormwind isn\'t as bad as those in Boralus make it out to be.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'暴风城并不像伯拉勒斯的人们想象的那么糟糕。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60932,'You do not know the sheer pleasure of being able to stretch your legs on dry land after such a long expedition.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'您不知道经过这么长时间的探险后能够在陆地上舒展双腿的纯粹乐趣。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60933,'What can I do for you, mainlander?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我能为你做些什么，外来者？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60934,'I have been sent on behalf of the Lord Admiral to engage in diplomacy with our southern neighbors.\n\nI have been curious to see if the nobility here are true to the old ways, and to see what respect they hold for the fallen sister kingdoms to the north.\n\nIf Kul Tiras and Stormwind are to ever stand side-by-side then brutal truths must be laid out for all to understand bluntly.\n\nThere is no truces to be had with the Blackbloods, and no honor to be made standing alongside those that destroyed what once was.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我代表海军上将前来与我们的南方邻居进行外交接触。\n\n我一直很好奇这里的贵族是否忠于古老的传统，以及他们对北方已经倒下的姐妹王国的尊重。\n\n如果库尔提拉斯和暴风城要并肩而立，那么残酷的真相必须摆在所有人面前，以便直截了当地理解。\n\n与黑血部落不可能有停火，与那些摧毁了曾经的东西的人站在一起也不会有荣耀。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60935,'It is not often that I get to speak with a mainlander.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我很少有机会与外地人交谈。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60936,'The sea is harsh and filled with secrets. There is still more out there for us to explore, and more for expeditions to chart on maps.\n\nYou can count on us to find the unveiled places of this world.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'海洋是严酷的，充满了秘密。我们还有更多的地方要探索，更多的远征需要在地图上标注出来。\n\n你们可以相信我们会找到这个世界上未揭示的地方。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60937,'I haven\'t been to Stormwind in a long time. It\'s nice to see how much it has changed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我已经很久没有去过暴风城了。看到它变化了这么多真是不错。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60938,'You be standing on the Old Tide, ship of Kul Tiras, and I am the Deskmaster here.\n\nDo not cause me any issues on the boat, $C.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你站在库尔提拉斯的古老潮汐号船上，我是这里的船长。\n\n不要在船上给我惹麻烦，$C。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60945,'<The whelp looks at you curiously.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<幼龙好奇地看着你。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60946,'Mmrmmgl?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯嗯嗯？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60949,'We stand watch.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们守望。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60950,'Oh, the things I would do for a bottle of Dalaran Red...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，我愿意为一瓶达拉然红酒做任何事情...',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60951,'I hate this swamp.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我讨厌这片沼泽。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60955,'The desert be rife with opportunities, and chances to gain a little coin. I represent some interests across the ocean that are looking for rare and unique goods.\n\nPerhaps we can help each other out, aye?\n\nOh, and uh, if you\'re looking for some cheddar, I got a bunch of it, they took my letter way too seriously.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这片沙漠充满了机会，有机会赚点钱。我代表一些海外的利益，他们正在寻找稀有和独特的商品。\n\n也许我们可以互相帮助，是吧？\n\n哦，还有，如果你想找点芝士，我有很多，他们把我的信字面理解得太严重了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60956,'Hello there, and welcome to the Steamwheedle Art Museum, make yourself right at home, and enjoy a few fine works from the community.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'您好，欢迎来到热砂艺术博物馆，让您宾至如归，欣赏来自社区的一些精美作品。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60960,'Can you believe the luck, the only two shredders we had working out in this neck of the woods went and broke down!\n\nNow I\'m stuck here repairing with hardly any parts to speak of.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你能相信这运气吗，我们在这片树林里只有两台割碎机在工作，结果竟然都坏了！\n\n现在我被困在这里修理，几乎没有什么零件可言。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60961,'I got sent from Sparkwater to look after this place, We got a lot of projects on the go around here, and us technician\'s make sure all the parts keep in working order.\n\nAnyway, what can I do for you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我从火花港被派到这里来照看这个地方，我们这里有很多项目正在进行中，我们技术人员确保所有零件保持正常工作。\n\n不管怎样，我可以为你做些什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60962,'Boy howdy, have you ever seen anything so magnificient, so beautiful? This baby could blow a crater the size of Sparkwater wherever we light this fuse, and its my job to make sure we don\'t blow ourselves into smithereens!\n\nOh, I anticipate the day Nazz gives the thumbs up to use this thing, it\'ll be the greatest explosion ever seen on Azeroth!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哇哦，你见过这么壮丽、这么美丽的东西吗？只要我们点燃导火线，这家伙就能在火花港大小的地方炸出一个大坑，而我的工作就是确保我们不会炸成碎片！\n\n哦，我迫不及待地期待着纳兹点头批准使用这个东西的那一天，这将是艾泽拉斯上最壮观的爆炸！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60964,'This is the last place I thought I would end up, believe me, but the goblins spend well, and I have business here.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'相信我，这是我最不希望来的地方，但是地精付钱很多，而且我在这里有生意。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60967,'Move it on pal, before you get me angry.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'走开，伙计，别让我生气。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60968,'Hope you\'re enjoying the town, its much better to be working with the Durotar Labor Union then those goons at Venture Co.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'希望你喜欢这个城镇，与杜隆塔尔劳工联盟合作要比与风险投资公司的那些笨蛋们好多了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60969,'Welcome to Powder Town, hope you find whatever you\'re looking for here, or are just around to help out, make yourself comfortable.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到火药镇，希望你在这里找到你想要的东西，或者只是来帮忙的，随意舒适一下。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60970,'Why hello there, I got problems that need fixed, you look like someone that might be able to fix problems.\n\nPerhaps there is something we can do to help eachother out yeah?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，我有些问题需要解决，你看起来像是有能力解决问题的人。\n\n也许我们可以互相帮助，怎么样？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60972,'You help-help us yes? Bogpaw see that you help us with many problem-problem!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你帮助我们，是吗？泥爪看到你帮助我们解决了许多问题！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60973,'No cause-cause trouble or me cut you!\n\nMe cut good, me cut best!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不要惹麻烦，不然我会砍你！\n\n我砍得好，我砍得最好！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60976,'You there, yes yes, I come from swamp called Wetlands, you heard of yes yes?\n\nBig leader Gowlfang used to stay here, look for help help, but now he is fighting to become leader of Mosshide!\n\nI here to help guide people to him.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你在那里，是的是的，我来自一个叫做湿地的沼泽地，你听说过是吗是吗？\n\n大领袖高尔弗朗曾经在这里待过，寻求帮助，但现在他正在争夺莫什德部落的领袖地位！\n\n我在这里是来帮助引导人们去找他的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60990,'There is always adventure to be had, especially out in the far frontiers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'总是有冒险可寻，尤其是在遥远的前沿地区。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60991,'Welcome! Make yourself comfortable. We have plenty of ale and lodging should you need a rest.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎！随意安逸。如果你需要休息，我们有充足的啤酒和住宿。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60993,'I\'ve known Whitepeak ever since my time serving Ironforge.\n\nI\'m certain he could use my experience and expertise out here, especially so far from home.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我从在铁炉堡服役的时候就认识怀特峰了。\n\n我相信他需要我的经验和专业知识，尤其是在离家这么远的地方。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60994,'We are far in hostile territory, practically surrounded by enemies. It is best to keep our whits about us and be ready for a fight.\n\nAre you looking to assist us here in Bael Hardul?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n我们处在敌对领土深处，几乎被敌人包围。最好保持警惕，随时准备战斗。\n\n你打算在巴尔哈杜尔这里帮助我们吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60996,'Kalimdor is surely to be full of rich and rare minerals that we don\'t often see on the Eastern Kingdoms and I\'m sure of it, I just need to find what I\'m looking for, that\'s all.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'卡利姆多肯定充满了我们在东部王国很少见到的丰富和珍稀矿物，我确信，我只是需要找到我在寻找的东西，就这样。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60997,'Welcome to Bael Hardul, this place was left here from the time of the Third War.\n\nUs dwarves contributed to help the Alliance during those times, battling against orc and demon alike until the unification and the battle at Mount Hyjal.\n\nThis place was left abandoned, we\'ve only just recently arrived to call it home for our future expeditions.\n\nWe could certainly use the help if you\'re willing to offer assistance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到贝尔哈杜尔，这个地方是第三次战争时期留下的。\n\n在那段时间里，我们矮人为帮助联盟做出了贡献，与兽人和恶魔作战，直到统一和海加尔山之战。\n\n这个地方被遗弃了，我们最近才到达，为我们未来的探险称之为家。\n\n如果您愿意提供帮助，我们当然可以使用该帮助。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60998,'I am an emissary from Stonetalon Peak, and something of a guide to help Whitepeak and his kin traverse these lands without disturbing the natural order.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是来自石爪峰的使者，也是一名向导，帮助白峰和他的亲属在不扰乱自然秩序的情况下穿越这些土地。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(60999,'I\'ve never been this far west! I\'m eager to try some of my long-delayed experiments now that I am free from scrutiny.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我从未来到过这么远的西方！我迫不及待地想要尝试一些我长时间以来被搁置的实验，现在我可以摆脱审查了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61000,'The life of an engineer, I thought I would be doing invention, but I mostly am a glorified mechanic helping fix broken devices and machinery.\n\nOh well, atleast I\'m working with tools.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'工程师的生活，我以为我会从事发明创造，但我大多数时间只是一个被吹嘘的机械师，帮助修复损坏的装置和机械。\n\n哦，不过至少我在使用工具。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61001,'Do you know how long that farm took to fertilize?!\n\n<The dwarf is visibly upset.>\n\nAll that preparation just for some vultures to come and ruin everything.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你知道那块农田花了多长时间来施肥吗？！\n\n<矮人显然很生气。>\n\n所有的准备工作只是为了一些秃鹫来破坏一切。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61004,'The Explorers\' League is always looking for help, we are often stretched too thin to carry out our motivations and goals.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'探索者联盟一直在寻求帮助，我们常常捉襟见肘，无法实现我们的动机和目标。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61006,'The skies be calling my name but I can\'t be answering!\n\nThe bloody flying machine went and broke down, and now I\'m grounded like the rest of the peasantry.\n\nYou know a thing about Gyrocranked Fizz-wobbled engines?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'天空在呼唤我的名字，但我却无法回应！\n\n该死的飞行器失事了，现在我和其他农民一样被禁足了。\n\n你知道旋翼式嘶嘶声发动机吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61008,'Why hello there. Is there anything I can do for you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好。有什么我可以帮助你的吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61009,'I wouldn\'t mess with the Redbrand if I were ye.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果我是你，我可不会惹上红带团伙。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61010,'Ours is a rich history, full of distinction and honor. We once served as the right hand to the Bronzebeards, but there have been many unfortunate incidents within the past few generations.$B$BI have been looking for assistance in collecting a number of our lost chronicles. Perhaps you could be of help?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们的历史悠久，充满荣誉和荣耀。 我们曾经是铜须的得力助手，但在过去的几代人中发生了许多不幸的事件。$B$BI一直在寻求帮助来收集我们丢失的一些编年史。 也许你能帮上忙？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61011,'I have been chosen as a champion of the Redbrands, to defend their kin and fight on their behalf.$B$BI suggest you do not cross them, $C.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我被选为红带团伙的勇士，为了保卫他们的同族并代表他们战斗。$B$B我建议你不要招惹他们，$C。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61012,'I am solemnly sworn to defend the interests of my lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我庄严宣誓，捍卫我主的利益。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61013,'The south isn\'t so bad after all. Good ale, and a chance to stretch my weary sea legs from the long journey.\n\nWhat can I do for you, mainlander?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'南方其实还不错。好酒，还有机会伸展一下长途旅行中疲惫的海腿。\n\n我能为你做些什么，外地人？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61014,'<Sailor Capewind looks over you curiously.>\n\nIs there something you need, or are you just intrigued by the tabard?\n\nNever seen an islander before?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<水手卡普温德好奇地看着你。>\n\n有什么你需要的，还是你只是对外域人的战袍感兴趣？\n\n以前没见过外域人吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61015,'All this money I\'ve saved up; no better time to spend it than right now, aye?\"\n\n<Sailor Brewen laughs.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这些钱都是我存起来的； 没有比现在更好的时间了，是吗？”\n\n<水手布鲁文笑了。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61016,'You better back off before we have a problem, understood?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你最好退后，免得我们出现问题，明白吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61017,'The ambitions and desires of Kul Tiras are a complicated matter. Our goal here is to determine the true value of these southerners and to see if mainlanders can be trusted.\n\nShould the nobility of Stormwind prove themselves loyal to the old ways and old causes, then perhaps there may be a future of cooperation.\n\nWe shall see where the heart of Stormwind is rightly at.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'库尔提拉斯的抱负和愿望是一件复杂的事情。我们在这里的目标是确定这些南方人的真正价值，看看外域人是否值得信任。\n\n如果暴风城的贵族能够证明自己忠于古老的方式和古老的目标，也许合作的未来是可能的。\n\n我们将看看暴风城的心在何处。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61019,'I drift in and out of reality, and I fear I will not remain long, you must assist me before I depart for good.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我在现实和虚幻之间游离，我害怕我不能久留，你必须在我彻底离开之前帮助我。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61024,'Slackers! All of them! Back in my day it was a priviledge to work with that kind of firepower. Kids these da-\n\n<Nazz turns his attention towards you.>\n\nHey kid. Welcome to Powder Town! Came to rest? Then stay for the thrill! These idiotic \"Engineers\" Nert provided could make us blow at any minute!\n\nAnyway Got some work around for you if you like getting your hands dirty for coin. Why else would you come to Powder Town?!\n\nOh, and don\'t worry about making yourself useful, just stay and visit. You wouldn\'t be the first anyway.\n\nNOW BEAT IT!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'懒鬼！全都是懒鬼！在我年轻的时候，有机会使用那种火力是一种特权。现在的小孩们...\n\n<纳兹将注意力转向了你。>\n\n嘿，小伙子。欢迎来到火药镇！是来休息的吗？那就留下来感受一下刺激吧！这些白痴“工程师”尼尔特提供的家伙随时可能让我们爆炸！\n\n不过，如果你愿意为了金币弄脏手的话，我这里有些工作可以做。你还有其他理由来火药镇吗？\n\n哦，别担心要发挥作用，只是留下来逛逛。你也不会是第一个。\n\n现在走开！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61026,'Water breaks upon the shore and battle draws near, you can feel it within the air, can you not young one?\n\nOur enemy has the audacity to rebuff their strength and challenge the might of the Horde head on.\n\nWar calls us, and it is up to each and every member of the Horde to answer it, will you take up the axe and defend your homeland?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'海浪冲击着岸边，战斗即将来临，你能感受到空气中的氛围吗，年轻人？\n\n我们的敌人竟然有胆量拒绝他们的力量，直接挑战部落的威严。\n\n战争在召唤我们，每个部落成员都需要回应，你会拿起战斧，捍卫家园吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61040,'<The centaur lady stares menacingly, arms folded, and tail swishing.>\n\nWho are you to speak to me? Did Warug send you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<那名半人马女子威胁地盯着你，双臂交叉，尾巴摇摆。>\n\n你算什么东西，居然敢跟我说话？是瓦鲁格派你来的吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61041,'<Dekshar stares with wild eyes.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<德克夏用狂野的目光盯着你。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61044,'<The elderly centaur raises his head to speak to you.>\n\nYou are not of our tribe, yet you walk among us. What brings you here?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<那位年迈的半人马抬起头与你交谈。>\n\n你并非我们部落的人，却在我们中间行走。你来这里有何事？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61045,'We are always under the threat of war, we must task ourselves for conflict, unless we be trampled like the many tribes before us.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们始终面临战争的威胁，我们必须为冲突做好准备，否则我们将像之前的许多部落一样被践踏。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61050,'<Daron looks somewhat confused by your presence.>\n\nNot often that we get outsiders, not in many years truthfully.\n\nWelcome either way, you need something?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<达隆对你的出现感到有些困惑。>\n\n我们很少有外来者，实际上已经很多年了。\n\n无论如何，欢迎你。你需要什么吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61051,'What can I do for you $R?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我能为您做些什么，$R？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61052,'Watch yourself buddy.\n\nWhat do you want?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n小心点，伙计。\n\n你想要什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61053,'You walk with your eyes open, $r, but do you truly see? Have you taken a moment to appreciate the world around you recently?\n\nThe lifted leaves on the wind, the fervent waves of the sea, the bustling pace in the city. There is majesty all around you, even in times of war, and there are always things to appreciate.\n\nNow...how about a drink?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你用着睁开的双眼行走，$r，但你真正看到了吗？最近你是否花时间欣赏周围的世界？\n\n风中飘动的树叶，汹涌的海浪，城市里的繁忙节奏。你周围都是壮丽的景色，即使在战争时期也是如此，总有值得欣赏的事物。\n\n那么...要来一杯喝的吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61057,'Well, we\'re sure off course, took a wrong turn and ended up here.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们肯定偏离了航线，拐错了弯，最后到了这里。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61060,'Gizzin doesn\'t have the best sense of directions...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'吉津并不是个方向感特别好的人...',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61063,'There is always to be a battle had in the good of nature, It is up to all of us to champion for it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'为了大自然的美好，总会有一场战斗，我们所有人都应该为之奋斗。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61064,'Greetings, the Kirin Tor welcomes all who wish to grow our knowledge on the arcane.\n\nIs there anything I can do for you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，肯瑞托欢迎所有愿意增长我们关于奥术知识的人。\n\n有什么我可以为你做的吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61065,'There is always work to be done, we hope for a day when Dalaran is fully restored.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'工作总是不会断的，我们希望有一天达拉然能够完全恢复。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61070,'Hola cariño, pareces que has tenido un día difícil ¿Qué tal un caramelito de menta? ¡Porque te canta el aliento!\n\nVamos, quédate un rato y cuéntale todo a Dorothea.\n\nHey sweetie, you look like you\'ve had a rough day. How about a mint? Because your breath strinks!\n\nCome on, stay a while and tell Dorothea all about it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗨，亲爱的，你看起来今天过得很艰难？来块薄荷糖怎么样？ 因为你的呼吸在为你歌唱！\n\n来吧，呆一会儿，把一切都告诉多萝西娅。\n\n嘿，亲爱的，你看起来今天过得很艰难。 薄荷怎么样？ 因为你的呼吸很臭！\n\n来吧，呆一会儿，告诉多萝西娅一切',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61100,'Hmm, just a bit more residue to mix with the roots could potentially... Perhaps altering the growth of the tree itself-\n\nCan\'t you see that I am a bit busy, I am nearly on the cusp of a breakthrough to something magnificent can\'t you see?\n\nThe secret of the Gargantuan Banana is at my finger tips, now unless you\'re here to help move along.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯，多一点残留物与根部混合可能会......也许会改变树本身的生长-\n\n你没看到我有点忙吗？我即将取得重大突破，你没看到吗？\n\n巨型香蕉的秘密就在我的指尖，除非你是来帮忙的，否则请让我继续。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61101,'You\'re sure far out, sorry if you were sent here and welcome if you came on your own accord!\n\nMy name is Bixxle, been managing this Storehouse for quite a while now. This used to be one of the primary locations of Banana collecting a while ago, but now its sort of all gone to hell.\n\nApes, monkeys, and snakes have been causing all sorts of issues, but I don\'t need to tell you that, you\'ve seen em by now!\n\nPerhaps you can help us out with some things around here, we could certainly use it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Y您肯定在很远的地方，如果您被派到这里，我们深表歉意；如果您自愿来到这里，欢迎您！\n\n我叫比克斯，管理这个仓库已经有一段时间了。 不久前这里曾经是香蕉采集的主要地点之一，但现在一切都变了。\n\n猿、猴子和蛇造成了各种各样的问题，但我不需要告诉你，你现在已经见过它们了！\n\n也许你可以帮助我们解决这里的一些问题，我们当然需要帮助。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61102,'You one of those adventurers? If so, you\'re just what I\'m lookin\' for. We\'ve had so many problems, and everything has collapsed. I got more dead employees than I do bananas, do you UNDERSTAND?!\n\n<Baron Telraz takes a moment, clearing his throat.>\n\nApologies about that, a goblin can get quite upset about the loss of so much capital and gold. Time is money, but on Tel\'Abim, time is losing money.\n\nSuch a calamity must be reversed before all of the investments here turn to nothing. I am telling you, a goblin is worth his gold, and I am not returning to Kezan with a few bananas in my pocket.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你是那些冒险家之一吗？如果是的话，你正是我在找的人。我们遇到了很多问题，一切都崩溃了。 我死去的员工比香蕉还多，你明白吗？！\n\n<巴隆·特拉兹稍作停顿，清了清嗓子。>\n\n抱歉，一个地精在失去这么多资本和金子的时候会感到非常沮丧，时间就是金钱，但在特尔阿比姆，时间等于是在亏钱。\n\n这样的灾难必须被扭转，否则这里所有的投资都会化为乌有，我告诉你，地精的价值如同他的黄金，我可不打算带着几个香蕉回到科赞。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61105,'Don\'t cause any trouble around here, I got enough problem with all the apes running around lately.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'别在这附近惹麻烦，最近所有的猩猩都在到处乱跑，我已经受够了麻烦了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61106,'Well you sure are far out from the Basecamp bub, not everyone comes all the way out to the Storehouse these days.\n\nI hope you weren\'t assigned to this heaping dung pile.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯，伙计，你离营地确实有些远了，现在不是每个人都会走到仓库这里来。\n\n我希望你不是被派来处理这个堆积如山的粪坑的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61108,'Goblin Machinery, intricate parts and haphazard design. It certainly leads to spectacular breakdowns, which is what keeps engineers like myself in business.\n\nSo, what\'ll it be?\n\nYou better not be here for Shredder repairs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'地精机械，错综复杂的零件和杂乱的设计。这无疑会导致严重的故障，正是这些故障让像我这样的工程师有了生意。\n\n那么，你要办点什么事？\n\n你最好不是来修理粉碎机的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61109,'The sun sure is hot, huh?  I\'m in charge of the water and the refreshments around here, so you should be on your best behavior. Understood?\n\nOtherwise, you can get your drinks from the ocean!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'太阳真的很热，不是吗？我负责这里的水和饮料，所以你应该表现得很好，明白吗？\n\n否则的话，你就只能喝海水了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61110,'Welcome to the inn here at the Tel Co. Basecamp, we are monkey free and very affordable. Please, do make yourself comfortable.\n\nAlso, I just want to dispel floating rumors that have been going around. There were no monkey attacks at this establishment. NONE AT ALL. A roving band of monkeys did NOT break in at the late hours of the night, cause a ruckus, and attack innocent patrons.\n\nIf it does happen though, we offer a free night\'s stay.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到特尔公司营地的旅馆，我们没有猴子，价格非常实惠，请放心入住。\n\n另外，我想澄清一些流传的谣言。这里没有发生过猴子袭击事件，完全没有。一群流浪的猴子并没有在深夜闯入，制造骚动并袭击无辜的顾客。\n\n但如果真的发生了，我们提供一晚免费住宿。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61111,'Nokrot thinks he\'s all special, but I am the one that provides him with the water he loves to wave around.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'诺克洛特以为自己很特别，但正是我为他提供了他喜欢挥舞的水',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61112,'Listen here pal, sometimes you need to think outside of the box. I spent many of my days working with boring strider meat in Ratchet, and if I ever wanna make it big with a bigshot name back in Kezan, I need to use some innovation.\n\nA goblins best trait is cunning, and thinking, you see? A big brain needs big ideas and what better way to think out of the box then Tel\'abim? Bananas are the secret kid, I\'m tellin\' ya, just the right spice, the right ingredients, and it\'ll hit big.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'听着，伙计，有时候你需要跳出固定思维。我在棘齿城的日子大多都在处理乏味的陆行鸟肉，如果我想在科赞成为一个大人物，我就得用点创新。\n\n一个地精最好的特质就是狡猾和思考，你懂吗？一个聪明的大脑需要伟大的创意，而什么比泰阿毕姆更适合突破传统思维呢？香蕉才是关键，我告诉你，只需恰到好处的调味，适宜的配料，就会大受欢迎。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61113,'These apes need a lesson in discipline, its about time we hit them back, and hit hard. It isn\'t all bashing though, sometimes you need strategy, and O\'ggon certainly helps when strategy doesn\'t work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这些猿类需要纪律方面的教训，是时候我们反击它们了，而且要狠狠地反击。 不过，这并不全是抨击，有时你需要策略，而当策略不起作用时，奥贡肯定会提供帮助。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61116,'What do you want? If I were you, I wouldn\'t be sticking my nose where it didn\'t belong.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你想要什么？如果我是你，我可不会在不该管的地方多管闲事。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61117,'Yo $r, ever wondering what\'s hiding beneath your feet? What bounty we can claim from lost cultures? Perhaps we could find out together.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，$r，你是否曾好奇地想过你脚下隐藏着什么？我们可以从失落的文化中获得什么宝藏？也许我们可以一起去探寻。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61121,'Welcome to Icepaw Village. The others will treat you with kindness in these lands.\n\nLet us join together to enjoy this Winter Veil, and perhaps spread some of the foreign food around, yes?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到冰爪村。在这片土地上，其他人会以友善的态度对待你。\n\n让我们一起享受这个冬幕节，并可能分享一些外来的食物，好吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61122,'The snow is fresh, and the air is cool. For us Icepaw, the time begins to start our festivities, and to celebrate an end to another year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'雪是新鲜的，空气很凉爽。对于我们冰爪部落来说，现在是开始庆祝活动，庆祝又一年的结束的时候了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61125,'I hope the others like my presents!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我希望其他人会喜欢我的礼物！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61126,'You friend with monkey, you friend with Ebu? Ebu like friend, you help, yes?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你是猴子的朋友，也是伊布的朋友？伊布喜欢朋友，你帮忙，对吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61136,'I am not that scary. Don\'t be afraid to say hello. The other yetis give us all a bad name.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我并不可怕。不要害怕跟我打个招呼。其他雪人给我们都带来了坏名声。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61137,'I must admit, I was not expecting company. I decided to live here for such a reason infact, I enjoy being alone these days, for I have seen a lot. It has been quite a while since someone has bothered to pay me a visit, what brings you to my lonely estate tucked away within the mountain?\n\nIf you come here asking for coin, I must apologize ahead of time, I have none.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我必须承认，我没有预料到有客人来访。事实上，我就是为了这个原因才决定在这里生活的，我喜欢现在一个人呆着，因为我见过很多。已经有很长一段时间没有人来打扰我了，你是怎么来到我这个隐藏在山里的孤寂住所的呢？\n\n如果你是为了要钱而来，我提前向你道歉，我没有。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61142,'The tensions have grown in Forest Song, I feel it is only a matter of time until things get out of hand.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'森林之歌的紧张局势正在加剧，我感觉事情只是时间问题，很快就会失控。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61143,'Why hello there outsider, and welcome to Forest Song.\n\nThis place was once a tranquil glade of our past, though now it is simply ruins. We are doing our part here to maintain the area, and to combat the Warsong Clan from gaining more of a foothold within our sacred forests. They have a lot of tenacity, and vigor, especially for Greenskins, and must be put to an end.\n\nPerhaps you can assist us, for we have many troubles, both inside, and outside.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗨，外来者，欢迎来到森林之歌。\n\n这个地方曾经是我们过去宁静的林地，不过现在只剩下废墟了。我们在这里努力维护这片地区，抵制战歌氏族在我们神圣的森林中扩大势力。他们有很强的韧性和活力，特别是对于绿皮族，必须结束他们。\n\n也许你可以帮助我们，因为我们内外都有许多问题。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61145,'This sacred forest yearns for reprieve from the outside forces that gnaw away at its roots.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这片神圣的森林渴望远离那些不断侵蚀它根基的外部力量。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61146,'The Kaldorei have offered me sanctuary, I have lived here for a long time, the added protection from the rest of nature is a warm welcome.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'卡多雷为我提供了庇护，我在这里生活了很长时间，来自大自然的额外保护是一种热烈的欢迎。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61147,'An outsider, why hello.\n\nThis glade was once revered by many druids before the Third War, it is here we communed with nature and the spirits of the forest itself. As of late, the orcs have disturbed this place of sanctuary, the burden now lays on our shoulders to help restore this place.\n\nNo doubt you have seen sentinels about, they have also added to the growing headache that is Forest Song as of late.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'外来者，你好。\n\n在第三次战争之前，这片林地曾受到许多德鲁伊的崇敬，我们在这里与大自然以及森林本身的精灵交流。最近，兽人扰乱了这片避难之地，现在我们肩负起恢复这个地方的重担。\n\n毫无疑问，你肯定看到了哨兵在周围，他们也在最近加剧了森林之歌这个越来越令人头疼的问题。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61149,'You stand before a great hero of the forest friend, do not disrespect the land in which you walk. Ethwyr, the treant before us sacrificed himself for the greater good of felwood. You can see the greenery, and the life all around you, it is a miracle, especially in these cursed lands.\n\nPerhaps we can learn more about his secrets, and unlock the very cleansing of the forest itself, that is why I am here.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'朋友，你站在一位伟大的森林英雄面前，请不要不尊重你所踏足的土地。在我们面前的树人艾思维尔为费伍德的伟大利益而献身。你可以看到周围的绿意和生机，这真是一个奇迹，特别是在这些受诅咒的土地上。\n\n也许我们可以更多地了解他的秘密，并解锁森林本身的净化，这就是我来到这里的原因。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61150,'This land was not always like this, there were many boroughs and towns all around the forest.\n\nIt is a shame to see what has become of this place, the corruption of the demonic invasion not long ago has scarred this land, we must do our best to combat it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这片土地并不总是这个样子，过去森林周围有许多区域和城镇。\n\n看到这个地方变成了什么样子真是可惜，不久前恶魔入侵的腐败已经让这片土地伤痕累累，我们必须竭尽全力与之抗争。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61151,'The wilds are fascinating, are they not? Nature has always been a mysterious guardian, with many secrets for us to uncover, and protect.\n\nMy name is Calaran, what is it you seek here friend?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'荒野是不是很迷人？大自然一直是一个神秘的守护者，有许多秘密等待我们去揭示和保护。\n\n我叫卡拉兰，朋友，你在这里寻找什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61157,'Nibu looks at you curiously.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'尼布好奇地看着你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61158,'The Matron said I get to sit on Greatfather Winter\'s lap and ask him for a gift! I really would like to get my mommy back.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'大主母说我可以坐在冬天老人的膝盖上，向他要一个礼物！我真的想把我的妈妈找回来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61159,'I\'m going to ask for a big mace! The Matron told me stories about this prince in Lordaeron that was a great paladin, I aspire to be like him!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我要要一个大狼牙棒！大主母给我讲过一个关于洛丹伦的王子的故事，他是个伟大的圣骑士，我渴望成为像他一样的人！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61160,'I\'m going to ask Greatfather Winter for a totem. I wanna become a shaman just like our Warchief. For the Horde!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我要向冬天老人要一个图腾。我想要成为像我们的部落酋长一样的萨满。为了部落！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61161,'Lok\'tar! Zoki, the strongest warrior of the Horde welcomes you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'洛克塔！部落最强大的战士佐基欢迎你！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61168,'The Spirit gazes long into your soul, it is cold, and unwavering.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这灵魂长久地凝视着你的灵魂，它是冷酷而坚定的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61169,'The hulking Ancient creaks as it looks upon you. You sense a caring soul being housed within the wooden mass. It urges you to move on as it seems to have a duty.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'庞大的古树发出吱吱声，当它注视着你时。你感觉到一个充满关怀的灵魂寄宿在这木质的块体中。它敦促你继续前行，似乎有一种使命在身。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61170,'Father Bear turns to look at you for a moment before opening his mouth and speaking.>\n\nYoung one, these are dire times but remember that in the darkness there is always hope. I have brought succor to many of the bears, and yet so many have fallen to corruption. Watch yourself in these lands.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'父熊转过身来，看了你一会儿，然后开口说道：\n\n年轻人，这是可怕的时代，但要记住，在黑暗中总是有希望的。我已经给许多熊带来了帮助，然而还有很多被腐化所摧毁。在这片土地上要小心自己。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61171,'Greatfather Winter stares at you with an appreciative gaze, but his mind is clearly focused on something else. He urges you to move on with a kind fatherly gaze.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'冬天老人用欣赏的目光凝视着你，但他的思绪显然集中在其他事情上。他以慈父般的目光催促你继续前行。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61172,'The massive Kodo stares at you for a moment before speaking in a kind fatherly tone>\n\nWinter is coming young one, you\'d best seek a warm place. I have guided tribes for generations and must continue to do so. I must depart now, I hope you will find succor in the darkness, may the Earthmother guide you to greener pastures.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'巨大的科多兽看着你片刻，然后用一种慈父般的语调说道：\n\n冬天即将来临，年轻人，你最好去找一个温暖的地方。我已经引导了几代部落，必须继续这么做。我现在必须离开，希望你能在黑暗中找到帮助，愿大地之母引导你走向更美好的草原。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61173,'Lok\'tar! Merry Winter Veil to you little $Gboy:girl;!\n\nThere is free food and lots of merriment courtesy of Smokywood Pastures!\n\nMake sure you have a splendid time... And no you may not sit on my lap.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'洛克塔！祝你度过一个愉快的冬幕节，小朋友！\n\n这里有免费的食物和许多欢乐，都是由烟木牧场提供的！\n\n确保你玩得愉快……但你不能坐在我膝盖上。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61174,'Do not be alarmed mon. Not all Frostmane are on da warpath, we be here to celebrate.\n\nSome of us seek peace. Our tribe has suffered much, we\'re just here to celebrate the Great Spirit of Winter\'s bounty.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不要惊慌，朋友。并不是所有霜鬃部族的人都在为战而来，我们是来这里庆祝的。\n\n我们中的一些人寻求和平。我们的部落遭受了很多苦难，我们只是来这里庆祝冬天伟大精神的丰收。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61175,'Do not be alarmed mon. Not all Frostmane are on da warpath, we be here to celebrate.\n\nSome of us seek peace. Our tribe has suffered much, we\'re just here to celebrate the Great Spirit of Winter\'s bounty.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不要惊慌，朋友。并不是所有霜鬃部族的人都在为战而来，我们是来这里庆祝的。\n\n我们中的一些人寻求和平。我们的部落遭受了很多苦难，我们只是来这里庆祝冬天伟大精神的丰收。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61177,'Greetings Mon, ya wish to hear about the Great Spirit of Winter? It is he that ushers in the season, and brings it time for our season. The time for hunting, the time for gathering.\n\nOnce the season arrives we hold a celebration. Sacrifices, dances, rituals, and a great feast. We celebrate our survival, the changing of the season, and the end of another year on this world mon.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'亲爱的，朋友。你想听关于冬季伟大精神的故事吗？他引导着季节的到来，带来我们的时节。狩猎的时节，收获的时节。\n\n一旦时节来临，我们会举行庆祝活动。祭品、舞蹈、仪式和盛宴。我们庆祝生存，庆祝季节的更替，庆祝这个世界上又一年的结束，朋友。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61178,'You wish to know about Greatfather Winter? Ah I apologize, perhaps you should speak to Storyteller Tylekinah. These are legends my people moved past, and what little I know of our ancestral beliefs tied to this tradition comes from her. I am merely here for the merriment and to share stories.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你想了解冬天老人吗？ 啊，抱歉，也许你应该和说书人泰莉基娜谈谈。 这些都是我的人民已经过去的传说，而我对与这一传统相关的祖先信仰的了解却来自于她。 我来这里只是为了欢乐和分享故事。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61179,'The term \"Winter Veil\" is said to stem from an ancestral figure known as Greatfather Winter. As he would walk the land late in the seasons, winter itself would be his billowing cloak. In his wake was the blanketing of the land in snow, and thus it is said that Greatfather Winter would cast his wintry veil over the land.\n\nAs Greatfather Winter walked the land, it is said he would provide a bounty for those who welcomed his presence. Though parts of Azeroth may lie in snow, it gives the land time for rebirth and renewal. As such, the idea of feasting during the winter veil would bring together communities as they shared whatever they had. Typically, a single day of merriment and feasting welcomed the change, all in anticipation of the land\'s renewal.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'“冬幕节”一词据说源自一个古老的人物，他被称为冬天老人。当他在季节末期走遍大地时，冬天本身就成了他飘逸的斗篷。在他的脚步之后，大地被雪覆盖，因此据说冬天老人会在大地上投下他的冬季面纱。\n\n据说，当冬天老人行走在大地上时，他会为那些欢迎他到来的人提供丰富的恩赐。尽管艾泽拉斯的部分地区可能被雪覆盖，但这给了大地重新诞生和更新的时间。因此，在冬幕节期间举行盛宴会让社区团结在一起，共享他们所拥有的一切。通常，在一个愉快和宴会的日子里欢迎这个变化，都是为了期待大地的更新。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61180,'You wish to learn about our interpretation of the legend of Greatfather Winter eh?\n\nWell there\'s not much to say, we believe he is a kind old gentleman who delivers presents. It\'s never been a cultural legend as it has been for the other races, but we do share in the reveling. Plus I got some good tales from my days in the army.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你想了解我们对冬天老人传说的解读吗？\n\n嗯，没什么好说的，我们相信他是一位慈祥的老绅士，会送礼物。这在我们部族中从未成为一种文化传统，但我们确实会一起庆祝。此外，我在军队时有一些有趣的故事。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61181,'Hm you wish to know about Great-father Winter? Well, in our culture... There is none. As you may know we Orcs come from another world, we do not have our own analogous story to this.\n\nAll we know is the Great-father Winter that entertains children. Greklor has quite taken to the role. Ah but never use his name before him, all the children believe he is Great-father Winter, and that\'s how it should be. I do have some good stories from Draenor to trade though.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯，你想了解关于冬天老人的事情吗？嗯，在我们的文化中……并没有类似的传说。你可能知道，我们兽人来自另一个世界，我们没有自己类似的故事。\n\n我们所知道的只是那个娱乐儿童的冬天老人。格雷克洛尔已经完全扮演了这个角色。啊，但永远不要在他面前提他的名字，所有的孩子都相信他是冬天老人，事情应该是这样的。不过，我在德拉诺有一些有趣的故事可以交换。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61182,'Ah, you wish to hear about the Ancient of Winter? I come from Starfall Village located in Winterspring. It is exceptionally cold, and we are isolated from others. It is our duty to tend to the sleeping druids who must commune with the spirits of the land, even in such a cold place. During the winter the land becomes unbearably cold and harsh, even for us.\n\nThat is when we are visited by the great Ancient. The Ancient speaks to the druids in their dreams, helping them find what we need to survive. In turn we honor the Ancient with a celebration and a feast. It is thanks to the Ancient that the druids are kept safe, and a time of great renewal follows the cold winter months.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'啊，你想听听关于冬天之神的事情吗？我来自位于冬泉谷的星辰村。那里异常寒冷，我们与外界隔绝。我们的责任是照顾那些必须与大地的精灵交流的沉睡德鲁伊，即使在如此寒冷的地方。在冬天，这片土地变得异常寒冷和恶劣，即使对于我们来说也是如此。\n\n就在那个时候，我们会被伟大的冬天之神所拜访。冬天之神在德鲁伊的梦境中与他们交谈，帮助他们找到我们生存所需的东西。作为回报，我们用庆祝和盛宴来向冬天之神表示敬意。正是因为有了冬天之神，德鲁伊们才能保持安全，寒冷的冬季过后将是伟大的更新时期。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61183,'You wanna know about da ice Loa?  da, the reason for Trolls to partake? Then ya ask da Frostmane. We come from warm lands, with different Loa, each tribe be having its own traditions.\n\nWe respect all Loa, so I be here to pay my respect and enjoy the feasting and tales.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你想知道冰雪之神吗？是的，是巫毒巨魔参与的原因？那你应该去问问霜鬃。我们来自温暖的土地，有着不同的神祇，每个部落都有自己的传统。\n\n我们尊重所有的神祇，所以我在这里来表示敬意，享受盛宴和故事。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61184,'One of our oldest stories speak of the Earthmother\'s oldest son, the Winter Patriarch. As the leaves fall and the days become short, he will arrive. He brings with him great herds of game, but in turn also brings the cold and long nights.\n\nOur tribes spend these times huddled together around a fire, telling our ancestral stories while feasting. Game is difficult to hunt in these times, so we always pray to the Patriarch for a blessing that we may survive. Once the cold and gloom gives way to spring, the Patriarch departs, returning to his slumber as the land can provide for us. Only awakening once more when he is needed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们最古老的故事之一讲述了大地之母的最年长的儿子，冬季族长。随着叶子的飘落和白昼的缩短，他将到来。他带来了大批的野生动物，但同时也带来了寒冷和漫长的夜晚。\n\n我们的部族在这段时间里聚集在篝火旁，一边用餐一边讲述我们的祖先故事。在这段时间里，狩猎野生动物很困难，所以我们总是祈祷族长赐福，以便我们能够生存下来。当寒冷和阴暗让位于春天时，族长就会离开，当土地能够供养我们时，他就会回到沉睡中。只有在需要时再次苏醒。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61185,'I do not have any stories that will interest you. Ask Brandon.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我没有任何会吸引你兴趣的故事。去问问布兰登吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61186,'When it gets cold, it kinda sucks to be alone and empty stomached, yeah? How about spendin\' time with friends!\n\nGreat-father Winter has the solution. In collaboration with Smokywood Pastures, for a negligible fee he will bring wonderful presents and foodstuff, yeah? So it is a merry time of the year. Indulge and surprise each other with exotic toys, presents, and delicious food after playin\' in the snow!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'当天气变冷时，孤单和空腹真的很糟糕，对吧？不如与朋友们共度时光！\n\n冬天老人有解决办法。与烟木牧场合作，以微不足道的费用，他会带来美妙的礼物和食品，对吧？所以这是一年中愉快的时光。在雪地里玩耍后，用异国情调的玩具、礼物和美味食物彼此宠爱和惊喜吧！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61187,'Humm... When the cold sets over the land, it is said Father Bear will arrive and usher in the great sleep. Food becomes scarce, the nights long, and the cold reigns.\n\nFather Bear\'s arrival culminates in a huge feast after which many of us will enter a deep slumber, only awakening at the end of winter, when it is said that Father Bear departs. The forest and land blooms with life, food is abundant and a new renewal is upon us. Thus we celebrate this season and feast before we slumber.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯… 当寒冷笼罩大地时，据说熊爸爸将会到来，迎来酣睡。 食物变得稀缺，夜晚漫长，寒冷笼罩。\n\n熊爸爸的到来在一个巨大的盛宴中达到高潮，之后我们中的许多人会进入深度的沉睡，直到冬天结束，据说父熊离开。森林和大地充满了生机，食物丰富，新的更新来临。因此，在我们入睡之前，我们庆祝这个季节，举行盛宴。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61188,'Wanna know about Greatfather Winter? Heh, well our stories are similar to the Dwarven one except he rides in a Sled pulled by a huge Gyrocopter armed with missiles! You\'d probably better ask Henning if you want the details, but remember! The real one rides a sled pulled by a Gyrocopter with missiles!.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'想知道关于冬天老人的故事吗？呵，嗯，我们的故事与矮人的故事类似，只是他乘坐着一辆由巨大的巨大旋翼机拉着的雪橇，上面还装备着导弹！如果你想要了解详细情况，最好还是问问亨宁，但要记住！真正的冬天老人是坐在由陀螺机拉着的雪橇上的！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61189,'Hello to you $r! I am a scholar tasked with studying the legends surrounding these festivities. Don\'t you find it peculiar how so many separate cultures have a similar figure?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好$r！ 我是一个负责研究有关这些庆典传说的学者。 这么多不同的文化都有相似的形象，你不觉得很奇怪吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61190,'Looking for wares from across the south seas are ye?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你在寻找来自南海的货物吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61191,'Yet, prisoners they are, good King.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'然而，他们是囚犯，善良的国王。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61192,'Humanity is in peril! The tides of darkness have come again, and the whole world is poised upon the brink of war.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'人类正处于危险之中！黑暗的潮水再次涌来，整个世界都在战争的边缘。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61193,'Hear me! The only hope for your people is to travel west, to the forgotten lands of Kalimdor!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'听我说！你们人民的唯一希望是前往西方，前往被遗忘的卡利姆多大陆！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61194,'The dead in this land might lie still for the time being, but don\'t be fooled. Your young prince will find only death in the cold north.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这片土地上的亡者现在可能暂时安静，但别被愚弄了。你年轻的王子在寒冷的北方只会找到死亡。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61195,'Commendable as that may be, his passions will be his undoing. It falls to you now, young sorceress.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'尽管这可能令人钦佩，但他的热情将会导致他的失败。现在轮到你了，年轻的女巫。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61196,'You must lead your people west to the ancient lands of Kalimdor. Only there can you combat the shadows and save this world from the flame.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你必须带领你的人民前往卡利姆多的古老土地。只有在那里，你才能对抗阴影，拯救这个世界免于毁灭之火。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61197,'I know many things, young warchief, about you and your people. My identity, at this time, is unimportant. What is important is that you rally your people and leave these shores immediately.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'年轻的酋长，我知道许多关于你和你的人民的事情。我目前的身份并不重要。重要的是你要召集你的人民，立刻离开这片海岸。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61198,'Human? I left my humanity behind long ago. I am something different now. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'人类？我早就抛弃了我的人性。我现在已经是另一种存在了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61199,'Know that I have seen the future and beheld the great Burning Shadow that is coming to consume this world. You sense it as well, don\'t you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'要知道我已经看到了未来，看到了即将来袭的巨大燃烧暗影，它将吞噬这个世界。你也感觉到了，不是吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61200,'I am the reason for the Legion\'s return.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是军团回归的原因。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61201,'Years ago, I brought the orcs into this world, and by doing so, I opened a path for the demons as well. For my sins I was murdered by those I cared for most. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'多年前，是我将兽人引入这个世界，也因此为恶魔开辟了一条通道。由于我的罪孽，我被我最关心的人谋杀了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61202,'Despite my death, war raged across the lands of the east for many long years, leaving entire kingdoms devastated in its wake. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'尽管我已经死去，战争在东方的土地上肆虐了许多年，让整个王国都遭受了毁灭性的破坏。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61203,'Now, at long last, I have returned to set things right. I am Medivh, the Last Guardian.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'现在，终于，我已经回来了，为了纠正一切。我是麦迪文，最后的守护者。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61214,'Ishnu-alah, dreamer, and welcome to our concealed enclave. May it provide some respite from the long journey ahead into the Emerald Nightmare.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'伊瑟鲁奈，梦想家，欢迎来到我们隐蔽的飞地。愿它能为你在前往翡翠噩梦之旅中提供一些休息。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61216,'The Emerald Dream is within our reach, dreamer.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'翡翠之梦触手可及，梦想家。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61217,'Yauur?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61254,'Why hello there, not often I get visitors in the Opera Hall.$B$BYou want to hear any music? It\'s been a while since I have had the chance to test my skills in this place, with the lack of people and all. I promise you it will be great, I am a famous musician after all.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗨，很少有人来到歌剧厅。$B$B你想听点音乐吗？在这个地方我已经有一段时间没有机会展示我的技能了，因为人太少了。我保证会很棒的，毕竟我是个著名的音乐家。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61255,'Why hello there, and welcome to the festivities. I apologize for the other guests not treating you with proper decency. It would appear they are quite... ravenous these days.$B$BI am Lord Ebonlocke of Darkshire. I traveled here of my own accord and have not returned since. I am quite aware of my current state in the tower, for I have been dead for some time. Most others that linger here are not as keen, unfortunately. It would appear that I am cursed to haunt these halls until something most fortuitous should free me from this eternal confinement.$B$BPerhaps we can help one another. I have come to learn a few things and meet others in a similar situation to mine during the time I have been bound here.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，欢迎参加这场庆典。我为其他客人没有像样地对待你而道歉，看来他们这些天相当饥饿。$B$B我是夜色镇的艾本洛克领主。我是自愿前来的，并且从那时起就没有回家过。我很清楚我在塔楼里的现状，因为我已经死了一段时间了。不幸的是，大多数在这里逗留的人似乎并不那么机智。看来我被困在这些大厅里，直到某些幸运的事情发生，将我从这个永恒的囚禁中释放出来。$B$B也许我们可以互相帮助，我已经在这座塔里度过了一些时间，学到了一些东西，并与在我这种情况下的其他人见面。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61256,'<The apparition seems preoccupied, lost in thought, and lingering in time.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<这个幽灵似乎心事重重，陷入了沉思之中，在时间中徘徊。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61257,'It shall always be a Greymane who sits atop the Gilnean throne. It is by the will of my Lord that this will come to pass once again.$B$BI admit, I have little trust in outsiders, but I realize such attitudes have doomed us to these times we live in.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'吉尔尼斯的王座上永远会坐着格雷迈恩家族的人。这是我主的意愿，这将再次实现。$B$B我承认，我很少信任外人，但我意识到这种态度注定让了我们生活在这个时代。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61258,'Welcome to my lighthouse.$B$BI should warn you, I may not have the most welcoming accommodations. I simply keep the fire burning to guide ships from hitting the shoal.$B$BWhat brings you here, anyway?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到我的灯塔。$B$BI 应该警告你，我的住处可能不太舒适。 我只是让火一直燃烧，以引导船只避免撞上浅滩。$B$B无论如何，是什么风把你吹来了？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61259,'Gilneas has seen darker days. But with newfound allies, such as you, hope remains. I feared the Alliance would\'ve abandoned us, but here we stand. I will bend no knee to these Alteraci scum.$B$BWe will prevail.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'吉尔尼斯经历了黑暗的日子，但有了像你这样的新盟友，希望仍然存在。 我担心联盟会抛弃我们，但我们站在这里。$B$B我不会向这些奥特拉奇败类屈服。 我们会取得胜利。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61260,'The Kirin Tor called Arugal a charlatan using cheap parlor tricks to pass for a mage. If only they could have understood his genius and mine.$B$BThe so-called Worgen curse is a blessing: With Arugal\'s research, we can achieve immortality, never again to fear sickness or frailty, empowered as we are with strength beyond human comprehension.$B$BWe have yet to test the curse on races other than humans and dwarves, but we are not so depraved as to force it upon those unwilling.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'肯瑞托称阿鲁高为江湖骗子，使用廉价的客厅把戏来冒充法师。 如果他们能理解他和我的天才就好了。$B$B所谓的狼人诅咒是一种祝福：通过阿鲁高的研究，我们可以实现永生，不再害怕疾病或虚弱，我们拥有超出人类理解的力量 .$B$B我们还没有在人类和矮人以外的种族上测试诅咒，但我们并没有堕落到把它强加给那些不愿意的人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61265,'The Gilnean Brigade has finally returned home. We are here to reclaim these lands in the name of Greymane.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<占位符文本>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61269,'Why, hello there, and welcome to Ravenshire!$B$BThis storied town is one of the oldest in Gilneas, and has long pledged fealty to the lords of Ravenwood Keep.$B$BSince the castle fell under dark times, Lord Ravenwood has relocated his court here, which means that history is being made right before our eyes!$B$BIf you\'d like to learn more of our fascinating past, I have quite the collection of texts that range from historical accounts and scholarly dissertations, to thrilling folktales and fables.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗨，你好，欢迎来到拉文郡！$B$B这个传奇小镇是吉尔尼斯最古老的城镇之一，长期以来一直向拉文伍德城堡的领主宣誓效忠。$B$B自从城堡陷入黑暗时期以来，拉文伍德勋爵已经 将他的宫廷搬迁到这里，这意味着历史正在我们眼前创造！$B$B如果您想了解更多我们迷人的过去，我收集了相当多的文本，从历史记录和学术论文，到 惊心动魄的民间故事和寓言。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61270,'I must admit, it feels weird to not be within Gilneas City, especially with so much chaos. I once held the council of the king, and now look at me, groveling in Ravenshire of all places.$B$B<A sigh escapes the Magistrate.>$B$BPerhaps this will all be worth it in the end, once this conflict is over and the land begins to heal.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我必须承认，不在吉尔尼斯城感觉很奇怪，尤其是在如此混乱的情况下。 我曾经召开过国王会议，现在看看我，在拉文郡的各个地方卑躬屈膝。$B$B<裁判官的一声叹息。>$B$B也许这一切最终都是值得的，一旦这 冲突结束了，土地开始愈合。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61271,'With the Greymane displeasure for the Kirin Tor I never expected to be here within Gilneas helping the people.$B$BThese are strange times, full of strange events. I am here to offer my assistance, and act as an envoy from the City State of Dalaran.$B$BDo you have business with the Kirin Tor?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'由于格雷迈恩对肯瑞托的不满，我从来没想过会在吉尔尼斯帮助人民。$B$B这是奇怪的时代，充满了奇怪的事件。 我是作为达拉然城邦的特使来这里提供协助的。$B$B你和肯瑞托有生意吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61272,'I am sure you will find something you\'re looking for.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我相信你会找到你要寻找的东西的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61273,'I can assure you, Gilneas is known for its craftsmanship.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我向你保证，吉尔尼斯以其精湛的工艺而闻名。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61274,'Ravenshire has relied on fish for quite a while, and the ocean is always bountiful enough to feed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'拉文郡长期以来一直依赖鱼类生存，而海洋总是有足够的资源来提供食物。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61275,'What you want outsider?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你想要什么，外来者？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61276,'My father has been teaching me how to craft and repair armor for pretty much all of my life. If you\'re ever wanting to learn a thing or to, you should speak with him, he certainly is the best.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的父亲几乎一辈子都在教我如何制作和修理盔甲。如果你想学一些东西，你应该和他交谈，他肯定是最好的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61277,'My son likes to exaggerate, but he is a hard worker. If you\'re looking to be a skilled blacksmith, you need to work hard at it to succeed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我儿子喜欢夸张，但他很努力。 如果你想成为一名熟练的铁匠，你需要努力工作才能成功。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61278,'My job and my father\'s before me has been to hunt the local game of the region. It is honest work, but at times quite dangerous.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我和我父亲之前的工作一直是猎杀这个地区的野生动物。这是诚实的工作，但有时也相当危险。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61279,'My father is a skilled hunter, he is able to kill giant wolf and then make them into food!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我父亲是个熟练的猎人，他能够杀死巨型狼，然后将它们制成食物！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61281,'During my life it was I who looked after this church. I was murdered in cold blood by those that bear the emblem of this kingdom. It appears that I have been awoken from my slumber to serve a new purpose, and serve this purpose I shall.$B$BYou will find no hostilities here, I may be Gilnean but I offer a chance to find solace inside the walls of my parish.$B$BShould you need to rest, feel free to ask.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在我的一生中，我照顾着这座教堂。我被那些背负着这个王国徽章的人冷血谋杀了。看来我从沉睡中被唤醒，要履行一个新的使命，我将履行这个使命。$B$B你在这里不会遇到敌意，我虽然是吉尔尼斯人，但我提供了一个在我的教区墙内寻求慰藉的机会。$B$B如果你需要休息，随时可以问我。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61282,'We have been sent to monitor the situation in Gilneas, things here are... Far more interesting than I would have imagined.$B$BPerhaps we can be a more instrumental part of future history.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们被派来监视吉尔尼斯的情况，这里的情况……比我想象的要有趣得多。$B$B也许我们可以成为未来历史的更有影响力的一部分。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61283,'The land of Gilneas is certainly wounded and scarred, but it is not rotten from the inside out like Tirisfal. Any chance to extend our influence here will take considerable effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'吉尔尼斯的土地确实伤痕累累，但它并没有像提瑞斯法那样从内部腐化。要在这里扩展我们的影响力将需要相当大的努力。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61284,'Why are you staring? Have you never seen a soldier before?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你为什么盯着我看？你以前从未见过士兵吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61285,'Dark magic flows through my veins, I am reinvigorated to stand once more. My life was mired with deceit, anguish, and murder, perhaps now I can enact these miseries on those that wrought me to an early grave.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'黑暗魔法在我的血液中流动，我重新振作起来。我的生活充满了欺骗、痛苦和谋杀，也许现在我可以将这些不幸带给那些让我过早葬身的人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61286,'Can you believe it, the Scourge, here in Gilneas! No matter where I travel their taint seems to be present.$B$BThe Greymane wall was breached some time in the past. From my studies these are the remnants of a former scourge invasion. This is a good opportunity, foolish to waste. There is still much we can learn from these lands, and I must uncover all that I can while I have the opportunity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'难以置信，天灾军团竟然出现在吉尔尼斯！无论我走到哪里，他们的腐化似乎都存在着。$B$B很长时间以前，格雷迈恩之墙被攻破了。根据我的研究，这些是先前天灾入侵的残余。这是一个很好的机会，浪费了实在是愚蠢。在这片土地上我们仍然可以学到很多东西，我必须趁机探索所有我能够发现的东西。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61287,'You can\'t just sneak up on people you know that?! You almost put me into my second grave.$B$BCan\'t you see that I am occupied here? Busy, engaged, distracted, preoccupied, immersed, absorbed, working?$B$BHow many other ways can I describe this to you before you understand.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你不能突然靠近别人吗？你差点让我掉进第二个坟墓里。$B$B难道你看不出我正在忙吗？忙着、参与着、分心、心事重重、专注、全神贯注地工作着？$B$B我还要用多少种方式来描述这个，才能让你明白呢？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61288,'Looking for something? You\'d better spit it out.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在找什么吗？你最好说出来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61289,'I had always wondered what this place looked like beyond the wall... Now that I\'ve been there I must admit I am disappointed. Perhaps once you have seen one kingdom you\'ve seen them all$B$BYou looking to do some work around here, or just admire the scenery?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我一直想知道这堵墙之外的地方是什么样子……现在我去过了，必须承认我有点失望。也许一旦你看过一个王国，其他的也就差不多了。$B$B你是来这里做点工作，还是只是欣赏风景？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61290,'These damn pests, how am I ever to recover if I cannot even manage to deal with all of these issues on my own farm? The Ebonmere family was once a wealthy part of Gilneas, and now look at it, overgrown, and festering away.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这些该死的害虫，如果我连自己农场上的问题都处理不好，我怎么能够恢复呢？埃邦米尔家族曾经是吉尔尼斯富有的一部分，现在看看，变得荒芜，正在腐烂。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61291,'You need something fixed? It would appear that is all I am good for in this new life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你需要修理什么吗？看来在这个新生活中，修理似乎是我唯一擅长的事情。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61293,'So, there I was, the Silithus Desert, Hundreds of miles from the Civilization. No food, no water. But I Basutei a Paladin of SQUAD must push forward to fulfill the Prophecy... Man, this hill is kicking my Ass!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'所以，我在希利苏斯沙漠，离文明地区数百英里。没有食物，没有水。但是我，巴苏泰，SQUAD的一名圣骑士，必须继续前进，履行预言……天哪，这座山真让我受够了！ ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61298,'Watame did nothing wrong!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'瓦塔美没有做错任何事情！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61303,'Ah, welcome, weary traveler! It is good to see you on Thunderhorn Peak. Evil stirs within Azeroth, and the times ahead are troublesome, but we can be assured that daring adventures help the ailing Earth Mother and soothe her pain. Ambassador Boughshadow is also working ever so hard to help new members of the Alliance find their place here within our ranks. Anyone willing to heal the Earth Mother is welcome.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'啊，欢迎，疲惫的旅行者！在雷霆峰见到你真是太好了。恶魔在艾泽拉斯中崛起，前方的时光充满了困难，但我们可以肯定，大胆的冒险会帮助病痛的大地之母，缓解她的痛苦。博影大使也在努力帮助联盟的新成员在我们的队伍中找到自己的位置。任何愿意愈合大地之母的人都是受欢迎的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61307,'Here lie our fallen mortal heroes of Azeroth. May their souls rest in peace.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这里长眠着我们在艾泽拉斯逝去的凡人英雄。愿他们的灵魂安息。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61313,'<Muffled speech.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<低沉的演讲。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61320,'These dark hallways hold more than meets the eye. Keep your wits about you, unless you want to end up walking this place for an eternity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这些黑暗的走廊背后隐藏着更多的东西。保持警惕，除非你想永远在这个地方行走。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61321,'In my lifetime I committed all manner of crime under the guise of justice. I took bribes, laundered gold through the treasury, and did all manner of evil to gain my position.$B$BIf I could start again I would, but now I am stuck to forever think about what could have been, and what wrong roads I have taken in my short life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在我的一生中，我以正义的名义犯下了各种罪行。我收受贿赂，通过国库洗钱，为了获得我的地位而做了各种邪恶的事情。$B$B如果我可以重新开始，我会这么做，但现在我被困在永远思考什么本可以成为的，以及我在短暂的生命中走错的路上。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61322,'Do you hear that, the incessant howling of the wind? Has someone left a window open?!$B$BFetch for a servant immediately, and fix this damned racket.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你听到了吗，风不停的呼啸?有人没关窗户吗?马上叫个仆人来，把这该死的球拍修好。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61323,'You know what the biggest shame about being a wandering spirit is?$B$BI would say it is the lack of fine food and drink. I suppose the company is lacking as well, perhaps you can change things around here.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你知道作为一个游荡的幽灵最大的遗憾是什么吗？$B$B我会说最大的遗憾是没有美食和美酒。我想陪伴也是不足的，也许你可以改变这里的情况。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61325,'The Emerald Dream and Nordrassil are linked together, the land itself is enchanted by the magic of that realm. Dream Shards are evidence of this, a powerful substance of pure emerald energy which can only be found here, in Hyjal.$B$BIt is my duty to harmonize Small Dream Shards into Bright Dream Shards, if you come along any in your travels, seek me out.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'翡翠梦境和诺达希尔紧密相连，大地本身被那个领域的魔法所附魔。梦境碎片是这一点的证据，这是一种强大的纯绿宝石能量物质，只能在这里的海加尔找到。$B$B将小梦境碎片调和成明亮的梦境碎片是我的职责，如果你在旅途中遇到任何一个，可以找到我。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61326,'Hidden beneath the veil, a great shadow lurks within the dream, already much of my kind have been disturbed by the presence.$B$BYou may not know this, but the awakening has begun.$B$BAn ancient ritual of my kin intended to draw us from the dream, I have resisted its temptations already, but not all are willed so strong.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'吉尔尼斯曾经经历过更黑暗的日子。有了像你这样的新盟友，希望依然存在。我曾担心联盟会抛弃我们，但我们仍然站在这里。$B$B我绝不会向这些阿尔特拉克渣滓屈服。我们会取得胜利。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61327,'We must always prepare our stockpiles, for demons encroach upon Hyjal day after day. If their goal is to attempt to corrupt Nordrassil, we shall be ready to deny them.$B$BWhat can I do for you $c?.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们必须时刻准备好我们的储备，因为恶魔每天都在蚕食海加尔。如果他们的目的是试图腐化诺德希尔公司，我们将准备拒绝他们。我能为你做点什么吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61355,'I hope you have come to find refuge here beneath Nordrassil, for not all wildlife is as lucky as we are.$B$BThe encroachment of darkness that has threatened this land since the Third War still lingers, do not let the beauty of the World Tree blind you to this.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我希望你来这里是为了在诺德希尔下寻求庇护，因为并不是所有的野生生物都像我们一样幸运。$B$B自第三次大战以来威胁这片土地的黑暗仍然存在，不要让世界之树的美丽使你对此视而不见。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61368,'Need repairs or smithin\' supplies? If so, I am your guy... For a price, of course.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'需要维修或锻造用品？如果是这样，我就是你的人...当然是有代价的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61369,'Since you\'re helping us, I don\'t mind helping you resupply. Nothing\'s free, of course. This ain\'t a charity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'既然你要帮助我们，我也不介意帮你重新补给。当然，没有什么是免费的。这可不是什么慈善机构。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61371,'Hey, everyone\'s gotta eat, am I right? Well, anyone who is alive that is. In any case, if you\'re hungry, I can spare some of our stash. You better have gold on you though.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，每个人都得吃东西，对吧？当然，只有那些活着的人。不管怎样，如果你饿了，我可以拿一些我们的存货给你。不过你最好带点金子来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61373,'An outsider, huh? We haven\'t had those in such a long time. With the Greymane Wall closed, we haven\'t heard much of the goings-on outside the kingdom.$B$BPerhaps you can share a story or two sometime.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'外来者，啊？我们已经很久没有外来者了。由于格雷迈恩之墙关闭，我们很久没有听到王国外的消息了。$B$B也许你可以有空分享一两个故事。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61374,'Glory to the Dark Lady, $c. What do you need?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'黑暗女王万岁，$c。你需要什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61375,'Finally the Dark Lady sends some competent assistance. Do not be so surprised about my appearance. Yes, this body lives, but I am fully committed to the Horde and the Dark Lady.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'终于黑暗女王派来了一些能干的援助。不要对我的外貌感到惊讶。是的，这具躯体还活着，但我完全致力于部落和黑暗女王。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61376,'If the boss says you\'re good, then who am I to judge? I for one am not a fan of this land. So I\'d prefer if we could finish our business and skedaddle as soon as possible.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果老板说你不错，那我有什么资格评判呢？我个人对这片土地并不感兴趣。所以我希望我们能尽快完成交易然后赶紧离开。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61377,'I\'ve seen it all the past four years. As long as I get some good loot, I don\'t care who I work for. Now, are you here to make yourself useful to the boss or what?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在过去的四年里，我见识过很多。只要我能得到好的战利品，我不在乎为谁工作。现在，你是来帮老板做点有用的事情吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61378,'Well, this is a fine day here in Gilneas, isn\'t it? Take care if you leave town, alright?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯，吉尔尼斯今天天气不错，不是吗？如果你离开镇子的话，要注意安全，好吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61379,'Well, this is a fine day here in Gilneas, isn\'t it? Take care if you leave town, alright?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯，吉尔尼斯今天天气不错，不是吗？如果你离开镇子的话，要注意安全，好吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61381,'The Shademore\'s have been extremely generous with their support, but I am afraid it isn\'t doing much to quell my worries.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'谢德摩尔家族一直非常慷慨地支持我们，但恐怕这对于平息我的忧虑并没有太大帮助。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61382,'Gilnean cooking is some of the finest in the world, though not all will find our ingredients enjoyable.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'吉尔尼斯的烹饪是世界上最好的，尽管并不是所有人都会喜欢我们的食材。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61383,'I have seen enough in my life to know what is right and what is wrong. It is my belief that the king has taken his matters much too far.$B$BI was once part of the Greymane cause. I now know the truth of the lies I was told.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'沙德莫雷家族对他们的支持非常慷慨，但恐怕对平息我的担忧并没有多大作用。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61384,'What a time for the wheel to go loose, huh? I must say, you\'re a sight for sore eyes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'车轮松了的时机真是够巧的，不是吗？我必须说，你真是一道令人感到欣慰的风景。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61385,'Why hello there, and welcome to Shademore Tavern. Guests are somewhat infrequent these days, but we are still happy to have you.$B$BMake yourself at home. If you need anything, come and see me.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗨，欢迎来到夜影酒馆。最近客人有点少，但我们还是很高兴能有你的光临。请随意，把这里当成你的家。如果你需要任何帮助，随时来找我。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61386,'It is hard to spread the word of the Light these days, especially with such troubled minds.$B$BI am sure such hard times will pass before long.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在这个时候传播光明的教义确实很困难，尤其是在如此烦扰的时期。我相信这些困难的时刻很快就会过去。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61387,'I am here to do my part on behalf of the Scarlet Crusade.$B$BIf you have the will to recover Lordaeron from the clutches of death and vile taint, speak with me, and perhaps you can be of use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我来这里是为了代表血色十字军尽我的一份力量。$B$B如果你有意愿将洛丹伦从死亡和邪恶污点的魔掌中恢复过来，请与我交谈，也许你能派上用场。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61410,'Spirits be with you stranger, what can I do for you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'神灵与您同在，陌生人，我能为您做些什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61411,'Keep your distance Outsider.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我明白了，朋友。如果你有任何问题或需要帮助，随时问我。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61412,'Keep on your good behaviour.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'保持良好的行为。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61413,'I am watching you Outsider.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我在观察着你，外来者。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61414,'Thank you for rescuing me. I am in your debt.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'谢谢你救了我。我欠你的人情。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61416,'Why hello there, you wouldn\'t mind helping out a dwarf in need would ye?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗨，你好。你不介意帮助一个需要帮助的矮人吧？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61428,'There\'s so much work to be done around here, it\'s enough to make my head explode!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这里有这么多工作要做，简直要把我的头都炸掉了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61429,'There is still a lot of work to do if we ever want to reclaim our home in Gnomeregan. Even so, it\'s an honor to be a part of the reclamation efforts!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果我们想要夺回诺莫瑞根的家园，还有很多工作要做。尽管如此，能够参与收复工作是一种荣幸！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61430,'Why hello there! Come to see a marvel of Gnomish Engineering? Perhaps you\'re just here to witness the latest and greatest technological advancements?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗨！来看看侏儒工程的奇迹了吗？也许你只是来见证最新最伟大的技术进步？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61433,'What\'s that? Are you the new chemist that was sent to help us out here?$B$BUnless you know something about thermal energy and toxic chemical reduction, I would ask you to move along.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'什么？你是被派来帮助我们的新化学家吗？$B$B除非你对热能和有毒化学物质的减少有了解，否则我会请你离开。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61434,'A little extra hydrogen and we should be closer to a more stable...$B$BOh, you caught me off guard! What are you doing here anyway? Trying to steal my trade secrets?!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'加点额外的氢气，我们应该就能更接近一个更稳定的……$B$B哦，你吓了我一跳！你到底在这里干什么？想要偷我的商业机密吗？！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61435,'I took a lengthy trip around the world after the collapse of Gnomeregan.$B$BWith all the news of this facility buzzing about, I returned to offer my assistance where needed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在诺莫瑞根崩溃后，我进行了一次漫长的环球旅行。听说这个设施的消息后，我回来了，愿意在需要的地方提供帮助。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61436,'We\'re making tremendous strides here! It just so happens I am approaching a breakthrough with a new chemical purifying process that will allow us to filter the radiation without dispersing it out into Dun Morogh.$B$BThe thought alone of such a groundbreaking refinement process makes me giddy with excitement! Imagine the countless applications! There are still a few pieces to the formula missing, though...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们在这里取得了巨大的进展！恰好我正在接近一个突破，一种新的化学净化过程，它将允许我们过滤辐射而不将其散发到丹莫洛。仅仅想到这样一个具有创新意义的精炼过程就让我兴奋不已！想象一下无数的应用！虽然还有一些配方的部分缺失...',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61437,'I am in charge of every aspect of the equipment and infrastructure here in the Reclamation Facility. I know the exact location and function of every last wire and pipe that runs through these walls.$B$BWithout me, this whole place would fall apart! Who else here has any clue how to maintain the instruments and operate the panels correctly?!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我负责回收设施中设备和基础设施的各个方面。 我知道穿过这些墙壁的每根电线和管道的确切位置和功能。$B$B没有我，这整个地方就会崩溃！ 这里还有谁知道如何正确维护仪器和操作面板？！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61438,'Engineering is an essential foundation of Gnomish society. Without it, can you imagine where we would be?$B$BProbably still banging sticks together like some sort of troggs!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'工程学是侏儒社会的重要基础。 没有它，你能想象我们会在哪里吗？$B$B可能仍然像穴居人一样敲打木棍！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61440,'Looking for something specific? Things are a bit hectic around here, but I am sure I have what you need.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'正在寻找特定的东西？ 这里的事情有点忙，但我确信我有你需要的东西。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61441,'There is so much maintenance work of late. These old machines have been dormant for quite a while, and have only recently been turned on!$B$BI used to do regular checkups on this facility\'s equipment back before the Gnomeregan incident.$B$B<Weezan lets out a small laugh.>$B$BIt\'s a good thing I did! I\'m glad we thought ahead and built everything here as a backup!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'最近的维护工作非常多。 这些旧机器已经休眠了很长一段时间，直到最近才被开启！$B$BI 在诺莫瑞根事件之前曾定期检查该设施的设备。$B$B<Weezan 发出一声轻笑。 >$B$B我做了一件好事！ 我很高兴我们提前考虑并在这里建造了所有东西作为备份！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61442,'There is nothing some good gnomish ingenuity cannot fix. It won\'t be long until we\'re moved back into Gnomeregan.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'没有什么是侏儒的聪明才智无法解决的。 不久我们就会搬回诺莫瑞根。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61444,'We have a backup of extra supplies stored if you are planning to buy in bulk today!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果您今天打算批量购买，我们会存储额外供应品的备份！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61445,'The goblins like to claim they are the best at making things explode, but I disagree.$B$BWithout the accuracy of intricate and delicate parts, there can be no concise direction of channeled power. What fun is blasting something without being precise?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'地精们喜欢声称他们擅长制造爆炸物，但我不同意。没有精密而精细的零件，就没有准确的能量传导方向。没有精准，爆炸有什么乐趣呢？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61446,'My, you wouldn\'t happen to have a spare spanner would you, I seem to have misplaced mine.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'噢，你不会碰巧有一个备用的扳手吧？我似乎把我的弄丢了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61447,'Many may see the worgen curse as a horrible affliction, but we embrace it. We welcome it as a blessing, as it makes us stronger, faster, and longer-lived! Her name is Rosenberg, and she has saved us from a dull and ordinary life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'许多人可能认为狼人的诅咒是一种可怕的折磨，但我们却拥抱它。我们把它视为一种祝福，因为它使我们变得更强大、更快捷，并且寿命更长！她的名字叫罗森伯格，她让我们摆脱了平淡无奇的生活，拯救了我们。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61448,'Much is yet to be learned of these Pellars—previously believed to be a myth, but now proven otherwise. They may be Gilneas\' roots we never knew were there. And as one meant to protect this country\'s legacy, I must learn whatever I can from them.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'关于佩拉尔人，我们还有许多待学习的地方。以前被认为是神话，但现在已被证明是真实存在的。他们可能是吉尔尼斯从未意识到的根基。作为一个致力于保护这个国家传承的人，我必须从他们身上学到尽可能多的知识。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61449,'If ever be you needing help with fixing your gear, I know how to mend most things that break. If not, you could always sell your scraps to old Mustang.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果你需要帮助修理装备，我知道如何修复大多数损坏的东西。如果不需要，你还可以将废料卖给老野马。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61450,'The Wolf Serpent sees through me, hears through me, feels through me. I am the thunder of his voice, the instrument of his judgement.$B$BFor as long as you linger in the Wolfswood, you shall abide by my word.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'狼蛇透过我看到我，透过我听到我，透过我感受我。我是他声音的雷鸣，他审判的工具。只要你在狼林逗留，你必须遵守我的话语。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61452,'We are the Pellars. And order of faithful guardians of the land and its children. Healers, shepards and teachers,$B$BWe see beyond the mirages of politics to aid those in Gilneas who find refuge in the old ways. Farmers, huntsmen, humble folk who did not lose their true self in the groves of stone.$B$BJoin us, return to your roots.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们是守护者，是这片土地和她的孩子们的忠实守护者。 治疗师、牧羊人、教师。$B$B我们超越政治的海市蜃楼，帮助那些在吉尔尼斯以旧方式避难的人。 农民、猎人、谦卑的人们并没有迷失在冰冷的石头树林中。$B$B加入我们，回归你的根源。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61454,'Have you coin, have you gold? For a copper and a silver, roots and blooms, flowers and shrooms, and yet bulbs from the dell to you I\'ll gladly sell.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你有硬币吗，你有金子吗?只要一枚铜和一枚银，根和花，花和蘑菇，还有山谷里的球茎，我愿意卖给你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61455,'<The man stares at you with a look of intensity.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<这个人用一种强烈的目光看着你。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61457,'It is not the absence of liberty that holds me, stranger, but the heavy burden of my guilt. The decay of these lands at the hands of heretics has left a blight on my spirit. I have lost my parents, my title, and my freedom. Despite the darkness I bear, I still find hope in my sister, in my countrymen, and now in you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'陌生人，囚禁我的不是缺乏自由，而是我沉重的罪行负担。异教徒使这片土地腐朽，给我的灵魂留下了一片荒芜。我失去了父母、头衔和自由。尽管我背负着黑暗，我仍然在我的妹妹、我的同胞，以及现在的你身上找到希望。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61458,'You have given me back my freedom and, with it, the hope necessary to push on. I am no fool, nor are the men who remain loyal to our cause. Though the day may come that I must secure our future, rest assured that I will do so.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你给了我自由，也给了我继续前进所需的希望。我不是傻子，那些仍然忠于我们事业的人也不是。虽然有一天我可能必须确保我们的未来，但请放心，我会这么做。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61459,'Another one of you aimless outlanders wandering up here. I wonder what exactly you\'re hoping to find.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'又一个漫无目的的外地人走进了这里。我想知道你究竟希望找到什么。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61460,'I would love to see the final version of Ur\'s research, but unfortunately his final books are not in our possession. We must settle for his messy, half-finished ideas and notes instead. His works may make little sense now, but perhaps Moranna can see what we cannot.$B$BIn the meantime, we will provide as much aid as we can to those in need, as she did for us - the Lupine Coven.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我很想看到乌尔的研究最终版本，但不幸的是，他的最终著作不在我们手中。我们只能满足于他那些凌乱、未完成的想法和笔记。他的作品现在可能没有多大意义，但也许莫兰娜能看到我们看不到的东西。同时，我们会尽我们所能帮助那些需要帮助的人，就像她为我们——月影女巫团——所做的一样。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61467,'A new era is upon us thanks to the hard work and brilliance of Gnomekind! Many of us who once dwelled here in Tinker Town have begun to gravitate back toward Gnomeregan. Well, the Reclamation Facility anyway. It\'s a new venture to reclaim our irradiated home.$B$BYou see, it was built before the betrayal of Thermaplugg and is now being used to cleanse the toxic gases from the city. Fascinating stuff, isn\'t it?!$B$BIf you\'re looking for any of the Gnomish leadership, you can find them there. Head west of Ironforge towards the entrance of Gnomeregan. You shouldn\'t have a hard time spotting the entrance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'感谢侏儒们的辛勤努力和辉煌，一个新的时代已经来临！ 我们许多曾经居住在修补匠镇的人已经开始回到诺莫瑞根。 好吧，无论如何，还有回收设施。 这是夺回我们受辐射家园的新冒险。$B$B你看，它是在Thermaplugg背叛之前建造的，现在被用来净化城市中的有毒气体。 令人着迷的东西，不是吗？！$B$B如果您正在寻找任何侏儒领导层，您可以在那里找到他们。 前往铁炉堡以西，前往诺莫瑞根的入口。 您应该不难找到入口。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61468,'It is crucial that we maintain good relations with our neighbors and the great powers. We have lost too much due to the Prince\'s madness. If we are to survive, then we must make friends. I hope I can count on your assistance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'与邻国和大国保持良好关系至关重要。因为王子的疯狂，我们失去了太多。如果我们要生存，那么我们必须交朋友。我希望我能指望你的帮助。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61469,'I have done all in my ability to make this place presentable, but I was not bred for this. I am a noble of high standing, and yet here I toil like a commoner accommodating savages. Toryn isn\'t even gazing in my direction any more and my robe is soiled!$B$B... My apologies. It is unbecoming of a noble to make such an outburst. Times are hard on all of us. Now, what can I do for you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我已竭尽全力让这个地方变得漂亮，但我生来就不是为此而生的。 我是身份尊贵的贵族，却在这里像平民一样劳作，迁就野蛮人。 甚至不再看我的方向，我的长袍也弄脏了！$B$B... 我很抱歉。 作为一个贵族，做出这样的举动是不合适的。 时代对我们所有人来说都很艰难。 现在，我能为您做什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61470,'We lost everything we had when we chose to leave the vault and library behind, but better to sacrifice material goods than to struggle and risk death before the madness of the Prince. I have already transcribed much from memory, but I could always use help in tracking down any forgotten annals.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'当我们选择离开金库和图书馆时，我们失去了一切，但牺牲物质财富比在王子的疯狂面前挣扎和冒着死亡的风险更好。 我已经凭记忆抄写了很多内容，但我总是可以借助帮助来追踪任何被遗忘的编年史。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61471,'I am tasked with both the creation and maintenance of our magical equipment and arcane defenders. It is no easy task, but I do hope that in time my toil will make Shanyra\'s life that much more tenable. Any help is, of course, appreciated in this matter.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我负责制造和维护我们的魔法装备和奥术护卫。这并不是一项容易的任务，但我希望随着时间的推移，我的辛勤工作能够让尚雅的生活变得更加稳定。当然，对于这个问题的任何帮助都将不胜感激。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61472,'Greetings $r. I can see that you have your reservations about our abilities, but make no mistake, Ronae\'thalas will become a haven all our people can be proud of. Those who pledge aid will be rewarded, and if Azj\'tordin trusts you, then so shall I.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好  $r。 我看得出来你对我们的能力持保留态度，但别搞错了，罗奈萨拉斯将成为我们所有人都可以自豪的避风港。 那些承诺提供援助的人将会得到回报，如果阿兹托丁信任你，那么我也会如此。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61473,'The position of the stars has changed since I was young, but they nonetheless hold many secrets that influence the world we see even today. I believe we can use this power to our advantage. Mayhaps Toryn will take notice of my efforts as well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'自我年幼以来，星星的位置已经改变，但它们仍然隐藏着许多影响我们今天所看到的世界的秘密。我相信我们可以利用这种力量为我们谋取利益。或许托尼也会注意到我的努力。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61474,'Can you even begin to comprehend how powerful these elves are, $r? Their power resides in knowledge, a knowledge that would highly benefit both myself and the Forsaken as a whole.$B$BWere I to still breathe the same air as they, I would be breathless with excitement. And yet despite my elven nature, I still feel the compulsion to claim their power as my own. By aiding them, we shall aid ourselves. Come, let us see to their needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你能开始理解这些精灵有多强大吗，$r？ 他们的力量在于知识，这种知识对我自己和整个被遗忘者都非常有利。$B$B如果我仍然和他们呼吸同样的空气，我会兴奋得喘不过气来。 然而，尽管我有精灵的本性，我仍然感到有必要将他们的力量据为己有。 通过帮助他们，我们也就帮助了我们自己。 来吧，让我们看看他们的需求。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61475,'This is amazing! To think that my ancestry lies with these people, that the Shen\'dralar are my kin! They take for granted all the knowledge that the world has lost. We stand to learn a great deal from the Shen\'dralar, and it is imperative that we remain in their good graces and render them any aid they seek.$B$BTheir knowledge will save my people, I just know it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这真太了不起了！ 我的祖先是这些人，辛德拉人是我的亲人！ 他们认为世界上已经失去的所有知识都是理所当然的。 我们从辛德拉那里学到了很多东西，我们必须保持他们的好感，并为他们提供他们寻求的任何援助。$B$B他们的知识将拯救我的人民，我就知道这一点。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61476,'Ah, my friend, it is good to meet you here. As you can see, the seeds of a new home for my people have been sown. I must confess, I fear what the future holds. There are so few of us left and there is no guarantee we will survive the coming years.$B$BNonetheless, we have come far, farther than I dared hope. After everything we have been through, I cannot, will not so easily surrender to any fate that sees my people in ruin.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'啊，我的朋友，在这里见到你真是太好了。正如你所见，为我的人民筑起了新家的种子。我必须承认，我对未来感到担忧。我们的人数如此之少，而且不能保证我们能在未来的岁月中生存下来。$B$B然而，我们已经走了很远，比我敢于希望的还要远。经过我们所经历的一切，我不能，也不会轻易地接受任何导致我的人民毁灭的命运。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61483,'While we could only bring few things from Eldre\'thalas, we never lost our magic. Conjuration has allowed us to create many items, primarily food and supplies. My services are in high demand and I do what I must for my people.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'虽然我们只能从艾德萨拉斯带来一些东西，但我们从未失去魔法。 召唤使我们能够创造许多物品，主要是食物和补给品。 我的服务需求量很大，我为我的人民做了我必须做的事情。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61484,'Ronae\'thalas used to be an academy closely connected to the Eldre\'thalas elite before the sundering. Many of us even attended this academy in it\'s prime.$B$BWhile the sundering destroyed much, a lot of the wards and magical reservoirs remain active to this day. It is my job to reshape and draw upon the lingering magic here so that it may assist us.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在分裂之前，罗奈萨拉斯曾经是一所与艾德雷萨拉斯精英阶层关系密切的学院。 我们中的许多人甚至在这所学院的鼎盛时期就读过。$B$B虽然大地震摧毁了很多，但许多病房和魔法水库至今仍然活跃。 我的工作是重塑和利用这里挥之不去的魔力，以便它可以帮助我们。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61485,'Looking to gain rewards for your efforts here beneath the blessing of Nordrassil? If that is the case, you have come to the right person.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'希望在诺达希尔的祝福下为你的努力获得回报吗？ 如果是这样，那么您就找对人了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61486,'Time is money, friend, and my time is very valuable.$B$BGivin\' we both have better things to be doing, how about you tell me what business you have here? Keep your eyes off the coinage. Understand?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'时间就是金钱，朋友，我的时间非常宝贵。$B$B我们都有更好的事情要做，你告诉我你在这里有什么生意怎么样？ 不要把目光从硬币上移开。 理解？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61491,'The secrets of Dreamsteel are elusive to even the most skilled blacksmiths. Do you have the potential to harness such technical precision and ability?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'即使对于最熟练的铁匠来说，梦钢的秘密也是难以捉摸的。 您有潜力利用这种技术精度和能力吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61492,'Clear your mind, steady your hand. There are talents that you must master if you desire to begin weaving with Dreamthread. The properties of the material are extremely unique and almost tranquil to work with.$B$BI hope you are not just here to disturb me. What is it you need?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'清空你的思绪，稳定你的手。如果你想要开始用梦之线编织，你必须掌握一些技巧。这种材料的性质非常独特，几乎令人心神宁静。$B$B我希望你不只是来打扰我。你需要什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61493,'You\'ve come to see my work with Dreamhide? I\'ll warn you, this material is not for the faint of heart. The most skilled leatherworkers have tried and failed to work with this elusive leather.$B$BMaybe you have the dedication and focus needed to master this material.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你来看我的梦幻兽皮工作吗？我要警告你，这种材料不适合心志薄弱的人。最有技巧的制皮匠都尝试过，但未能成功地使用这种难以捉摸的皮革。$B$B也许你有足够的投入和专注力来掌握这种材料。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61494,'My heart yearns to return to the dream. It calls me, and desires my presence, but I am a loyal servant of Ralathius. I am bound to service until my duties here in Hyjal are complete.$B$BAside, what could I do alone anyway? Look at me, I\'m small!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的心渴望回到梦中。 它召唤我，渴望我的存在，但我是拉雷修斯的忠实仆人。 我必须服役，直到我在海加尔的职责完成为止。$B$B 除此之外，我一个人能做什么呢？ 你看我，我还小！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61496,'I always feel at ease here within Starfall Village.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我在星落村总觉得很自在。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61497,'What is it you have come to search for here beneath the World Tree? Knowledge, power?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你来到世界之树下寻找什么呢？知识，力量吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61505,'I am charged with managing our supplies of rare potions and elixirs.$B$BI was taught by the most talented druidic alchemist years ago, and work to continue his vast research.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我负责管理我们稀有药剂和灵药的供应。 $B$BI 多年前由最有才华的德鲁伊炼金术士教授，并致力于继续他的大量研究。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61506,'The Barkskin Tribe has been lost to aggression. The corruption of Hyjal has taken a toll on my people, and we are all that is left here. It would appear that our sad and tragic downfall is common amongst the other tribes as well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'树皮部落已经失去了领土。海加尔的腐化给我的人民带来了沉重打击，我们是这里唯一幸存的部落。看来我们悲惨的衰落在其他部落中也很常见。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61507,'Nargg is loyal, Nargg is strong!$B$BYou threaten Elder Barkmaw, Nargg threaten you! You hurt Elder Barkmaw, Nargg hurt you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'纳尔格很忠诚，纳尔格很强大！$B$B你威胁树喉长老，纳尔格威胁你！ 你伤害了树喉长老，纳格也伤害了你！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61509,'The downfall of the Barkskin is a devastating loss to us Furbolg. As time passes, I fear we may be the only tribe to withstand the growing corruption.$B$BI have come representing the Timbermaw seeking to bring all those uncorrupted into our fold. If that is not possible, offer council to prevent madness from becoming rampant.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'树皮部落的衰落对我们熊怪来说是个毁灭性的损失。随着时间的推移，我担心我们可能是唯一能够抵御日益蔓延的腐化的部落。我代表着木喉部族前来，试图将所有未被腐化的部落纳入我们的大家庭。如果不可能，我们希望能够提供意见，防止疯狂蔓延。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61512,'My duty is to ensure the roots of the World Tree recover from the devastation wrought by the Burning Legion. It has been some years since their leader was defeated by Malfurion Stormrage, and yet their kind still linger.$B$BAs long as you remain an enemy to demons, you will always be welcome in Nordrassil Glade.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的职责是确保世界树的根部从燃烧军团造成的破坏中恢复过来。 他们的领袖被玛法里奥·怒风击败已经有好几年了，但他们的同类仍然存在。$B$BA只要你仍然是恶魔的敌人，诺达希尔林地就会永远欢迎你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61513,'Who...? Who goes there?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'谁...？ 谁去那里？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61519,'The attunement of sigils is a lost art. There are a spare few of us left in the world. It is said this ancient tradition was first started by our Highborne brethren long ago as a means to infuse ley energy into powerful enchantments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'印记的协调是一门失传的艺术。 世界上只剩下我们几个人了。 据说这个古老的传统是很久以前由我们的上层精灵兄弟首先开始的，作为将魔力能量注入强大魔法的一种手段。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61520,'Do you feel it? Something foul is lingering upon the air here within Hyjal.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你感觉到了吗？ 海加尔山的空气中弥漫着某种恶臭。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61521,'It was in this very glade that the Alliance and Horde stood together in unison to defeat the Burning Legion.$B$BSuch an action speaks to the sheer power when politics and old feuds are set aside for the betterment of our world.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'正是在这片林间空地，联盟和部落齐心协力击败了燃烧军团。$B$B这样的行动说明了当政治和宿怨被抛在一边以改善我们的世界时的纯粹力量。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61522,'Mount Hyjal is a sacred place. Be sure to respect it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'海加尔山是一个神圣的地方。 一定要尊重它。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61528,'This glade is hallowed ground. It is my task to watch over it, and protect it until my final moments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这片空地是圣地。 我的任务就是守护它，保护它直到我生命的最后一刻。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61529,'If it is expertise in the ranged mastery of the bow you seek, you have come to the correct place $c.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果您寻求的是弓的远程掌握方面的专业知识，那么您来对地方了$c。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61530,'Please, make yourself at home.$B$BThere is great harmony found beneath the shade of Nordrassil.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'请不要客气。$B$B在诺达希尔的阴影下发现了伟大的和谐。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61531,'The draw of the Emerald Dream is intense. The emanations of the awakening make it even more difficult to keep on task.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'翡翠梦境的吸引力非常强烈。 觉醒的散发使继续任务变得更加困难。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61534,'Remember to be careful walking these roads. Dark times have arrived in Gilneas, and only through vigilance can it be restored.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'记住走这些路要小心。 吉尔尼斯的黑暗时代已经到来，只有保持警惕才能恢复。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61535,'I expected Gilneas to be a safe haven for us refugees. I never imagined it would be as bad as Silverpine Forest.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我希望吉尔尼斯成为我们难民的避风港。 我从没想过它会像银松森林一样糟糕。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61536,'It takes a lot of thinking to make a limited amount of food last for a large group of people.$B$BSawdust can be used to thicken or increase portions of food.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'为一大群人准备有限的食物需要花很多心思。$B$B锯末可以用来增稠或增加食物的份量。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61537,'Did you hear that?!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你听到了吗？！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61539,'Welcome to Ravenshire. We are accommodating to the plight of those affected by the tyranny of Greymane.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到拉文郡。 我们正在适应那些受格雷迈恩暴政影响的人们的困境。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61540,'We once served Gilneas with great pride. It is an odd feeling to be fighting against the powers that hold it hostage.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们曾经非常自豪地为吉尔尼斯服务。 与将其作为人质的力量作斗争是一种奇怪的感觉。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61559,'The phantom seems lost in time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'幻影似乎迷失在时间里。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61560,'It is my duty to ward Hyjal from the evil that lurks beyond.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我有责任保护海加尔山免受潜伏在远处的邪恶的侵害。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61561,'The summit of Hyjal truly is a sight to behold.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'海加尔峰确实是一个值得一看的景点。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61562,'We must do our part to fight the corruption lingering in Hyjal.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们必须尽自己的一份力量来对抗海加尔山脉中的腐化。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61563,'Climbing the mountain to Nordanaar has become more dangerous as of late. I would advise caution.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'最近登上诺达纳尔山变得更加危险。我建议小心。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61568,'What is it that you require?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你需要什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61570,'I am afraid I cannot entertain guests. I am currently busy with my studies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'很抱歉，我不能接待客人。我目前正在忙于研究。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61571,'Welcome to Karazhan!$B$BI am afraid the master of the tower is currently away on business, and is not expected to return for some time. Please, make yourself at home, and enjoy our hospitality.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到卡拉赞！$B$B很抱歉，塔楼的主人目前因公务不在，预计会有一段时间才能返回。请随意，如在家一般地享受我们的款待。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61572,'I have come to offer my assistance in these dark lands. Though I have found nothing but the twisted evil of rot and decay.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我来到这些黑暗的土地上提供我的帮助。 然而，我只发现了扭曲的邪恶、腐烂和衰败。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61574,'Me sick of fighting, no want no violence.$B$BNo fight, me sell-sell!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我讨厌战斗，不想有暴力。不战斗，我卖卖货物！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61576,'There is much to learn and discover in this world. Make sure your eyes and ears are open.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这个世界有很多东西可以学习和探索。确保你的眼睛和耳朵是敞开的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61577,'Greetings $r. I am Annesastrasza of the Red Dragonflight. I have been sent here to protect the world tree from those who would abuse its power. Although a lot of the energy from Nordrassil was expended when Archimonde was defeated, more still remains.$B$BRemnants of Archimonde\'s forces continue to intrude upon the mountain as they plot to capture the tree. My people are the protectors of Life, and the fall of the world tree to demons would be catastrophic for all, it might even bring the Legion back. Should you learn anything pertaining to this matter, let me know.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好 $r。 我是红龙军团的安娜斯塔萨。 我被派到这里是为了保护世界树免受那些滥用其力量的人的侵害。 尽管阿克蒙德被击败后，诺达希尔的大量能量被消耗掉，但仍有更多能量残留下来。$B$B阿克蒙德军队的残余力量继续入侵山峰，密谋夺取这棵树。 我的人民是生命的保护者，世界树落入恶魔之手对所有人来说都是灾难性的，它甚至可能让燃烧军团卷土重来。 如果您了解到任何与此事有关的信息，请告诉我。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61578,'I be Trak\'nal, Shadowhunter of the Shadowtooth tribe. My duty to protect our ancestral home remains in spite of these difficult times. These demons will fall by my blade, as will anyone endangering the mountain. You be delaying the killing. What do you want?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是特拉克纳尔，影牙部落的暗影猎手。尽管面临困难的时刻，我仍然有责任保护我们的祖先之地。这些恶魔将在我的刀锋下倒下，任何危害这座山脉的人也会如此。你只是在拖延死亡。你想要什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61579,'Hello! Please be quiet, it is important that the demons don\'t take note of me. It is my duty to keep an eye on them. Can I help you somehow?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好！ 请保持安静，重要的是不要让恶魔注意到我。 关注他们是我的职责。 我可以帮助你吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61580,'Hi! You seem very capable $r! Welcome to Hyjal! I wish the mountain was in a better state, but we are doing our best. Show your respect while here, alright? It\'d be inconvenient if I had to kill you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗨！你似乎非常有能力，$r！欢迎来到海加尔山！我希望这座山能够处于更好的状态，但我们正在尽力而为。在这里要表现出尊重，好吗？如果我不得不杀了你会很不方便。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61581,'The wardens are a dying order, one that has seen better days. That, however, will not stop me from doing my duty. These cretins encroach and defile our sacred mountain. The punishment for this transgression is death, and I intend to duly deliver it, with or without help. Now, what do you want?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'典狱长们是一个垂死的组织，一个已经经历过美好时光的组织。 然而，这不会阻止我履行我的职责。 这些白痴侵犯并玷污了我们的圣山。 对这种罪行的惩罚就是死亡，无论有没有帮助，我都打算按时执行死刑。 现在，你想要什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61583,'An outsider approaches.$B$BWelcome to Thalanaar. I am Commander Anashya Starfall.$B$BI have been banished by my own General for what she considers insubordination, though she clearly underestimated the loyalty of my squad. Now we find ourselves here, cast aside by our own leaders who have lost sight of what truly matters - the safety of our people and the preservation of our ancestors\' legacy.$B$BFor millennia, the Night Elves have held dominion over these lands, and we shall continue to do so until the end of time. Do I make myself clear?$B$BExcellent. Let us proceed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'一个局外人走过来。欢迎来到塔拉纳。我是阿纳希亚·星陨指挥官。被我的将军驱逐了因为她认为她不服从命令，尽管她明显低估了我小队的忠诚。现在我们发现自己在这里，被我们自己的领导人抛弃，他们忽视了真正重要的事情——我们人民的安全和保护我们祖先的遗产。几千年来，暗夜精灵一直统治着这片土地，我们将继续统治下去，直到时间的尽头。我说的够清楚了吗?太好了。让我们继续。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61584,'Feralas, a land of unrivaled beauty, remains as one of the last sanctuaries of untamed nature in the southern Kalimdor. Come, immerse yourself in its magnificence and sense the ancient tales of our kin.$B$BAlas, these territories have been abandoned for far too long and have now fallen prey to those who seek to obliterate our heritage and fade it into oblivion.$B$BI have been summoned here to reclaim what rightfully belongs to us and I shall not rest until it is done. Perhaps, fate will guide you to aid me in this noble cause.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'菲拉斯是一片美丽无比的土地，至今仍然是卡利姆多南部最后的原始自然保护区之一。 来吧，让自己沉浸在它的壮丽之中，感受我们亲属的古老故事。$B$BAlas，这些领土已经被遗弃太久了，现在已经成为那些试图抹杀我们遗产并将其遗忘的人的牺牲品。$ B$BI 被召集到这里来收回应属于我们的东西，直到完成为止我不会休息。 也许，命运会引导你帮助我完成这个崇高的事业。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61585,'Greetings, $r. I regret that our meeting takes place in such unfavorable conditions. These lands are far from hospitable, and despite what the druids may suggest, I find the melodious bird songs of Ashenvale preferable to the relentless downpours of this untamed jungle or the parched gusts of Thousand Needles.$B$BMight I ask what brings you to this place? If you seek to discuss our current circumstances, I implore you to abstain. This matter concerns the Sentinels exclusively, and it will be addressed by Sentinels alone.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好,$ r。我很遗憾我们的会议在如此不利的条件下举行。这片土地一点也不好客，不管德鲁伊怎么说，我还是觉得灰谷悠扬的鸟鸣比蛮荒丛林无情的倾盆大雨和千针岛的干渴狂风更有魅力。我能问一下是什么风把你吹来了吗?如果你想讨论我们目前的情况，我恳求你弃权。这件事只与哨兵有关，它将由哨兵单独解决。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61586,'No matter how far I retreat from the trappings of civilization, it appears that its grasp is unyielding, relentless in its pursuit.$B$BSpeak your mind, and never come back.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'无论我远离文明的束缚有多远，它似乎总是紧追不放，无情地追赶着我。$B$B说出你的想法，然后永远不要再回来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61587,'Listen well, traveler. My brother may choose to be a pawn in Fandral\'s game, but I am no puppet of the archdruid. I came to these lands to safeguard my younger kin from any perils that may cross his path, and from the gaze of those Sentinels. Always watching…$B$B<Bethelon chuckles and gives a playful wink to one of the Sentinels nearby, causing her to blush and hastily avert her gaze.>$B$BBut enough about them. Know this, I care not for politics, and to be frank, I am weary of its machinations. My foremost allegiance is to the natural world, and I am its willing servant.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'好好听着，旅行者。我兄弟也许选择成为范达尔游戏中的棋子，但我不是大德鲁伊的傀儡。我来到这片土地是为了保护我的年幼族人免受任何可能出现的危险，以及那些哨兵的注视。总是在观察着……$B$B<B贝瑟隆笑了笑，向附近的一位哨兵眨了眨眼，让她脸红地赶紧避开目光。>$B$B但是别再谈论他们了。知道吗，我不关心政治，坦率地说，我已经厌倦了政治的策划。我首要忠诚于自然界，我愿意为之服务。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61588,'Hail, weary traveler. You have ventured far to reach this secluded vale. Though it may appear desolate and in ruins, do not be deceived. This vale was once a place of great importance, a vital stronghold in the defense of our people.$B$BIt is now my solemn duty to restore it to its former glory, to bring new life to these crumbling monuments and to train a new generation of chimaeras to defend the people of Kalimdor.$B$BBut I cannot do it alone.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，疲惫的旅行者。 你已经冒险了很远才到达这个僻静的山谷。 虽然它可能看起来荒凉和废墟，但不要被欺骗。 这个山谷曾经是一个非常重要的地方，是保卫我们人民的重要据点。$B$B 现在我的庄严职责是恢复它以前的辉煌，为这些摇摇欲坠的纪念碑带来新的生命，并训练一个 新一代的奇美拉来保卫卡利姆多人民。$B$B但我无法独自做到这一点。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61590,'It is exciting to train under the guidance of such an experienced mentor. While he may seem harsh at times, it is only because he knows that the lessons he teaches are vital. Chimaeras are vicious creatures, and one mistake can be the difference between life and death.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在如此有经验的导师的指导下接受训练是令人兴奋的。尽管他有时看起来很严厉，但这只是因为他知道他所传授的教训是至关重要的。奇美拉是凶残的生物，一个错误可能是生死之间的区别。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61591,'These lands serve as a stark reminder of what would occur if the Burning Legion were granted a foothold in our world.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这片土地清楚地提醒我们，如果燃烧军团在我们的世界立足，将会发生什么。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61592,'I have been sent here by Fandral Staghelm to investigate and study Ethwyr\'s sacrifice. What has transpired here holds hope not only for Felwood but also for the lands beyond.$B$BIf we can uncover the means to halt the effects of Fel Moss, the future for the Kaldorei will shine brighter than ever before. I advise you not to interrupt me, for there will be grave consequences if you do.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我被范达尔·鹿盔派到这里调查和研究艾斯维尔的牺牲。 这里发生的事情不仅为费伍德森林，也为更远的土地带来了希望。$B$B如果我们能找到阻止邪苔影响的方法，卡多雷的未来将比以往任何时候都更加光明。 我建议你不要打扰我，否则后果很严重。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65003,'I don\'t suppose you\'re here for a mere chit-chat. Take a rest, spend your coins and leave me be, mortal.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我猜你并不是来闲聊的。休息一下，花掉你的金币，然后离开我，凡人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65013,'This place is quite puzzling, but it has great business!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这个地方相当令人困惑，但生意非常好！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65014,'I invoke the Ancient Pact! Dreamways, open before me.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我召唤古老的契约！梦境之路，在我面前开启。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'I invoke the Ancient Pact! Dreamways, open before me.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我激发古老的契约！梦境之路，在我面前展开。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65015,'Something is wrong…',NULL,NULL,NULL,'某些地方出现了问题...',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Something is wrong…',NULL,NULL,NULL,'出现了问题…',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65016,'I invoke the Ancient Pact! Open the way to the Emerald Dream!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我援引远古契约！ 开启通往翡翠梦境的道路！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'I invoke the Ancient Pact! Open the way to the Emerald Dream!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我唤起古老的盟约！打开通往翡翠梦境的道路！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65017,'These were the minions of Nightmare for sure. Oh, what is happening…',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这些肯定是梦魇的爪牙。 哦，这是怎么回事……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'These were the minions of Nightmare for sure. Oh, what is happening…',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这绝对是噩梦之灾的爪牙。哦，发生了什么……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65018,'Who dares to open the Dreamways?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'谁敢开启梦境之路？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Who dares to open the Dreamways?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'谁敢开启梦境之路？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65019,'Lady Ysera… ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'伊瑟拉女士…',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Lady Ysera… ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'伊瑟拉女士…',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65020,'Speak quickly, Ralathius. The Nightmare is advancing on our positions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'说快一点，拉拉修斯。 梦魇正在逼近我们的阵地。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Speak quickly, Ralathius. The Nightmare is advancing on our positions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'说快一点，拉拉修斯。 梦魇正在逼近我们的阵地。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65021,'We are in need of your blessing, my lady. I’ve found a mortal soul willing to stop the Awakening.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们需要您的祝福，女士。我找到了一个愿意阻止“觉醒”的凡人灵魂。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'We are in need of your blessing, my lady. I’ve found a mortal soul willing to stop the Awakening.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们需要您的祝福，女士。 我找到了一个愿意阻止觉醒的凡人灵魂。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65022,'Not a moment too soon. Solnius already enclosed himself in the Emerald Sanctum. The Awakening is upon us.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'来得正式时候。 索尔纽斯已经将自己封闭在翡翠圣殿之中。 觉醒即将来临。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Not a moment too soon. Solnius already enclosed himself in the Emerald Sanctum. The Awakening is upon us.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'来得正式时候。 索尔纽斯已经将自己封闭在翡翠圣殿之中。 觉醒即将来临。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65023,'Yet, I cannot grant my blessing to this mortal. It is too dangerous. The Dreamway in Hyjal can be destroyed at any moment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'然而，我无法赐予这名凡人我的祝福。这太危险了。海加尔山的梦境之路随时可能被摧毁。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Yet, I cannot grant my blessing to this mortal. It is too dangerous. The Dreamway in Hyjal can be destroyed at any moment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'然而，我无法赐予这名凡人我的祝福。这太危险了。海加尔山的梦境之路随时可能被摧毁。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65024,'Larannikus has fallen to the Nightmare. In this very moment, he is working to sever the connection of the Dream to the World Tree.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'拉兰尼库斯陷入了梦魇。 此时此刻，他正在努力切断梦境与世界树的联系。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Larannikus has fallen to the Nightmare. In this very moment, he is working to sever the connection of the Dream to the World Tree.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'拉兰尼库斯陷入了梦魇。 此时此刻，他正在努力切断梦境与世界树的联系。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65025,'If this happens… The reflection of Nordrassil in the Dream would be vulnerable to attack, and the Dreamways would close, trapping those without the innate ability to Dreamwalk.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果发生这种情况……诺达希尔在梦境中的倒影将很容易受到攻击，梦境之路将关闭，困住那些不具备梦境行走能力的人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'If this happens… The reflection of Nordrassil in the Dream would be vulnerable to attack, and the Dreamways would close, trapping those without the innate ability to Dreamwalk.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n如果这样发生的话，梦境中诺达希尔的映像将会变得容易受到攻击，而梦境之路也会关闭，困住那些没有天生梦行能力的人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65026,'Larannikus must be slain before I grant my blessing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在我给予祝福之前，必须先杀死拉兰尼库斯。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Larannikus must be slain before I grant my blessing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在我给予祝福之前，必须先杀死拉兰尼库斯。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65027,'Lady Ysera, they are approaching. We must go.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'伊瑟拉女士，他们正在逼近。 我们必须走了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Lady Ysera, they are approaching. We must go.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'伊瑟拉女士，他们正在逼近。 我们必须走了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65028,'Ralathius, my faithful servant. The fate of the Emerald Dream is in your hands.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'拉拉休斯，我忠实的仆人。 翡翠梦境的命运掌握在你的手中。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Ralathius, my faithful servant. The fate of the Emerald Dream is in your hands.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'拉拉休斯，我忠实的仆人。 翡翠梦境的命运掌握在你的手中。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65029,'Oh no…',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不好了…',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Oh no…',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不好了…',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65030,'%s stops his cast.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'%s中断了施法。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'%s stops his cast.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'%s中断了施法。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(65100,'Ready \'mon?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'准备好了吗，伙计？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Ready \'mon?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'准备好了吗，伙计？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66004,'<An eerie gaze pierces your soul.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'一双诡异的眼眸穿透了你的灵魂。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(70000,'Who would have thought combining the usefulness of a telescope with a mining pick would be such a hit! I\'m sure a fine $r like you can see the appeal!$B$BIf you want one yourself, bring me an Ornate Spyglass and some Light Leather, let\'s say around... 10 pieces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'谁会想到将望远镜的实用性与采矿镐结合起来会如此受欢迎！ 我确信像您这样的精美 $r 可以看到它的吸引力！$B$B如果您自己想要一个，请给我带来一个华丽的望远镜和一些浅色皮革，比如说...... 10 件左右。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(70001,'Do you really think I\'m going to show my mining secrets to just anyone who wanders into town? Ha! Come back to me when people around here consider you a bit more friendly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你真以为我会向随便进城的人透露我的采矿秘密吗？哈！等你在这附近的人认为你更友好一些再来找我吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(70002,'Hey $r, I see you have there one of my creations. Probably your best choice yet.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿 $r，我看到你那里有我的一件作品。 可能是你迄今为止最好的选择了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(70003,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Oh, a true traveler, good to see you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，真正的旅行者，很高兴见到你！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(70004,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Oh my, we have a visitor here!$B$B<Dinka ponders>$B$BSadly my magic only works on those who\'ve travelled enough, come back once you\'ve seen enough world.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，我的，我们这里有位访客！$B$B<迪卡思沉思着>$B$B可惜我的魔法只对那些已经旅行过足够多的人有效，等你见识足够多的世界后再回来吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(70005,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Here, here, slow down, there\'s no rush, I\'m not going anywhere!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗨，嗨，慢点，不要着急，我不会走的！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80000,'We are friends. Do not run.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们是朋友。不要逃跑。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80001,'Target unrecognized. Proceed with extermination.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'目标未被识别。继续执行消灭任务。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80002,'Target acquired. Termination activated.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'目标已获得。终结程序已激活。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80003,'Threat detected, activating protocol 66.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'检测到威胁，激活66号协议。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80004,'Exterminate hostile.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'消灭敌对目标。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80005,'Exterminate.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'消灭。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80011,'Error 132: Memory cannot be read.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'错误 132：无法读取内存。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80012,'Error 132: Fatal Exception.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'错误 132：致命异常。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80013,'Error 134: Failed to open required archive...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'错误 134：无法打开所需的存档...',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80014,'Error 132: Access Violation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'错误 132: 访问冲突。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80015,'Error... Shutting down.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'错误… 关闭中。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80016,'System processing. Error. Error. Error.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'系统处理中。错误。错误。错误。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80100,'First day on the job, eh kid?\n\nYeah, I used to be young and green like you once. Now I\'m just green! What can you do, eh?\n\nAnyway, enough slacking. Back to work or I\'m taking it out of your pay!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'第一天上班，是吗，小子？\n\n是的，我曾经也像你这样年轻有朝气，青涩。现在我只是绿色而已！你知道吗？\n\n不管怎样，别再偷懒了。继续工作，否则我会从你的工资里扣钱的！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80101,'How ya doin\', kid? Come give ol\' Mama Sprat a hug. Don\'t be shy!\n\nI gots the best cooking skills around here and I can make anything at hand edible.\n\nI\'ll feed ya well, just like your mama used to. Unless she didn\'t... then think of me as your new mama!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你怎么样，孩子？ 来给老妈妈斯普拉特一个拥抱吧。 别害羞！\n\n我在这里拥有最好的烹饪技巧，我可以将手头的任何东西都变成可食用的。\n\n我会把你喂饱的，就像你妈妈以前那样。 除非她不...那就把我当作你的新妈妈吧！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80104,'Hey pal, looking for some training in how to rough somebody up?\n\nHere\'s some advice: First, you go for the knees. Once they\'re at your level, they won\'t be lookin\' down on you no more. Catch my drift?\n\nThat\'s solid advice. You owe me a few copper for it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，伙计，想学点如何打斗的本领吗？\n\n这里有点建议：首先，你要攻击对方的膝盖。一旦他们和你在一个高度，他们就不会再看不起你了。明白我的意思吗？\n\n这是实用的建议。为了这个建议，你欠我几个铜币。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80105,'Guns. Man, I love guns. Don\'t you, $N?\n\nEverytime I hear that thundering BOOM, it gets my blood pumping. Need some firearm training? If you got the coin, I got the skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'枪支。哥们，我喜欢枪支。你呢，$N？\n\n每次我听到那震耳欲聋的轰鸣声，我的血液都会涌动起来。需要一些火器训练吗？只要你有银币，我就有技能。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80106,'What\'s better than a bag of coins, $N? A bag of coins you pilfered from some sucker\'s pocket. Better than that? One you pried from their cold, dead hands.\n\nI hear you can sell a whole body for some nice coin, too... So don\'t test me.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'有什么比一袋硬币更好，$N？一袋硬币是你从某个笨蛋的口袋里偷走的。比这更好？是你从他们冰冷的死手中掰下来的。\n\n我听说你可以把整具尸体卖个好价钱，所以别来考验我。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80107,'Nobody ever suspects the goblins, $N. Nobody! So who\'s going to think twice about a little dabbling in the dark arts?\n\nI bet you\'re just itching to learn how to summon a succubus... or maybe your tastes are inclined towards an incubus? Business before pleasure, pal. Coin first, summoning spells after!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'没人会怀疑地精，$N。绝对没有！所以谁会对涉足黑暗的艺术多想一下？\n\n我打赌你已经迫不及待地想学如何召唤魅魔了……或者也许你的兴趣倾向于男性恶魔？先做生意，再谈享乐，伙计。先付钱，然后再学召唤咒语！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80108,'Hey there, best pal! You looking to try your hand at some magic? Wizardry? You look like you got big brains like me. You could make a lot of coin with spells like these.\n\nConjure up some water, some food, open portals. All these conveniences mean one thing: Cha-ching! Of course, you\'ll have to slide me some coin if you want to make some coin, feel me?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，最好的伙伴！你想尝试一下魔法吗？巫术？你看起来脑子很聪明，就像我一样。你可以用这些法术赚很多钱。\n\n变出一些水，一些食物，开个传送门。所有这些便利意味着一件事：咔嚓！当然了，如果你想赚点钱，就得给我滑些硬币，明白我的意思吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80121,'Durotar ain\'t exactly a vacation destination. Sand and scorpids and harpies, and apparently they\'ve added some sort of demonic cult since my last visit. Still, it\'s better than finding yourself on the wrong end of a Venture Co. brute squad.\n\n<Nert sighs.>\n\nI used to be the brute squad.\n\nAnyways, a good businessman is always looking forward. Where there\'s scarcity, there\'s opportunity. The Horde seems to specialize in colonizing the most hostile wastelands on the face of Azeroth, so with enough know-how, I bet I can make enough to vacation on the South Sea island of my choice.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'杜隆塔尔可不像什么度假胜地。满地沙漠、蝎子和鹰身女妖，而且显然在我上次来的时候，还增加了某种恶魔教派。不过，这还总比让自己落入风险投资公司暴徒队伍的错误一端要好。\n\n<纳特 叹了口气。>\n\n我以前也是那个暴徒队伍的一员。\n\n无论如何，一个好的商人总是向前看的。在稀缺之处，就有机会。部落似乎擅长在艾泽拉斯上最恶劣的荒原上定居，所以只要掌握足够的技巧，我打赌我能赚足够的钱，在南海度过我选择的岛屿假期。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80130,'What you actually want to learn how to use a weapon?!\n\nSure, sure pal, don\'t get me wrong it\'s just that these other guys are mostly cowards, ye know?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你居然还想学会如何使用武器？！\n\n当然，当然，朋友，别误会，只是这些其他家伙大多都是懦夫，你明白吧？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80136,'I don’t just teach anyone, pal. Come back to me when we’re on better terms.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我可不会随便教任何人，朋友。 当我们关系好一点的时候再来找我吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80200,'Thank the Sunwell you made it here in one piece, $N. We have much to do.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'感谢太阳之井，让你一路平安抵达这里，$N。 我们有很多事情要做。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80217,'Our people pride themselves on their intellect and their mastery of magic, but you and I both know that occasionally, a more forceful approach is necessary.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们的种族以智慧和魔法为傲，但你和我知道，有时候需要更加粗暴的方法。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80218,'Ever since the Sunwell fell, we\'ve strained to minimize the amount of mana we expend. We used to be paragons of arcane power; now, we are a mere shadow of our former selves.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'随着太阳之井的消失，我们努力尽量少使用法力。我们曾经是奥术的楷模，$N。现在看看我们。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80219,'The Farstriders were a proud group of rangers. With the downfall of our homeland, most of them, too, have passed away. Still, their legacy will live on through us.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'远行者曾经是一支充满荣耀的游侠队伍。随着我们家园的沦陷，他们也消失了。然而，他们的遗志将在我们心中继续传承。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80220,'It is only by the grace of the Light that we stand here today, and we will be the ones to defend our people against the Scourge and other threats. However, remember that justice is to be dealt fairly, not blindly guided by vengeance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'正是因为圣光的祝福，我们今天才能站在这里，$N。我们将为我们的种族复仇，对抗天灾和其他威胁的人，但要记住教训。通过正义来实现复仇。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80221,'These are bleak times, but our kin must be guided towards the Light. Their wounds, while they cannot be healed entirely, must be attended to with all our might.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这是黑暗的时代，$N，但我们必须引导我们的同胞走向光明。我们必须尽力治愈他们的伤口。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80223,'Whether you want to steal from a noble\'s pocket, explore the dark corners, or break into a chest, always remember the Sunwell.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'无论你是想从贵族的口袋里偷东西，深入阴影，还是撬开某人的箱子，请记住太阳之井。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80227,'You have journeyed a great distance. Rest your weary body under our roof, and may the Sun guide you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'亲爱的，你已经走了很长的路。 让你疲惫的骨头在我们的屋檐下休息，愿永恒的阳光照耀着你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80243,'These are dark times, $N, but we must guide our kin to the Light, and we must tend to their wounds as best as we can.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这是黑暗的时代，$N，但我们必须引导我们的亲人走向光明，我们必须尽我们最大的努力照顾他们的伤口。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80244,'It is by the blessings of the Light we both stand here today, $N, we will be the ones to avenge our people, against the Scourge and other threads, but remember the teachings, vengeance by justice.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'正是在圣光的祝福下，我们今天站在这里，$N，我们将成为为我们的人民报仇的人，对抗天灾军团和其他线索，但请记住教义，正义复仇。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80245,'The Farstriders were a proud group of rangers, with the fall of our land they too have been left behind, yet it is in us that their legacy will live on.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'远行者是一群自豪的游侠，随着我们土地的沦陷，他们也被抛在了后面，但他们的遗产将在我们身上继续存在。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80246,'With the Sunwell gone, we strife to use as little mana as possible, we used to be a pillar of the Arcane, $N, now look at us.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'随着太阳之井的消失，我们努力使用尽可能少的法力，我们曾经是奥术的支柱，$N，现在看看我们。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80247,'Our kin prides itself with intellect and magic, but you and I know that sometimes a more brutish approach is needed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们的亲属以智慧和魔法而自豪，但你我都知道，有时需要采取更野蛮的方法。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80248,'Whether you want to steal from a noble\'s pocket, crawl into the shadows or lockpick someone\'s chest, remember the Sunwell.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'无论你是想从贵族的口袋里偷东西、爬进阴影还是撬开某人的箱子，请记住太阳之井。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80450,'Greetings, $C, are you here to aid us? If so I will be more than rejoiced, as soon as we stabilize the barrier or neutralize the targets, the better, you have no idea what crawls in there.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，$C，你是来帮助我们的吗？ 如果是这样我会非常高兴，只要我们稳定住结界或者消灭目标就更好了，你根本不知道里面有什么爬行。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80451,'Hi, how are you?\n\nI’m Koli, here to make sure we deal with this, please be friendly to one another, no time to squabble!\n\nThere will be enough violence when you reach inside.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好你好吗？\n\n我是酷尼，来这里是为了确保我们处理好这件事，请彼此友好，没有时间争吵！\n\n当你进入内部时，就会有足够的暴力。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80452,'I teach only elves of Silvermoon Remnants and their allies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我只教导银月城遗迹的精灵和他们的盟友。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80460,'I wish I knew an older, wiser tree. Trees are supposed to have beautiful foliage, but mine is wilted and dying.\n\nAm I going to survive?	',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我希望我能认识一棵年长、智慧的树。树应该有着美丽的叶子，但我却枯萎且快要死了。\n\n我会存活下来吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80601,'Hey, if you aren\'t spending coins, you might as well get out. You\'re bothering my real customers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，如果你不花金币，你还不如出去。 你打扰了我真正的客户。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80602,'Heya, sweetie. Here to make a long time investement?\n\nMaybe you wanna gamble, little $c? Tell me how much and I\'ll throw the dice. If the roll is above 50, I will double the bet. If it’s lower than 50, it\'s gone forever.\n\nIf you win three times in a row using the same amount, the reward is tripled, but only if the 3rd roll is above 75. If it’s below 75 on the 3rd roll, your gold will be gone too.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，亲爱的。 来这里进行长期投资？\n\n也许你想赌博，小$c？ 告诉我多少钱，我就掷骰子。 如果掷骰数超过 50，我将加倍赌注。 如果低于 50，它就永远消失了。\n\n如果您使用相同金额连续获胜三次，奖励将增加三倍，但前提是第 3 次掷骰高于 75。如果第 3 次掷骰低于 75，您的金币也会消失。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80603,'<The Goblin Bruiser stands with his chest puffed up and continues to mumble under his breath.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<地精暴徒站在那里，嘴里嘟囔着，胸口还鼓鼓的。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80605,'My gut feelin\' be tellin\' me there\'s something more going on \'round this bar.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我内心的直觉告诉我这家酒吧周围有些不对劲。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80855,'Don\'t underestimate what a gnome with a gun can do, $c!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不要低估一个拿着枪的侏儒能做什么，$c！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80867,'<Zul’jin’s eye moves up and down, analyzing you from head to toe.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<祖尔金的眼睛从上到下扫视着你，仔细观察着你。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80877,'In our people\'s most trying times, it was my unwavering commitment that brought us together to forge this sanctuary of hope. Through earnest efforts, I mended the bonds between our kin and the Alliance, restoring the trust that had faltered. I never sought regal titles or aspirations of grandeur, merely recognizing the pressing need for steadfast leadership.$B$BYet, in the halls of our own kin, where nobility should be defined by honor and foresight, a blindness persists. The noble families, entangled in webs of influence and wealth, fail to perceive the true nature of our collective journey. Unjustly stripped of the title of Speaker, a position embraced not for personal gain but for the welfare of our people, I stand witness to a disheartening diversion of focus.$B$BInstead of marshaling our resources and collective wisdom to face the pressing challenges that loom before us, we find ourselves mired in needless debates that obscure the clarity of our path forward.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，我知道事情不应该如此，但为了我人民的未来必须做出让步。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80903,'I teach goblins to use both their muscles and brain.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我教导地精如何运用他们的肌肉和大脑。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80925,'Why hello there, $c, is there anything I could do for you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，$c，有什么可以为您效劳的吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80943,'Are you looking to gain standing with the Wardens, mortal? Are you looking to keep harmony within the strands of time?\n\nLook no further then here, each day we remain idle is another day that chaos begins to tear apart order.\n\nThe forces that seek to undermine our work will not stop. There is always more that can be done, and you are here for that very reason, are you not?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你是想要在守望者中获得声望吗，凡人？你是想要在时间的纽带中保持和谐吗？\n\n那就别再寻找了，我们每天的闲置都是混乱开始撕裂秩序的一天。\n\n那些试图破坏我们工作的力量不会停止。总有更多可以做的事情，你不正是为了这个原因而来吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(81030,'Well, well... You\'ve had a change of heart, hm? So all of a sudden, you decide that you have business with me? Well, I do not have business with YOU.\n\nBegone!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯，嗯... 你改变主意了，嗯？突然间，你决定与我有事情要办？好吧，我与你无关。\n\n滚开！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(81050,'I am truly privileged that the Dark Lady has entrusted me with sharing her knowledge.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我真的很荣幸黑暗女士委托我分享她的知识。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(81055,'Our nation stands strong! I did what was neccesary.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们的民族坚强无比！我所做的是必要之举。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90001,'Thank you for your continued support.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'感谢您一如既往的支持。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90002,'What... What is this place? Am I alive?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这……这是什么地方？ 我还活着吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90003,'Pssst... I can make you hide who you really are with some fake papers if you bring me 5 gold.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘘... 如果你给我5金币，我可以帮你弄一些假文件，让你隐藏你的真实身份。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90004,'Even the best blade will rust and grow dull unless it is cared for. You have chosen your weapon, so fight!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'即使是最好的刀剑，如果不加护理，也会生锈变钝。你已经选择了你的武器，所以战斗吧！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90010,'All it took was to fill his belly with apples and he\'s following me now!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'只需要给他填饱肚子，吃了些苹果，他就跟着我了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90011,'I\'d like to ride a turtle! What should I do?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我想骑海龟！ 我应该怎么办？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90012,'Hey there little guy. Here\'s a delicious apple for you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，小家伙。这是一颗美味的苹果给你！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90013,'Really? No apple? I don\'t think so.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'真的吗？没有苹果吗？我不这么认为。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90014,'Let\'s go!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们走吧！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90015,'Good job! Talk again to this little guy and he will allow you to ride him!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'做得好！再和这只小家伙说话，他就会让你骑在他背上！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90016,'This little turtle seems to only care about red apples.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这只小海龟似乎只对红苹果感兴趣。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90017,'I don\'t like you, go away! Bring me some delicious apples.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我不喜欢你，走开！给我带点美味的苹果来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90018,'Hmmm... This apple is great! *nom* *nom* Take me to my friend and MAYBE I\'ll let you ride me. Let\'s go!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯... 这个苹果真好吃！*吧嗒**吧嗒* 带我去找我的朋友，也许我会让你骑我。走吧',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90019,'We\'re goin\' to Vegas... I mean, to Booty Bay!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们要去维加斯……我是说，去藏宝海湾！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90020,'You must tame a turtle first!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你必须先驯服一只海龟！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90100,'Greetings, $GLord:Lady; Turtle $N!\n\nWe need your help defending our lands from the encroaching invaders!\n\nTake my hand, and I will guide you to the battlefield.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'您好，$大人：女士； 海龟$N!\n我们需要您的帮助来保卫我们的土地免受入侵者的侵害！\n牵着我的手，我带你去战场。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90101,'Transport to the battlefield is on its way! Slow and steady wins the race. Stand by!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'前往战场的传送即将到来！稳重和从容才能获胜。请耐心等待！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90150,'Hmm, young one, I sense no Blessing of the Spirit of the Wind within you.\n\nDid you speak to Jorn Skyseer or you were chasing the winds in the Barrens?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯，年轻人，我感觉不到你身上有风之精灵的祝福。\n\n你和乔恩·天眼谈过吗？还是你在贫瘠之地追逐风之精灵的踪迹？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90151,'Imagine yourself racing across the plains, through forests and over mountains, the wind in your face...\n\nTraveling over unseen territory; the wonder of the road ahead, your destiny resting just over the horizon.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'想象一下你自己在平原、森林和山脉上奔跑，风吹在你的脸上......\n\n穿越未知的领域； 前方道路的奇迹，你的命运就在地平线的那边等待着。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90152,'Oh, you\'re still wandering around? I\'m sure Saern is awaiting for you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，你还在四处游荡吗？我确定塞恩正在等着你！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90200,'Tha last person that made trouble for Tha’ Greysteels ended up floating in tha canal... catch my drift?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'最后一个给灰钢制造麻烦的人最终漂浮在运河里……明白我的意思了吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90201,'So, you\'ve come to see how far the rabbit hole goes...\n\n-takes out two stones, red and blue-\n\nChoose the blue stone, and you can go back to ferryman Ike, taking the ferry back to Silverpine and forgetting everything that happened here.\n\nChoose the red stone.... And you will come into the camp and discover the truth about the Dark Lady. Be warned, though. Once you join us, we can not easily let you leave, and you will have to turn your back on the Forsaken forever.\n\nChoose carefully.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'那么，你来看看兔子洞有多深…\n\n-拿出两颗石头，一颗红色的，一颗蓝色的-\n\n选蓝色的石头，你可以回到船夫艾克那里，搭乘船回到银松森林，忘记在这里发生的一切。\n\n选红色的石头…你会进入营地，揭示有关黑暗女王的真相。不过要注意，我们就不会轻易让你离开，你将不得不永远背弃被遗忘者。\n\n谨慎选择。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90202,'Lard tunderin\', we made it! Now get yer arses off me boat \'fore ya sink the ol\' girl!\n\nDrinks? If yer guts can handle it, I gots somethin\' fer ye, but don\'t ye go blamin\' me if ye go blind!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'见鬼，我们成功了！现在赶紧从我船上滚下去，别让你们把老船沉了！\n\n喝点东西吗？如果你们的胆量够大，我有一些东西给你们，不过要是你们失明了可别怪我！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90203,'<The guard watches you closely, not saying a word.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<卫兵紧紧地盯着你，一言不发。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90250,'The winner ain\'t the one with the fastest car, it\'s the one who refuses to lose.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'胜利者不是拥有最快赛车的人，而是那个拒绝失败的人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90251,'There\'s no secret. You just press the accelerator to the floor and steer left.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'没有什么秘诀。你只需要将油门踩到底，然后向左转动方向盘。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90252,'Latest news from the best race event ever! Come and get your own magazine!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'来自有史以来最好的赛事的最新消息！ 快来领取属于你自己的杂志吧！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90253,'Hop right in for a first class seating to the Shimmering Flats! A premier traveling experience for a low affordable cost. Best prices anywhere!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'立即跳入闪光平原 的头等舱座位！ 以低廉的价格提供一流的旅行体验。 任何地方最优惠的价格！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90254,'Your prize and rewards right in the middle of the Shimmering Flats in Thousand Needles! Talk to Gregor or Jizzle there to participate in the race!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'您的奖品和奖励就在千针石林的闪光平原中心！与那里的格雷戈尔或吉兹尔交谈，参加比赛吧！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90260,'The Gadgetzan Times, Volume Two, available now! Worth its weight in gold... metaphorically speaking!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'《加基森时报》第二卷现已推出！ 价值超越黄金……打个比方来说！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90300,'Little box starts to crackle and seems like coming to life at your touch. Various buttons and levers are almost asking you to press them so the melody of your choosing could flow toward.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在你触摸下，小盒子开始发出噼啪声，似乎焕发了生机。各种按钮和杠杆几乎在呼唤着你按下它们，这样你就可以选择喜欢的旋律流动出来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90301,'Mortal! Your time hasn\'t come yet!\n\nBegone and be... what?\n\nAbout Speedy? You have my attention, young one...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'凡人！ 你的时间还没到！\n\n离开并成为……什么？\n\n关于迅捷？ 你引起了我的注意，年轻人……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90305,'Yay! Birthday! I heard there\'s a custom to celebrate the birthday once a year and celebration means party. Party means presents! Party means treats! I also heard that party means a lot of joy. What joy is there with no liqour? I mean spirits.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'耶！生日！我听说有一种习惯，一年庆祝一次生日，庆祝意味着派对。派对意味着礼物！派对意味着好吃的！我还听说派对意味着很多快乐。没有酒怎么能有快乐呢？我的意思是烈酒。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90310,'<This sheep looks scared.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<这只绵羊看起来很害怕。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90315,'If a warrior ignores duty, acts dishonorably, or is disloyal, he is nothing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果一个战士忽视了责任，行为不光彩，或者不忠诚，他就是一无是处。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90316,'Peace is bad for business.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'和平对商业不利。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90317,'Another fool walks into his death. Come then, let me show you what happens to those who oppose the Bloodsail!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'又一个傻瓜走向了死亡。来吧，让我展示给你看，那些反抗血帆的人会发生什么！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
