(90319,'%s is starting to drink his Egg Nog.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'%s 开始喝他的蛋奶酒。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90320,'You were a fool to come here, this is Defias land now.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你来这里真是愚蠢，这里现在是迪菲亚的地盘。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90325,'Attention to bravest of heroes!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，勇敢的英雄们，请注意！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90326,'<Snowman sings.>\n\nTwas the feast of Great-Winter, and all through the land, all the races were running with snowballs in hand.\n\nWinter Veil has arrived with presents and wonders for everyone! Ho-ho-ho!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<雪人唱歌。>\n\n正值大冬节，大地各地，所有的赛跑都手握雪球。\n\n冬幕节为大家带来了礼物和奇迹！ 哈哈哈！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90328,'Everyone loves a good snowball fight. You scoop up the snow in your numb, blue hands, pet it into a ball and throw it with all your might at your friend.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'每个人都喜欢一个愉快的雪球大战。你用冰凉的蓝色手掌捧起雪花，把它揉成一个球，然后全力以赴地朝你的朋友扔出去。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90330,'Hello there, my friends! It\'s time for Winter Veil! Come and celebrate the holidays with merry revelers at our Winter Veil Vale!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，我的朋友们！ 冬幕节的时间到了！ 快来我们的冬幕谷与欢乐的狂欢者一起庆祝节日吧！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90335,'Tinsel Lost-Gloves am I, my favorite gloves were stolen, oh why can I not cry?!\n\nOf the thieves, I have a list of names long, punish them with frozen fury, for they have done wrong!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是金属丝丢失的手套，我最喜欢的手套被偷了，哦，为什么我不能哭？！\n\n对于盗贼，我有一份长长的名单，用冰冷的愤怒惩罚他们，因为他们做错了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90336,'War! The merry times of Winter Veil are crumbling under attacks by the ruthless adventurers!\n\nThere are heroes on all sides, and snowballs are everywhere!\n\nJoin in the fray, and unleash these freezing projectiles upon the many classes, be rewarded with a box of Winter goodies!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'战争！ 冬幕节的欢乐时光在无情冒险者的攻击下崩溃了！\n\n到处都是英雄，到处都是雪球！\n\n加入战斗，向众多职业释放这些冰冻的投射物，获得一盒冬季糖果的奖励！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90338,'People love chopping wood. In this activity one immediately sees results.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'人们喜欢砍木头。在这个活动中，人们会立即看到结果。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90341,'Redwater Syndicate is a guild that is looking for people to join its ranks,',NULL,NULL,NULL,'红水辛迪加是一个正在寻找人们加入其行列的公会，',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90342,'From glancing it over, you can tell the fine dwarven handywork and gnomish engineering at play. It is a contraption capable of transporting an individual over great distances through the great blue sky. This one specifically seems to fly north to Ardent Watch.\n\nThis machine can transport you up north to the Plaguelands for the small price of 50 silver coins.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'只要看一眼，你就能看出矮人的手工技艺和侏儒的工程技术。 它是一种能够将人运送到广阔的蓝天很远的距离的装置。 这架飞机似乎专门飞往北方的守望。\n\n这台机器只需花费 50 银币就能将你运送到北方的瘟疫之地。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90343,'Elune\'s guiding light shine upon you as it shines upon the valiant defenders of this sorrowful land.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'艾露恩的指引之光照耀着你们，就像它照耀着这片悲伤土地上英勇的捍卫者一样。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90345,'Ugh, you call THAT fashion? What kind of person would allow themselves to be seen in such embarrassing attire.\n\nLuckily for you, for a few fashion coins, I can trade you one of these amazing outfits. You\'ll be the best-dressed $C in town. Talk to me when you\'ve knocked some fashion-sense into your head.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'呃，你管这叫时尚吗？ 什么样的人会允许自己穿着如此尴尬的衣服被人看到。\n\n对你来说幸运的是，只要几块时尚币，我就可以给你换一套这些令人惊叹的服装。 您将成为镇上穿着最好的 $C。 当你脑子里有了一些时尚感时，就跟我说话吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90350,'1. Take the device in both hands.\n\n2. Put it above your head.\n\n3. Let it go.\n\n4. Enjoy the sunshine of the spotless mind.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'1. 双手握住这个装置。\n\n2. 将其置于头顶上方。\n\n3. 放手。\n\n4. 享受一尘不染的心灵的阳光。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90351,'Specially handcrafted planter with fertile and watered Soil.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'精心制作的种植器，配有肥沃的土壤和充足的水分。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90352,'If you have a garden and a library, you have everything you need.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果你有一个花园和一个图书馆，你就拥有了一切所需。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90353,'My grand dream is to grow the World\'s Biggest Pumpkin!\n\nWhat\'s yours?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的宏伟梦想是种出世界上最大的南瓜！\n\n你的梦想是什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90354,'Ahh, Ive been expecting you, $N.\n\nHere to learn how to foster the seeds and care for the soil?\n\nYou\'re just in time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'啊，$N，我已经等候你了。\n\n是来学习如何培育种子和照料土壤的吗？\n\n你来得正是时候。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90355,'I\'m here to study the art of Survival under one of the wisest elders of the Mosshoof tribe, shando Kern.\n\nMy sister tend to the wounds, teaching First Aid and I\'m certain that healing comes from the Earth-Mother much more than any bandage could ever heal, gifts of the Earth itself.\n\nGrowing food is an art I\'m eager to know as good as my own hooves.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我来这里是为了在莫什弗部族最聪明的长老科恩的指导下学习生存的艺术。\n\n我的姐姐疗伤，教授急救知识，我相信治愈远比任何绷带能治愈的东西都来自大地之母的恩赐。\n\n种植食物是我渴望掌握的一门艺术，就像我自己的蹄子一样。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90357,'Dirt. All I\'m left with nowadays.\n\nI\'d rather keep developing new myceliums and grow new kinds of … what?\n\nOh, so you\'re fond of mushrooms too?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'泥土。如今我只剩下这个。\n\n我宁愿继续培育新的菌丝体，种植新种类的……什么？\n\n哦，你也喜欢蘑菇吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90358,'Aren\'t you like any other think the same when you see me all alone here digging through the dirt piles?\n\nDon\'t worry, that\'s only natural.\n\nAfter all you\'re not even close to fungal life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'当你看到我独自一人在这里挖掘泥土堆时，难道你不会和其他人一样想吗？\n\n别担心，那是很自然的事情。\n\n毕竟，你离真菌生活还差得远呢。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90360,'For a small while, still alive, an epitomy of audacity, bravery and stupidity in one face of mine you can witness if you think you\'ll be able to manage there on your own.\n\nThat horrifying monstrosity is nothing like you\'ve ever seen.\n\nOnly half of it is spider-like… <coughs in blood> undead… ten people at least…',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在我还活着的一小段时间里，我的一张脸上体现了大胆、勇敢和愚蠢，如果你认为自己能够独自应对，你可以亲眼目睹。\n\n那个可怕的怪物是你从未见过的。\n\n只有一半是蜘蛛状的……<咳嗽着流血>亡灵……至少十个人……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90361,'Those spiders aren\'t anything I ever killed.\n\nFull group, no … three would be needed to even scratch that beast there.\n\nNever go alone in these lands! Never!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'那些蜘蛛不是我杀死的任何东西。\n\n整个小组，不……甚至需要三个人才能抓伤那只野兽。\n\n永远不要独自去这些地方！永远不要！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90362,'Hey, you! We could use your help here!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，你！ 我们需要您的帮助！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90365,'<The horse seems to like you.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<这匹马似乎很喜欢你。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90366,'The gryphon\'s languid demeanor suggests he\'s not ready for flight any time soon.\n\nLethargic and hungry, no doubt. Some spare Dwarven Mild would perk him right up and likely earn you a flight.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'狮鹫的懒洋洋的举止表明他还没有做好飞行的准备。\n\n毫无疑问，昏昏欲睡和饥饿。 一些多余的矮人温和会让他立刻振作起来，并可能为你赢得一张航班。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90367,'Trust is something you can\'t buy, $C.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'信任是你买不到的东西，$C。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90368,'The wolf scratches the ground looking for something. As you approach, it looks up. A new smell has caught its attention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这只狼在地上刨寻着什么东西。当你靠近时，它抬起头来。一股新的气味引起了它的注意。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
