(90500,'Ishnu-Alah, and welcome to the Shadowleaf Infantry Outpost, we came from Feralas and we are aiding Tyrande and her people in order to free this land from corruption, and also make sure the Horde doesn’t destroy our forests!\n\nOh, sorry if I am bothering you with our problems, since you are here, feel free to buy some food or even stay here for the night if you wish.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'伊什努-阿拉，欢迎来到影叶步兵前哨站，我们来自菲拉斯，我们正在帮助泰兰德和她的人民，以将这片土地从腐败中解放出来，并确保部落不会破坏我们的森林！\n\n哦，抱歉，如果我因为我们的问题打扰您，既然您在这里，请随意买一些食物，如果您愿意的话，甚至可以在这里过夜。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90501,'I’m a free knight! I don’t have a lord. You got a problem with that?\n\n<She glares at you for a moment before lighting up.>\n\nAh whatever... Welcome to our chapel! I can give you a sleeping bag or offer you some rations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是一名自由骑士！我没有领主。你对此有意见吗？\n\n<她瞪了你一会儿，然后神情变得愉快。>\n\n啊，不管了... 欢迎来到我们的教堂！我可以给你提供一个睡袋，或者给你一些口粮。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
