(90666,'You should check the auction house right now for some unbelievable deals.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'您现在应该检查拍卖行是否有一些令人难以置信的交易。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90667,'I hope you know how to swim.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我希望你会游泳。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90668,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'My unicorns are for sale only to the elves of the Silvermoon Remnants and to their exalted allies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的独角兽只出售给银月城遗迹的精灵和他们尊贵的盟友。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90670,'Shark looks at you with curiosity and pry at your hands as if expecting something.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'鲨鱼好奇地看着你，然后扒拉你的手，好像在期待什么。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(90987,'Our ship got wrecked a few weeks ago, I\'ve been managing to survive. The murlocs can certainly cause issues, are you willing to help?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'几周前我们的船失事了，我设法活了下来。 鱼人肯定会引起麻烦，你愿意帮忙吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91190,'What brings you to the stead?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'是什么让你来到这个农场的？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91191,'The Argent Dawn fights in far away lands to maintain order within Azeroth, even as chaos lurks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'银色黎明在遥远的土地上战斗，以维护艾泽拉斯内部的秩序，尽管混乱潜伏。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91200,'It\'s all about goblin precision, you think an orc could work such delicate parts?\n\nWhatcha need, bub?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这都是关于地精的精确，你认为兽人能处理这么精细的零件吗？\n\n需要什么，伙计？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91201,'Cutting wood isn\'t easy work, especially with all these lazy louts!\n\nIt\'s what good foremen like me are here for, up productivity!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'砍木头可不是容易的工作，尤其是有这么多懒汉！\n\n这就是像我这样的优秀工头存在的原因，提高生产力！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91202,'Hey there, if you\'re looking to produce your own potions to save a few coins, you\'ve come just to the right place!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，如果你想自己制作药水来省点钱，你来对地方了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91204,'Unless you have a drink for me, you\'d best shove up, whelp!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'除非你给我喝一杯，否则你最好给我滚蛋，小子!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91205,'If you\'re lookin\' for odds and ends from across the south seas, then you\'re in luck!\n\nThere\'s no other place you can get this stuff than right here at Zeet\'s!\n\nOh, and NO REFUNDS!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果你在找来自南海的杂七杂八的东西，那你运气不错！\n\n除了在泽特这里，没有其他地方能买到这些东西！\n\n哦，还有，不退货！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91216,'Wuzgut make sure no one steal lumber, you buy?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'乌兹古特确保没有人偷木材，你买？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91220,'Lozzle the Nozzle here! You\'re looking awfully thirsty, the sweat rolling off your face, the hot sun beating down on someone would do JUST that!\n\nWhy don\'t you grab some of my water, it\'s ice cold, and quenches the thirst, priced JUST right!\n\nNot like you\'ll find any other in town.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'把喷嘴对准这里!你看起来非常口渴，汗从你的脸上滚下来，炎热的太阳照在人身上，这正是你想要的!\n\n你为什么不喝点我的水呢，它是冰凉的，可以解渴，价格刚刚好!\n\n你在城里找不到别的店了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91221,'You lookin\' for your fix, bub? I got the good stuff, cheap, and home made!\n\nIt will get you drunk faster than any of that silly Dalaran wine, that\'s for sure. Shows you what a goblin with his mind set to a task can do.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你在找你的\"解药\"，伙计？我有好货，便宜，而且是自家制作！\n\n它会比那些愚蠢的达拉然酒让你更快地喝醉，这是肯定的。这就展示了一个专心于任务的地精能做到什么。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91225,'Welcome to Sparkwater!\n\nI designed and built this place from the ground up, from the very first stone and rock into what it is now.\n\nSo, if you got any building projects, let me know. It may cost a pretty penny, but it\'s worth the gold, I\'ll tell you THAT much!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到星火！\n\n我从零开始设计并建造了这个地方，从第一块石头和岩石开始，把它建成了现在的样子。\n\n所以，如果你有任何建筑项目，告诉我一声。可能会花不少钱，但值得这个金子，我可以告诉你这一点！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91227,'Throm-Ka, friend. The goblins surely have a taste for fine meat, and it would seem they eat quite the filling of it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'萨玛尔卡，朋友。地精们肯定对美味的肉食有着品味，看起来他们确实吃了相当丰盛的一顿。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91229,'I been hearin\' the platform got overrun by the sea crawlers they better not come bother me any!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我听说平台被海蟹们占领了，他们最好别过来打扰我！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91230,'My job here is to make sure the port is safe. Any unknown ships come into range, I fire this bad girl at them. Iron ball packed tight to the brim with gun powder will sink any vessel that is stupid enough to mess with us.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我在这里的工作是确保港口安全。任何进入范围的未知船只，我都会用这个家伙向他们开火。装满火药的铁球会击沉任何愚蠢到与我们作对的船只。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91231,'Missfire Shmissfire! We\'re ordered to pack this baby full of powder when we see something!\n\nWe\'ll probably hit the eastern kingdoms!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'失火 失火！ 我们被命令在看到目标时把这家伙塞满火药！\n我们可能会袭击东部王国！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91232,'Heh, you lookin\' to get smarter, huh? Well, reading some of these scrolls or books certainly could expand your knowledge, a few of them for a little while for sure!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，你想变聪明了，对吧？好吧，阅读一些卷轴或书籍肯定会扩展你的知识，其中一些对一段时间肯定会有帮助！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91238,'Hey! Welcome to the Sparkwater Tavern!\n\nMake yourself at home and find a table! If you need any drinks, come talk to me.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿！欢迎来到星火酒馆！\n\n随意找个座位，把自己当作在家一样！如果你需要喝的，就来找我。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91239,'Whatcha want, bub? No one\'s supposed to be executed today.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'小伙子想要什么？ 今天没有人应该被处决.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91240,'Me no want smash, keep peace or Thorg be forced to smash.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我不想粉碎，保持和平，否则托格就会被迫粉碎。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91242,'Are you here about my famous Wazzrocket?\n\nWhat do you mean you\'ve never heard of it?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你是来了解我的著名的瓦兹火箭吗？\n\n你怎么会从未听说过它呢？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91243,'Yes yes? What does $R want with Gowlfang?\n\nGowlfang returns to Wetlands, Gowlfang be big-big leader here, and will reunite Mosshide yes yes!\n\nGowlfang make strong tribe of gnoll-gnoll and you help-help!\n\nWe do good yes yes!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'是的是的吗?$R想要高方做什么?\n\n高方回归湿地，高方是这里的大佬大佬，将和莫斯德重聚，是的，是的!\n\n高方组建强大的人奴部落，你来帮忙!\n\n我们做得很好，是的!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91244,'Nothing better than kicking back after a good fishing day.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'没有什么比在愉快的钓鱼日后放松身心更好的了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91245,'The Goblins are an interesting folk, but could use more spiritualism.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'地精是有趣的族群，但可能需要更多的灵性。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91249,'No loitering! If you don\'t got business here then scram, unless you want to end up in the hole!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不许闲逛！ 如果你在这里没有生意，那就赶紧滚吧，除非你想陷入困境！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91250,'We got some friends all the way across the world that are delivering us some good supplies. At the moment this port here is headed to Revantusk Village if you\'re looking to go all the way out to the Hinterlands.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们有一些来自世界各地的朋友，他们为我们提供了一些优质的物资。 目前，如果您想一路前往辛特兰，这个港口正前往恶牙村。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91251,'We shall see soon if these Goblins can embody their station as honorable members of the Horde...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我很快就会看到这些地精是否能够成为部落的光荣成员...',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91252,'It\'s good getting some time off from that Oil Platform!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'能够从那个油平台上休息一段时间真是太好了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91253,'Getting fired for being lazy from that stupid lumber cutting job has been the best thing ever!\n\nNo one has found me yet and I got all the time I could ever ask for, screw them!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'因为在那个愚蠢的砍木工作中偷懒被解雇，这实际上是最好的事情！\n\n没有人找到我，我有了我想要的所有时间，让他们见鬼去吧！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91255,'The goblin\'s body is covered in various cuts, scrapes bruises and puncture wounds.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'地精的身体上布满了各种切口、擦伤、淤血和穿刺伤口。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91256,'Welcome to Razzle\'s! Don\'t pay any attention to that goof Zeet in the alley, his goods are nothing more than cheap table scratch!\n\nWhat I got here are genuine rare items from across Azeroth! They\'re limited, first come, first serve and should serve any adventurer in this world well!\n\nSo, step up, get some of Razzle\'s Radical Rarities before they are gone and swiped up by another more eager, and... heh, more savvy than yourself!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到拉兹尔！ 别理会巷子里那个混蛋泽特，他的货只不过是廉价的桌子划痕而已！\n\n我在这里得到的是来自艾泽拉斯的正宗稀有物品！ 它们数量有限，先到先得，应该为这个世界上的任何冒险家提供良好的服务！\n\n所以，站起来，在拉兹尔的一些罕见珍宝消失并被另一个更渴望、而且……嘿，比你更精明的人抢走之前获取它们！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91259,'Do you know who you\'re talking to?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你知道你在跟谁说话吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91266,'We\'re making good progress here with the woodcutting efforts in Durotar!\n\nThere may not be a big excess of trees around here, but these ones are massive, and large. They offer quite a lot of lumber!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们在杜罗塔尔的木刻工作取得了良好的进展！\n\n这里可能没有太多的树木，但这些树木很大，而且很大。他们提供了相当多的木材！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91267,'The damned heat is making all of the shredders break down way faster than I am used to!\n\nEven with all of my experience in using these things, I haven\'t had this many problems!\n\nIt\'s that damned sun, tell Wrix to hurry up already with those repairs! Last thing I want to do is waste all this experience and be reduced to chopping with my arms, it\'s so inefficient!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这的炎热让所有的粉碎机损坏得比我以往经历的还要快！\n\n即使我有这么多使用这些东西的经验，我也没有遇到过这么多问题！\n\n都怪那的太阳，告诉瑞克斯赶紧修理吧！我最不想做的事情就是浪费这么多经验，然后变得只能用手臂砍，效率太低了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91274,'Always more work to be done and it\'s up to me to make sure it gets done! We got shipments due and people to get all this stone and ore to!\n\nWithout me around, half of what you see here wouldn\'t even exist! Hey, you lookin\' for a job?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'工作永远没有做完的时候，而且要靠我确保它们得以完成！我们有货物要发运，还有人要把所有的石头和矿石运送过来！\n\n如果没有我，你在这里看到的一半甚至不存在！嘿，你在找工作吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91277,'Can\'t believe they hired me to just swing a pick axe! Easy work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'真不敢相信他们雇我只是为了挥动镐子！工作真是轻松！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91280,'You ever been shipwrecked before? I\'ll tell you, it isn\'t great.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你曾经遭遇过船只失事吗？我告诉你，那可不怎么样。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91281,'Waiting for the Captain to send word back, he\'s taking his time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在等船长传回消息，他花了很长时间。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91285,'Darkness lurks, keep your mind safe.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'黑暗潜伏，保持你的心灵安全。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91286,'Boltratchet looks like he\'s having a bad time, not me though, hah!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'博尔特瑞奇看起来过得很糟糕，不过不是我，哈哈！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91287,'Welcome, please make yourself at home.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎光临，请让自己宾至如归。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91288,'Welcome to our home, take shelter if you need.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到我们的家，如果需要的话可以避难。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91289,'The balance of power between the elemental forces keeps shifting.\n\nThere is a disturbance within the realm of earth, I know not where the cracks originate, or how they have begun but I sense a growing disconnect with each passing minute.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'元素之间的力量平衡不断变化。\n\n大地领域内有一种干扰，我不知道裂缝从哪里产生，或者是如何开始的，但我感觉到随着时间的推移，断裂越来越严重。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91290,'Ma people have remained hidden within these heights for a long time, it is only now that we have been exiled from our homeland and beaten back to the shadows.\n\nThe supplies of my tribe has dwindled greatly, but I will offer you what little I can mon, is there anything that the Wildtusk can do for you?\n\nOr, is there anything you can do for us?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'马族人长期隐藏在这些高地内，直到现在我们才被流放出故土，被打回阴影中。\n\n我部落的物资已经大大减少了，但我能给你的一点点，野牙能为你做些什么吗？\n\n或者，您能为我们做些什么吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91292,'You heard news from Sparkwater Port?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你听说过星火港的消息吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91296,'A board with various postings for wanted individuals.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'一个张贴着各种通缉个人信息的布告板。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91297,'I am beaten. What will you do with me now?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'风在我的背后，现在我可以做任何我想做的事情！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91303,'Greetings, $r, the dunes have claimed many a strong adventurer. Walk softly and be careful of the path ahead.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，$r，沙丘夺走了许多强大的冒险家。 轻轻地走，小心前面的路。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91350,'Dalaran may have been shattered but we still do our work for the greater knowledge of magic.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'达拉然可能已经支离破碎，但我们仍在为加深魔法知识而努力。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91400,'I be the one who prepares the meat for the feasts, and da leather for war, what one you need?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是为宴会准备肉的人，为战争准备皮革的人，你需要什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91401,'Ey, welcome to Wildtusk Village, keep yer nose out of trouble or I have to deal with ya!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，欢迎来到野牙村，别给你惹麻烦，不然我就得对付你了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91402,'Even though we be kicked from our home, the spirits still watch over us, and da voodoo be on our side mon!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'尽管我们被赶出了家园，但灵魂仍然守护着我们，巫毒在我们这边，伙计！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91403,'Welcome, $r, whatcha be needing?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎你，$r，需要什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
