(91411,'The elements be disturbed, Lord Rog has been seeking out our aid, but we cannot help him mon, maybe you can!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'元素受到干扰，罗格大人一直在寻求我们的帮助，但我们无法帮助他，也许你可以！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
