(91414,'The mountains be a good place to rest, and relax.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'山是休息、放松的好地方。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91415,'The thrill of the hunt be one of the best things in this world mon.\n\nIt was in ancient times the trolls were the masters of all!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'追逐猎物的刺激是这个世界上最好的事情之一，伙计。\n\n在古老的时代，巨魔是所有事物的主宰！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91710,'I was once a great wizard, its good to leave it all behind me, and simply tend to apples.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我曾经是一位伟大的巫师，把一切都抛在身后，只是简简单单地照顾苹果，感觉很好。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
