(91754,'These lands are a wasteland, it is best to learn how to cook what little you do find.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这些土地已经变成了一片荒原，最好学会如何烹饪你所找到的一点点食材。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
