(91767,'I have been sent on behalf of Ironforge to check on the kingdom\'s frontier.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我受铁炉堡之命，前来检查王国的边疆。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91768,'The Flaxwhisker Front was set up to investigate Azshara and to continue research on behalf of the Gnomes!\n\nWe may be far away from much of our kin, but we are making great strides!\n\n Have you come to help the Flaxwhisker Front?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'亚麻胡须的前哨是为了调查艾萨拉，代表侏儒进行继续研究而设立的！\n\n虽然我们离许多族人很远，但我们正在取得巨大的进展！\n\n你是来帮助弗拉克斯惠斯卫的前线吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91769,'Oh, hello there! We don\'t get much company!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，你好！我们很少有访客！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91770,'A friend of Gigno is a friend of mine, $r!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'吉格诺的朋友就是我的朋友，$r！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91771,'Farming sure is tough work, you know a thing or two about swine?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'养殖确实是一项艰苦的工作，您对猪了解一二吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91775,'The Analyzor 53G seems to be malfunctioning.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'分析器53G似乎出现了故障。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91776,'You are bold to speak with me, have you come to see true royalty?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你敢跟我说话，你是来见真正的皇室吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91777,'Cause no trouble to us outsider, and you shall live.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不要给我们这些局外人带来麻烦，你就可以活下去。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91778,'Tread carefully interloper, the tide can pull you in.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'小心前行，闯入者，潮水可以将你卷入其中。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91779,'Tread carefully interloper, the tide can pull you in.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'小心前行，闯入者，潮水可能会将你卷入其中。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91780,'Skrak stares at you blankly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'斯克拉克茫然地盯着你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91781,'Welcome to Harborage, outsider, my name is Sanv\'Kla, the leader of this place.\n\nI guide my people to a better fate away from the hellish landscape we once called home.\n\nPerhaps this is home now, and for the better.\n\nThe Draenei here are friendly and will treat you with respect.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到避难所，外来者，我是桑弗克拉，这个地方的领袖。\n\n我引导我的人民走向更好的命运，远离我们曾经称之为家园的地狱般的景象。\n\n也许这现在是我们的家，而且是更好的家。\n\n这里的德莱尼会友好，尊重对待你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91782,'Are you here in peace? Are you here to fight me?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你在这里平安吗？ 你是来和我战斗的吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91783,'You must possess great magic to be here.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你必须拥有强大的魔法才能到这里来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91798,'Moo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哞。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91799,'What do you want in my realm, mortal?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你在我的领域中想要什么，凡人？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91854,'Many of the Gor\'dosh have lost their way following the Tyrant King, my visions have only seen the collapse of my people, but few listen.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'许多戈多什部落的人在追随暴君国王之后迷失了方向，我的预言只看到了我的人民的崩溃，但很少有人听从。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91883,'Being stuck in Caelan has left my mind worrying about family. At the least it isn\'t terrible, we have plenty to read.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'被困在凯兰让我的心为家人担忧。至少情况还不算糟糕，我们有很多书可以读。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91891,'The Blackrock pose trouble for the Horde, and must be dealt with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'黑石氏族给部落带来了麻烦，必须加以处理。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91950,'Cooking is a fine art, and working with such few resources at our disposal makes it an even finer art.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'烹饪是一门精美的艺术，而我们可以利用的资源如此之少，这使它成为一门更加精美的艺术。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91953,'Even in a desolate island such as this, we must keep our faith.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'即使在这样一个荒凉的岛屿上，我们也必须保持信仰。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91954,'A wonderful day to fish, is it not?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'钓鱼的好日子，不是吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91973,'Strenght and Honor $r, what do you need?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'力量与荣耀，$r，你需要什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91974,'The caverns have been breached by Antnormi and her ilk - but we CAN stop them. You must use these Temporal Bronze Discs to close down the Time Rifts.$B$BQuickly! Use close the Time Rift behind me and close the remaining two!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'洞穴已经被安特诺米和她的同类闯入了，但我们可以阻止他们。你必须使用这些时空青铜盘来关闭时间裂隙。$B$B快点！在我身后关闭时间裂隙，然后关闭剩下的两个！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'The caverns have been breached by Antnormi and her ilk - but we CAN stop them. You must use these Temporal Bronze Discs to close down the Time Rifts.$B$BQuickly! Use close the Time Rift behind me and close the remaining two!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'安特诺米和她的同类已经攻破了洞穴 - 但我们可以阻止他们。 您必须使用这些时空青铜圆盘来关闭时间裂缝。$B$B快点！ 使用关闭我身后的时间裂缝并关闭剩下的两个！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91975,'You\'ve done it! Quickly - hand me the Temporal Bronze Disc!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你做到了！快点，把时空青铜盘交给我！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'You\'ve done it! Quickly - hand me the Temporal Bronze Disc!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你做到了！快点，把时空青铜盘交给我！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91976,'It seems you\'ve fractured the timeline, $n. You weren\'t meant to perish here. You must correct your mistakes to align the timelines. I cannot do that for you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'看起来你打破了时间线，$n。你不应该在这里丧命。你必须纠正你的错误，以使时间线重新对齐。我不能为你做到这一点。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'It seems you\'ve fractured the timeline, $n. You weren\'t meant to perish here. You must correct your mistakes to align the timelines. I cannot do that for you. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'看起来你打破了时间线，$n。你不应该在这里丧命。你必须纠正你的错误，以使时间线重新对齐。我不能为你做到这一点。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91977,'You\'ve done it! Looks like you lost your Temporal Bronze Disc though ...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你已经做到了！ 看来你丢失了时空青铜盘……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'You\'ve done it! Looks like you lost your Temporal Bronze Disc though ...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你已经做到了！ 看来你丢失了时空青铜盘……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(91978,'Please don\'t disturb me. Correcting the timeline requires an immense amount of concentration.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'请不要打扰我。纠正时间线需要极大的专注力。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Please don\'t disturb me. Correcting the timeline requires an immense amount of concentration.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'请不要打扰我。纠正时间线需要极大的专注力。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92000,'The hydromancers of Kul Tiras are world-renowned. We keep our magic a secret for that very reason.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'库尔提拉斯的水术师在全世界都有名声。我们保守魔法的秘密就是为了这个原因。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92001,'In order to have a powerful fleet, one must master the waves. It is what we hydromancers do, both in guiding the fleet, and controlling the flowing waters of the ocean to be either favorable... or in the case of our foes, not so favorable.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'要想拥有一支强大的舰队，就必须掌握风浪。这就是我们航海家所做的，既要引导舰队，又要控制海洋的水流，使之对我们有利……对我们的敌人来说，就不那么有利了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92002,'It is a surprise to see a new face around here. We were shipwrecked quite a while ago, and have made an alright living here.\n\nThis is Caelan\'s Rest, named after the Admiral who led our fleet and died when we were attacked. If you\'re here to help, we certainly need it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在这里看到一张新面孔真是令人惊讶。 我们不久前遭遇了海难，但在这里过得还不错。\n\n这是凯兰之息，以领导我们舰队并在我们遭到袭击时牺牲的海军上将的名字命名。 如果您是来帮忙的，我们当然需要它。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92003,'I am the Deckmaster of the Waterbreaker, you be standing on her!\n\nWatch your footing when you\'re around on my deck, understood?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是破水号的甲板长，你站在她身上！\n\n当你在我的甲板上时要注意脚下，明白吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92005,'This island is dangerous. Keep yourself to Caelan\'s Rest if you\'re not experienced in the wilderness.\n\nAll sorts of evil lurk outside the boundaries of our town that test us for weakness.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这个岛很危险。 如果您没有荒野经验，请留在凯兰之息。\n\n各种各样的邪恶潜伏在我们城镇的边界之外，考验着我们的弱点。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92006,'Careful beyond these stakes, walk with your head on a swivel.\n\nYou may end up dead if you are caught off guard.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'小心越过这些木桩，走路时要把头转过来。\n\n如果你猝不及防，你可能会死。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92007,'The Sailors are overly arrogant and can be a rowdy bunch.\n\nThey may be good on a ship, but left alone on Caelan\'s Rest, they are as much of a nuisance as the wildlife.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'水手们过于傲慢，可能是一群吵闹的人。\n\n它们在船上可能表现很好，但如果单独留在凯兰之息，它们就会像野生动物一样令人讨厌。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92009,'What are you looking at?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你在看什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92010,'The Marines usually get all the credit, but we do all of the hard work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'海军陆战队通常会获得所有的功劳，但我们承担了所有的艰苦工作。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92011,'Do you know who you\'re speaking to? I am THE Valdarion Smite! Yeah, that\'s the one!\n\nI am a world-renowned boxer, the champion of Kul Tiras in fact! I haven\'t been home in about four years now, but I held the title when I was last there!\n\nSuch a shame to be drafted like this, huh. Especially a shame to be stuck here..\n\nOh well, the lads and lasses here are good enough to me, especially with my fame back home.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你知道你在跟谁说话吗？ 我是瓦尔达里安之击！ 是的，就是那个！\n\n我是世界著名的拳击手，事实上是库尔提拉斯的冠军！ 我已经大约四年没回家了，但上次回家时我获得了冠军！\n\n就这样被选中真是可惜了，呵呵。 尤其是被困在这里真是太可惜了。\n\n哦，好吧，这里的小伙子们和姑娘们对我来说已经足够好了，尤其是考虑到我在家乡的名气。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92012,'I hope my men have treated you well, we have become somewhat ragged since our departure from Stormwind.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我希望我的手下善待你，自从离开暴风城以来，我们有些衣衫褴褛。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92013,'Fresh blood huh? You looking to make a name for yourself out here? Become something of a hero like all those tales say?\n\nWell, sorry to tell you, but all you\'re gonna find out here is stinky swamp water.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'新鲜血液?你想在这里出名吗?成为那些传说中所说的英雄?\n\n很抱歉告诉你，你在这里只会发现臭烘烘的沼泽水。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92014,'You heard anything from Stormwind? The bastards have left us high and dry out here.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你有暴风城的消息吗?那些混蛋把我们丢在了这里。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92015,'Don\'t make trouble, we are undermanned as it is.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'别惹麻烦了，我们人手不足。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92016,'It is good to see a new face, Banal can certainly be aggravating.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'很高兴看到一张新面孔，平庸的人肯定会让人恼火。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92017,'Hello, and welcome to Sorrowguard, I am Paladin Janathos, and I keep vigil over this place\n\nThis Stronghold was built before the first war as a means to watch the entrance westward into the Kingdom of Azeroth.\n\nIt has fallen into a state of disrepair since its fall during the first war.\n\nAfter its destruction I was sent here to attempt to reclaim it. While we have done some repairs and occupied the place, there is always more that can be done. Especially with the darkness of the swamps beside us, and the orcs lurking at Stonard.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你好，欢迎来到悲伤要塞，我是圣骑士贾纳索斯，我会守护着这个地方\n\n这个要塞是在第一次战争之前建造的，目的是监视向西进入艾泽拉斯王国的入口。\n\n自第一次战争期间沦陷以来，它已陷入年久失修的状态。\n\n它被毁后，我被派到这里试图夺回它。 虽然我们已经做了一些修复并占据了这个地方，但总有更多的事情可以做。 尤其是我们旁边是黑暗的沼泽，而兽人则潜伏在斯托纳德。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92021,'I keep all the boots here in good order, you looking for a pair?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我把这里所有的靴子都收拾得井井有条，你要找一双吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92022,'I\'m not allowed inside anymore, but they let me keep my shack!\n\nLooking to buy some mushrooms?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我不再被允许进去了，但他们让我保留我的小屋！\n\n想买一些蘑菇吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92023,'Hey, where is everybody?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嘿，大家都在哪儿？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92024,'I have fought in many wars, and have slain many foes. All the way from Draenor, to this outpost here, and I will lead it with great honor.\n\nI am entrusted by the greatest minds in Orgrimmar to lead the Horde\'s efforts, and I shall...\n\nHave you come to lend a hand, to make a name for yourself?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我参加过许多战争，杀死过许多敌人。 从德拉诺一路来到这里的前哨站，我将带着极大的荣幸领导它。\n\n奥格瑞玛最伟大的人物委托我领导部落的荣耀，而我将……\n\n你是来帮忙，为自己扬名立万的吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92025,'Oh, to be in Boralus again… I can\'t wait to head home once the ship is all repaired. I\'m going to go to every pub, every day, for at least a year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，再次来到伯拉勒斯……我迫不及待地想在船修好后回家。 我会去每一家酒吧，每天，至少一年。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92026,'Can somebody help me? I\'m looking for the shell people.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'有人可以帮助我吗？ 我正在寻找贝壳人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92027,'I gave my savings to these people in exchange for shells, and they promised they\'d double it within a week.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我把我的积蓄给了这些人来换贝壳，他们承诺一周内将其翻倍。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92028,'But now they\'re not here. I, uh... I need some change.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'但现在他们不在这里。 我，呃...我需要一些零钱。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92029,'Care to trade some shells for change?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'愿意用一些贝壳换取零钱吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92030,'Please, sir, have you got some change? I can pay you back in shells.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'先生，请问您有零钱吗？ 我可以用贝壳偿还你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92031,'I\'m not crazy, I swear. These shells are worth a lot of money.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我没有疯，我发誓。 这些贝壳值很多钱。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92032,'Shells! I want to trade some shells!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'贝壳！ 我想换一些贝壳！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92132,'I am bound to my duty.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我有义务履行我的职责。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92133,'The world has changed a lot, and it seems so very different from when I left it.\n\nSomething lingers within the air, but I cannot see it, there is something amiss, but my thoughts are muddled, and almost lost to themselves.\n\nI can see you though, you are in a place that I once called home, that many of my people called home, lost to the ages of time.\n\nI don\'t know why I am here again, but you will aid me.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'世界已经发生了很大的变化，似乎与我离开时截然不同。\n\n空气中弥漫着某种东西，但我看不到它，有什么不对劲，但我的思绪却很混乱，几乎失去了自己。\n\n但我可以看到你，你在一个我曾经称之为家的地方，我的许多人称之为家，但已经在时间的流逝中消失了。\n\n我不知道我为什么又来这里，但你会帮助我的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92137,'Please, don\'t kill me!\n\nI\'m the bootlegger who created the recipe for the famous Southsea Reserve!\n\nYou... you can buy some of it if you\'d like!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'拜托，别杀我！\n\n我是为著名的南海保护区创造食谱的走私者！\n\n你……如果你愿意的话，可以买一些！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92168,'Welcome to Kalkor Point, I assume you have many questions about why there are Centaur here in Giljim.\n\nA long time ago, practically six years now, we set sail from Kalimdor and joined up with the Southsea Pirates. We were hired as mercenaries, and fighters, but our leader betrayed us, and kept the gold for himself.\n\nHe has gained the name of \'Reaver\' for his brutality and his lack of care or compassion for his fellow brothers in arms. The name Kalkor Point comes from the name of our Mercenary Band, and we wear it like an award.\n\nOne day we hope to return home to our kin, but that day still seems far off.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到卡尔科尔角，我想您对为什么吉尔吉姆会有半人马有很多疑问。\n\n很久以前，差不多六年了，我们从卡利姆多起航，加入了南海海盗。 我们被雇佣为雇佣兵和战士，但我们的领袖背叛了我们，并将黄金据为己有。\n\n由于他的残暴以及对战友缺乏关心和同情，他获得了“掠夺者”的称号。 卡尔科尔这个名字来自我们雇佣兵团的名字，我们把它当作一个奖章佩戴。\n\n我们希望有一天能回到亲人身边，但这一天似乎还很遥远。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92171,'It takes a brave heart to continue on after tragedy, and keep a good face to the world.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'悲剧发生后，需要一颗勇敢的心继续前行，并以良好的面貌面对世界。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92173,'Cause no trouble here, I do not want to have to fight you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不要在这里惹麻烦，我不想和你战斗。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92174,'Lykourgos will pay for what he has done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'莱库戈斯会为他的所作所为付出代价。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92176,'Little one here to help? You sure you can help?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'小家伙来帮忙吗？ 你确定你能帮忙吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92177,'Need food? Need stuff? I got stuff, can you afford stuff?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'需要食物吗？ 需要东西吗？ 我有东西，你买得起吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92178,'You need armor? Armor good for out in the wild, weapons good to, but me no make weapons! Let me see what I can make for small thing like you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你需要盔甲吗？ 盔甲适合在野外外出，武器也不错，但我不会制造武器！ 让我看看我能为像你这样的小家伙做些什么。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92179,'You not cause problem for Maul\'ogg! Maul\'ogg have enough problem.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你不会给莫尔奥格带来麻烦！ 莫尔奥格的问题已经够多了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92180,'I am Lord Cruk\'zogg, I lead here. We were once part of the great Gor\'dosh tribe, but now we are alone.\n\nYou will help me recreate the glory of Maul\'ogg!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是克鲁克佐格大人，我领导着这里。 我们曾经是伟大的戈多什部落的一部分，但现在我们是孤独的。\n\n你将帮助我重现摩尔奥格的荣耀！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92181,'The Horde establishes ties across Azeroth, hopefully to shift the balance of power in our favor.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'部落在艾泽拉斯各地建立了联系，希望能够将力量平衡转向对我们有利的方向。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92182,'Without explorers like you and me, the world would have many unknown places.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果没有你我这样的探险家，世界上将会有许多未知的地方。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92184,'It takes a lot of wisdom to see what is yet to be seen, I have predicted the fall of the Maul\'ogg, and warned my people to take refuge here. There is still plenty that needs to be done in order to save the tribe. Lord Cruk\'Zogg will lead our people to ruin without outside help... Perhaps you are the one I saw in trepid dreams.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'需要大量的智慧才能看到尚未发生的事情，我已经预测了摩尔奥格的陷落，并警告我的人民到这里避难。 为了拯救部落，还有很多事情要做。 克鲁克佐格大人将在没有外界帮助的情况下带领我们的人民走向灭亡……也许你就是我在惊恐的梦中看到的那个人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92185,'Haz\'gorg has many great visions, he can see the future!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哈兹戈尔格有很多伟大的愿景，他能看到未来！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92186,'Do not disturb the Great Seer if it is not required, he might be having a vision.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如非必要，请勿打扰伟大先知，他可能正在出现异象。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92187,'Ugh... Stuck in this jungle, with ogres and trolls, can you imagine?... Well I\'m imagining BIG right now pal.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'呃...被困在这个丛林里，有食人魔和巨魔，你能想象吗？...好吧，我现在在想象大场面。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92188,'Look at that, you\'re not an ogre! I\'m in need of some help kid, think you can be of assistance?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'瞧瞧，你不是食人魔！ 我需要一些帮助，孩子，你能帮忙吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92190,'The Razzari are slipping into madness. They murder those they deem as traitors, and they ally themselves with the Hazzuri who practice once forbidden dark magics.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'拉扎里家族正在陷入疯狂。他们谋杀那些他们认为是叛徒的人，他们与曾经被禁止使用黑魔法的哈祖里人结盟。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92191,'I was lucky to survive that wreck, only to be trapped in this wasteland.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我很幸运能在沉船中幸存下来，却被困在这片荒地上。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92194,'Blood and Thunder, Bloodfist Point is a new expedition into Azshara, have you been sent to aid?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'血与雷，血拳是对艾萨拉的新远征，你被派去援助了吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92196,'Walk softly, like a calm leaf to the winds of fate. It is never a good idea to let yourself fade away, each moment we have can be used to improve, and hone our skills. Should you even waste but a moment, it could be the difference between life... and death on the battlefield.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'轻轻地走，就像命运之风中的一片平静的叶子。 让自己消失永远不是一个好主意，我们所拥有的每一刻都可以用来提高和磨练我们的技能。 只要你浪费片刻，战场上的生死攸关。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92197,'I have been tasked as the Far Seer of this expedition. It is my duty to keep sight within the distance, and warn us of impending danger. I am also here to serve as a representative of Thrall upon the field.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我被任命为这次远征的先知。 我的职责是保持视线在远处，并警告我们即将发生的危险。 我来这里也是作为萨尔在战场上的代表。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92199,'Somethings seems amiss within these lands, as if the ground and the earth itself cries of a great misery being done. You can feel this, cant you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这些土地上似乎有些不对劲，仿佛大地和大地本身正在哭泣，正在遭受巨大的苦难。 你能感觉到这一点，不是吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92201,'Earth Mother bless you $R, both on the field of battle, and at peace.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'大地母亲保佑你$R，无论是在战场上还是在和平中。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92217,'Looking for some self defense? Out here in Azshara, diplomacy and good gnomish gestures don\'t usually mean safety!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'寻找一些自卫？ 在艾萨拉，外交和良好的侏儒姿态通常并不意味着安全！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92218,'So much work to be done around here, so many projects being worked on at once! It almost makes a gnomes head spin.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这里有这么多工作要做，同时有这么多项目要做!它几乎让侏儒们头晕目眩。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92219,'We\'re making such splendid, fabulous advances in the fields of engineering and science both. We\'re tinkering with magic and technology fused together and are having great success!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们在工程和科学领域都取得了如此辉煌、令人难以置信的进步。 我们正在将魔法和技术融合在一起，并取得了巨大的成功！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92220,'Innovation is the only way forward, it takes thinking outside the box to get there sometimes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'创新是前进的唯一途径，有时需要跳出固有思维模式。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92221,'I have been working with Kodo Hide for many years, and am certainly the most experienced with it. I may have some armor for you, but my supplies are limited.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我已经与科多兽皮一起工作了很多年，而且我无疑是最有经验的。 我可能会给你一些盔甲，但我的供应有限。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92223,'I was expelled from my home, the Furbolg have grown out of control.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我被赶出了自己的家，弗堡人已经失去了控制。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92936,'Southshore is a quaint town, and much different where I come from. I am happy it was spared from the horrors of the Third War.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'南岸是个古色古香的小镇，和我的家乡大不相同。我很高兴它躲过了第三次战争的恐怖。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92938,'I am Magus Valgon, citizen of Kul Tiras and a wizard dedicated to both hydromancy and the studies of the arcane.\n\nThere are many great mysteries lurking upon this island, and I have dedicated myself to uncovering them all.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是魔法师瓦尔贡，库提拉斯的公民，一个致力于水术和奥术研究的巫师。\n\n这个岛上隐藏着许多巨大的谜团，我致力于揭开它们。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92940,'Rock duty is as boring as ever. Hopefully my shift can be over soon and one of the other guys can take over. There\'s nothing worse than sand all over the place and Rock Crawlers getting in your stuff.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'岩石任务一如既往地无聊。 希望我的轮班很快就能结束，其他人可以接替我。 没有什么比满地都是沙子和岩石爬虫进入你的东西更糟糕的了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92941,'We are stationed here to blast any unwanted ships.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们驻扎在这里是为了炸毁任何不需要的船只。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92942,'Ya mon?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'是吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Ya mon?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Ya mon?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(100202,'Is there anything I can help you with? I am presently occupied.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我能为你做什么？ 我现在很忙。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(100203,'My unicorns are for sale only to the elves of the Silvermoon Remnants and to their exalted allies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的独角兽只出售给银月城遗迹的精灵和他们尊贵的盟友。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(100400,'<This stone pulses lightly with a foreign magic>.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<这块石头带着异国魔法轻轻脉动>。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(100401,'<The Ancient Wolf Spirit seems to be distracted by something else.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<这块石头带着异国魔法轻轻脉动>。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<The Ancient Wolf Spirit seems to be distracted by something else.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<远古狼灵似乎正在被别的事情分散注意力。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(100402,'\"The spirits are always calling, one just needs to listen to hear them.\" ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'“灵魂总是在呼唤，人们只需要倾听就能听到它们。”',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"The spirits are always calling, one just needs to listen to hear them.\" ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'“灵魂总是在呼唤，人们只需要倾听就能听到它们。”',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
