(392,'Do not be alarmed, $r. I have long since passed from this land but I intend no harm to your kind. I have witnessed too much death in my time. My only wish now is for peace. Perhaps you can help my cause.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不要惊慌，$r，我早就离开了这片土地，但我无意伤害你的同类。在我的时代，我目睹了太多的死亡。我现在唯一的愿望就是和平。也许你可以帮助我的事业。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
