(14625,'Ah, the sooty air of Searing Gorge, feels great after the smoldering air of Blackrock Mountain and smells of riches and opportunities. One has to be a fool to not exploit it, I\'m sure the others feel the same. Now tell me, how can I help you, or how can you help me?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'啊，灼热峡谷的乌烟瘴气，黑石山的闷烧空气，这是最棒的财富和机会的气味。傻瓜才不利用它，我相信其他人也有同样的感觉。现在告诉我，我能帮你什么，或者你能帮我什么？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(3209,'You may rest easy, young one. The Earth Mother watches over all Mulgore\'s children, and we braves stand ever vigilant.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'年轻人，你可以放心了。大地之母守护着穆戈尔所有的孩子，我们的勇士时刻保持着警惕。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
