(51698,'Do you dream of rising above your contemporaries by achieving eternal glory in battle? Step into the Blood Ring to engage in mortal combat against some of the best gladiators in Azeroth, and the glory you\'ve been seeking all your life shall be yours.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'您是否梦想通过在战斗中获得永恒的荣耀来超越同时代人？踏入血环，与艾泽拉斯那些最优秀的角斗士进行殊死搏斗，这是你一生都在寻求的荣耀。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Do you dream of rising above your contemporaries by achieving eternal glory in battle? Step into the Blood Ring to engage in mortal combat against some of the best gladiators in Azeroth, and the glory you\'ve been seeking all your life shall be yours.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'您是否梦想通过在战斗中获得永恒的荣耀来超越同时代人？踏入血环，与艾泽拉斯那些最优秀的角斗士进行殊死搏斗，这是你一生都在寻求的荣耀。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(51699,'Listen to us, hero! Your urgent assistance is needed in Sunnyglade Valley. Infinite Dragonflight saboteurs are tampering with time and attempting to change the outcome of an important historical battle, which could alter the world as we know it. Join the battle and slay their agents posing as members of the opposite faction.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'听我们说，英雄！阳光林地山谷山谷需要您的紧急援助。永恒之龙军团正在篡改时间，并试图改变一场重要的历史战斗的结果，这可能会改变我们所知的世界。加入战斗并杀死那些冒充成对立派系成员的特工。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Listen to us, hero! Your urgent assistance is needed in Sunnyglade Valley. Infinite Dragonflight saboteurs are tampering with time and attempting to change the outcome of an important historical battle, which could alter the world as we know it. Join the battle and slay their agents posing as members of the opposite faction.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'听我们说，英雄！阳光林地山谷山谷需要您的紧急援助。永恒之龙军团正在篡改时间，并试图改变一场重要的历史战斗的结果，这可能会改变我们所知的世界。加入战斗并杀死那些冒充成对立派系成员的特工。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61610,'It is my duty to watch over this church, and the land that it inhabits.$B$BI must warn you, stay away from the crypt. It has fallen to a great darkness.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的责任是看守这座教堂，以及它所在的这片土地。$B$B，我必须警告你，离那个墓穴远点。那里已经黑暗肆孽了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30131,'Hmm, now that you mention it, I do have something to share.$B$BDuring the festivities some time ago, Medivh paid the guests a visit, on a few occasions actually. Though, one time something seemed off. He was carrying what looked to be a long and dark object, and inspected what looked to be a marble statue in the dining hall. I remember seeing him walk away a few seconds later without the dark object.$B$BIt may be nothing, but it stood out to me for some reason. I suspect he and his magic to be behind such trickery, of course.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯，既然你提到它，我确实有话要说。$B$B前段时间的庆祝活动，麦迪文拜访了一个客人，拜访了好几次。不过，有一次似乎有些不对劲。他拿着一个看起来又长又黑的物体，在食堂里检查了一尊看起来像大理石雕像的东西。我记得几秒钟后看到他走开了，手里没有那个黑暗的物体。$B$B觉得可能这件事没什么，但出于某种原因，这件事对我来说很特别。当然，我怀疑他和他的魔法是这种诡计的幕后黑手。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30132,'<This marble statue seems oddly out of place.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<这尊大理石雕像似乎格格不入>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30133,'<The orb glows with an intensity of dark energy. Fire can be seen tracing along its surface. Any attempt to get close to the orb causes it to fade away, becoming translucent, making material objects pass through it. It would appear powerful magic is present here.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<球体发出强烈的暗能量，可以看到火沿着其表面延伸。任何靠近球体的尝试都会导致球体变成半透明，并且让任何东西穿过它。这里似乎存在强大的魔法>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61611,'Can I help you with something?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我能帮你做点什么吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
