(49303,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Agents of the Infinite Dragonflight are seeking to alter history, by changing the outcome of this battle.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'永恒之龙的特工正在通过改变这场战斗的结果来改变历史。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(49304,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'They have disguised themselves as orcish warriors, and are attempting to tip the scales towards a victory for the orcs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'他们伪装成兽人战士，试图将天平推向兽人的胜利。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(49305,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'They have disguised themselves as soldiers of the alliance, and are attempting to tip the scales in their favor.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'他们伪装成联盟的士兵，并试图使天平向有利于联盟的方向倾斜。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(49306,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'If they succeed in their efforts, this will have catastrophic consequences in the present.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果他们的获得了成功，这将对现在的时间产生灾难性后果。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(49307,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Luckily for us, there is a way to identify their agents, and put an end to their machinations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'幸运的是，有一种方法可以识别他们的伪装，并结束他们的阴谋。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
