(49309,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Once you\'ve collected a total of 100 sparks, the identity of their leader will be revealed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'一旦你收集了总共100个火花，他们的领导者就会被揭示出来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(49310,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'But beware, as he will likely turn back into his true form once attacked, and unleash the full strenght of his abilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'但要小心，因为他一旦受到攻击，很可能会变回他的真身，释放他的全部能力。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(49311,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'The more flickering time sparks you turn in, the weaker their leader will become. Holding the central island is the key to victory, as you cannot turn in sparks otherwise.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你交出的时间火花越多，他们的领导者就会变得越弱。守住中央岛屿是胜利的关键，否则你无法上交火花。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(49312,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Good luck, heroes. The future depends on you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'祝你好运，英雄们。我们的未来就靠你了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(52132,'Vagrant\'s Endeavor is a unique gameplay mode that challenges players to embrace a minimalist approach to their character\'s gear. In this mode, players are restricted to wearing only items of poor and common quality, with no option to use enchants. This creates a thrilling and immersive experience as players must rely on their skill and strategy rather than relying on powerful gear.\n\nAs players progress and reach level 60, the restriction for gearing will be removed, and they are rewarded with a special companion known as the Forworn Mule. This adorable bank pet not only adds a touch of charm to the gameplay, but also serves as a helpful assistant by providing additional storage space for players\' belongings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'流浪者的奋斗是一种独特的游戏模式，挑战玩家对角色的装备采用极简主义的方法。在这种模式下，玩家只能佩戴灰色和白色的物品，并且不能使用附魔。这创造了一种惊心动魄和身临其境的体验，因为玩家必须依靠他们的技能和策略生存下去，而不是依靠强大的装备。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61623,'The skies of Kalimdor are as untamed as its lands. Where would you like to fly to?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61622,'You there, looking to stand out among the crowds? I got plans for the creation of belt buckles. With them, you\'ll stand out like never before.$B$B<A sigh escapes Tanovan.>$B$BLook, help me out, I\'m in need of some silver, alright?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61621,'Welcome to Buckle Up! Excuse the mess, I am converting my armor shop into something new; belt buckles! If you got the yearning to create something unique, you\'re in the right place.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'卡利姆多的天空和它的土地一样桀骜不驯。您想飞往哪里？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61614,'I have come here to seek support of the Nobles of Stormwind. It is a harder task than I had anticipated.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你们几个，想出点风头？我有一个制作皮带扣的计划。搞定这些，你会大放异彩.$B$B<塔诺万发出一声叹息.>$B$B你看，我需要几位银币，帮我一把好吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30134,'You dare interfere with my prey? She is mine! After I am done with her, you\'re next!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到安全系带！请原谅这里乱七八糟的，我正在将我的盔甲店改造成新的东西，皮带扣！如果您渴望创造独特的东西，那么您来对地方了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30135,'This isn\'t over! I will find you one day…And your soul will be the price for the one you stole today.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我来这里是为了寻求暴风贵族的支持。这是一项比我预期中更艰巨的任务。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61637,'I be offering a collection of grimoires for demons. Be wary, the knowledge there be deadly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你敢染指我的猎物？她是我的！等我了结了她之后，下一个就是你！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
