(61635,'We, Farraki, have been saved by Vol\'jin. Now it be our time to return the favor.$B$BCome closer, I will show you our magic.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我为恶魔提供一系列的魔典。小心点，这些知识都是致命的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
