(61632,'I have come here to teach young trolls about a new type of voodoo. You be looking eager to learn.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'真是个奇怪的地方，我更喜欢祖阿曼的城墙……$B$BI，如果你需要训练，我就在这里。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
