(61626,'Your skill with a bow can be the difference between survival and death.$B$BRemember to keep training, even when you think you know it all.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我经常受雇训练暴风卫队的新兵如何使用弓和弩保卫城市，或用于战斗.$B$B让我告诉你，这是我最不喜欢的任务之一。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61625,'Hello there, what can I do for you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'未驯服的野兽看起来像是一个喧嚣的敌人。一旦你从里到外了解了它的习性，它就是另一个潜在的朋友。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
