(66116,'You\'re telling me there\'s a beach party?! I get the feelin\' that if I\'m being invited this is no small get-together. Normally I\'d say I\'m too busy but I\'m sensing an opportunity here - rest, relaxation, and revenue! I\'ll be there for sure, ya can bet on that.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'无效……等待响应。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
