(66120,'Ba-a-a-h!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'所以现在是莉莎开派对了，是吗？很高兴知道这一点，谢谢你，我的朋友!知识就是力量，力量可以给你带来很多金币，对吧？完全正确，回头见，伙计。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66121,'We are here Quel\'dorei, from your words this summon seemed urgent. I pray you did not waste our time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你是说有个海滩派对吗!我有一种感觉，既然我被邀请了，这可不是个小聚会。通常我会说我太忙了，但我感觉到这里有一个机会——休息、放松和收入!我肯定会去的，你可以打赌。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66122,'I did not High Priestess, we have grim tidings from my homeland. As you know it has been held by the Scourge ever since it\'s fall. The Sunwell perverted by the vile magics of Kel\'thuzad.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你敢吗?你不可能活着出去的，伙计!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66123,'However, the Thalassian pass has recently been swarming with Undead pushing south, and our mages have felt the taint of Fel in the region. I worked with Ranger-Lord Hawkspear to send a scouting party into the region.Out of twelve rangers, only two returned.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'噫哈!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66124,'\"However, what those two witnessed was not something we could ignore. The Scourge is amassing it\'s army for an invasion in the south, and the northern region of Quel\'thalas is swarming with demons.\"',NULL,NULL,NULL,'呸!呸!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66125,'Even the Rangers, unattuned to magic, could feel the sway of the Fel in the air. We suspect the Sunwell has been tainted with fel, possibly it has even become a portal to summon demons.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'呸!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66126,'They are not attacking the Scourge yet. We surmise that they\'re either allied or the Demons are preparing for the offensive.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你们来自奎尔多雷，从你的话来看，这个会见似乎很紧急。我希望你没有浪费我们的时间。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66127,'What?! Are you certain of this?! Once again your ways bring doom upon this world Highborne!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我没有，大祭司，我的家乡传来坏消息。如你所知，自从天灾军团沦陷以来，它一直被天灾军团控制着。太阳井被克尔苏加德邪恶的魔法扭曲了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66128,'Calm yerself High Priestess, the Quel\'dorei are nae responsible for this. If anything they wish tae deal with the problem. Our forces are taxed but if the demons are returning, we cannae ignore it.\"',NULL,NULL,NULL,'萨拉斯关卡最近有大批亡灵向南推进，我们的法师感受到了该地区邪能的污染。我和游骑兵霍克斯比尔勋爵一起派了一支侦察队进入那个地区。侦察队十二个游侠中，只有两个回来了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66129,'We are in agreement.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'然而，这两个人目睹的事情震惊了我们。天灾军团正在集结军队准备入侵南方，而奎尔萨拉斯的北部地区则到处都是恶魔。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66130,'Very well. My people at your place tells me that yours respect our ways, some even have begun to follow Elune, so I will not doubt you. However, I demand your people clean your mess.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'即使是不熟悉魔法的游侠，也能感觉到空气中邪能的激荡。我们怀疑太阳井已经被邪能污染，甚至可能成为召唤恶魔的入口。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66131,'I would like nothing more High Priestess, however, we lack the forces to do so. We only have a handful of ships.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'那些恶魔却没有攻击天灾军团。我们推测他们要么是盟友，要么是恶魔在准备进攻。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66132,'Not enough to defeat the Undead vessels patrolling the sea. We have just joined the Alliance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'什么？！你确定吗？！你的行为又给这个世界带来了毁灭！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66133,'So you would want us to fix your mess once more?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'冷静点大祭司，奎尔多雷人应该对此负责。但恶魔又回来了，我们不能忽视它。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66134,'High Priestess please, we are the Alliance. Their mess is our mess. I propose we work together. This is indeed an issue we cannot ignore.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们意见一致。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66135,'I will convene with the Nobles and prepare our army and fleet to strike out. In a month we should be ready to head out.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'很好。我在奎尔萨拉斯的人民告诉我，你们尊重我们的习俗，有些人甚至已经开始追随艾露恩，所以我不会怀疑你。但是，我要求你和你的人民清理你们烂摊子。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66136,'A month of demonic vermin pourting into this world?! Have your lost your mind?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我很乐意，大祭司，然而，我们缺乏足够的力量。我们只有很少的几艘船。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66137,'Mobilization takes time Lass, even we have tae convene with the senate. We lack a fleet to land ashore, so I propose we move through land and prevent anything from passing through into the Plaguelands. The Argents will appreciate the effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不足以击败在海上巡逻的天灾船只。毕竟我们刚刚加入联盟。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66138,'\"We don\'t have much, but we will put our flying machines, Siege tanks and pilots at the disposal of this offensive.\"',NULL,NULL,NULL,'所以你想让我们再帮你收拾烂摊子？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66139,'It will take time for them to arrive but they will hopefully ensure nothing gets past the Thalassian pass.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'大祭司，我请求您，我们毕竟是联盟。他们的烂摊子就是我们的烂摊子。我建议我们共同面对。这确实是一个我们不能忽视的问题。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66140,'I of all people know how vile the demons can be. Theramore\'s fleets will be ready to assist as soon as possible.\"',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我将与高层们会面，让我们的军队和舰队做好出击准备。一个月后，我们就能准备好出发了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66141,'Very well, you have your reasons and your ways, but I cannot ignore this threat and the earlier we act, the better things will be.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'一个月？这个月要有多少恶魔涌入这个世界!你疯了吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66142,'We will require a landing site for the main Alliance force, and we Kaldorei will secure it. Speaker Windrunner and Lady Proudmoore, do your best to assist this effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'动员军队需要时间，就连我们也得参与领袖会议。我们缺少登陆的舰队，所以我建议我们穿过陆地阻止任何东西进入瘟疫之地。代理商会感激你的努力。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66143,'Of course, our ships will reinforce your fleets.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们的装备不多，但我们会把我们的飞行器、攻城坦克和飞行员投入到战场中。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66144,'I will put my mages and Rangers at your disposal. We will assist in any way we can High Priestess, reclaiming our homeland is important to us as is stopping this threat.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'他们需要时间抵达，但他们希望能确保没有任何东西能通过萨拉斯关卡。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
