(66169,'There is only death for your people here! I am only one... of many...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'黑铁亵渎者计划?我——为什么……好吧，他要求太多了，告诉他我欠他的人情都还清了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
