(66201,'Don\'t hold it against da demon, Sylvannas. It was us who asked him for an audience with da Banshee Queen after dealing with ya problems.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'女王，我绝不会密谋反对您。您的无端指责伤害到了我。这些巨魔和那边的冒险家只是帮我们完成了一项任务，您记得我们在希尔斯布莱德遇到的问题吧?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66202,'Hardly a problem. Nothing we couldn\'t have dealt with. Do you expect me to grovel in gratitude now, Zul\'jin?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这和我房间里的“林蛙”有什么关系?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
