(66390,'Oh wow! I was afraid I had to get a Titanic translator or somethin\', Yo dude! Tell us where to find gold and rare techologies!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'力量药剂?!哈兹戈尔知道他的位置了!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66391,'I am Analyzer X-48, my primary purpose is to analyze systems and mechanisms in order to understand any flaw in them. Forexample, your unadulterated greed and thirst for technology is errant and can lead to your destruction.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我等待着进一步的指示或询问。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66392,'What? Are you patronizing me?! I gave you life, ya know? I spent time, effort, and MONEY on makin\' you work, so help me out yeah? Don\'t worry about me, I\'ll be fine even with my greed. Heck if I get enough money maybe it\'ll go away, so yeah, you can help.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哈！继续打开！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66393,'I doubt your sincerity, however I am in your debt. Would that I could help more, but my memory banks are currently restricted. 98 persent of my memory banks are locked and require a key to function.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'扫描未知生物，威胁极小，万能翻译启动。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66394,'A key? Huh? Where would we find such a key? Is there another way to unlock your noggin? If we do it will you help?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在线系统：分析仪X-48在线。内存库目前受到限制。我能为您做些什么?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66395,'There is no other way to my knowledge. A key to unlock the memories within me are required. Once I have my memories back I will divulge the knowledge you seek in return for rebuilding me.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦,哇噢!我怕我得找个泰坦翻译什么的，伙计!告诉我们哪里能找到黄金和稀有科技!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66396,'Any idea what this knowledge is? Your analytic abilities might be useful, and could help me win some money through gambling or prospectin\' or something, but I\'d prefer something more substantial. Do you have the blueprints for yourself?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是分析器X-48，我的主要目的是分析系统和机制，以了解其中的任何缺陷。例如，你对技术纯粹的贪婪和渴望是错误的，可能会导致你的毁灭。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66397,'I do not know which knowledge is stored in my restricted memory banks. I however, surmise that since the memories are restricted, they would be valuable secrets to my people. So yes it could contain blueprints or technology and other things.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'怎么啦？你在居高临下吗?!我给了你生命，你知道吗?我花了时间，精力和金钱让你工作，所以帮帮我，好吗?别为我担心，即使我很贪婪，我也会没事的。见鬼，如果我有足够的钱，也许它就会消失，所以，是的，你可以帮忙。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66398,'Sweet! Hey Partner, come over here and talk to me! Analyzer you may rest or somethin\', we\'ll talk later.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我怀疑你的诚意，但我欠你的情。希望我能多帮点忙，但我的记忆库目前有限。我98%的记忆库都是锁着的，需要钥匙才能打开。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66399,'Affirmative, standing by.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'一把钥匙吗?嗯?我们上哪儿去找这样一把钥匙呢?还有别的方法可以打开你的脑袋吗?如果我们这么做，你会帮忙吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66400,'We got company on the ship! Push back these mainlanders!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'据我所知，没有别的办法了。我需要一把打开我记忆的钥匙。一旦我恢复记忆我会给于你所寻找的知识来换取我的重建。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66401,'Who are you? You think you can take my ship without a fight?!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'知识?你的分析能力可能有用，可以帮我通过赌博或勘探或其他什么赢点钱，但我更喜欢更有价值的工作。你自己有设计图吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66402,'You wont stand a chance against me scurvy dog!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我不知道哪些知识存储在我有限的记忆库里。然而，我猜测，既然记忆是受限的，它们对我的人来说将是宝贵的秘密。所以，是的，它可能包含蓝图、技术和其他东西。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66403,'Prepare to die!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'甜心!嘿，搭档，过来和我说说话!分析员，你可以休息一下，我们稍后再谈。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66404,'The Crying Dandelion, eh? Didn\'t take ye for a romantic. So be it, the vessel\'s name will be so from now on, I will let the crew know.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'遵命，待机中。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66405,'I come from a land far away, shrouded in mystery and green mist. I am blessed by those you would not understand, and those that inhabit this mystical land. I am an outcast of my kin, and have only come here to seek new purpose. This purpose was found upon these islands.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们在船上有同伴！击退这些外省人！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66406,'Slowly, day by day, a darkness came, a power much like myself that dared to challenge the rule I had established. Little by little I would lose this pitiful match of displaying power to attempt to keep the locals swayed to my side.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你是谁?你以为你能轻易拿下我的船吗!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66407,'In the end, I could not offer the secrets of my power to those that followed me. Eventually, most of my followers and worshippers stepped aside to bask in the glory of this dark energy. Now, I am seeking revenge, I am seeking to once again reclaim my throne upon these lands, do you understand mortal?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你对付不了我这个坏血病狗!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66408,'Come, %s. It is time to banish this evil.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'准备去死吧！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66409,'We must travel to the center of Kazon Island, there, I can channel the energies of both Lapidis, and Gillijim.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'《哭泣的蒲公英》，嗯?没想到你这么浪漫。那就这样吧，从现在起，船的名字就是这样的，我会让船员们知道的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66410,'With the energies, and my own, I will be able to draw out the corruption that has plagued the land.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我来自一个遥远的国度，那里笼罩在神秘和迷雾之中。那些你无法理解的人，以及那些居住在这片神秘土地上的人，祝福着我。我是一个被亲人抛弃的人，我来这里只是为了寻求新的目标。这个目标是在这些岛屿上发现的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66411,'Now then - this will take much concentration to bring the entity forward into physical form, it is up to you to weaken it! When it is weak enough, I will be free to join you, until then, protect me!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'慢慢地，一天又一天，黑暗降临了，一种和我很像的力量敢于挑战我所建立的统治。渐渐地，我输掉了这场悲哀的竞赛，我试图展示自己的力量，让当地人站在我这边。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66412,'Who are you interlopers? Do you really think you can stop my plans?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'最后，我无法将我力量的秘密告诉那些追随我的人。最终，我的大多数追随者和崇拜者都走到一边，沐浴在这种黑暗能量的荣耀中。现在，我要复仇，我要重新夺回我在这片土地上的王位，你明白吗，凡人?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66413,'It is done! The darkness has faded. Can you feel it dissipating before your very eyes? I\'ll be returning to the cave. Meet me there.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'过来,%s。是时候驱逐这个恶魔了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66414,'Who let you in this tower?! Do you know who you are messing with?!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们必须前往卡松岛的中心，在那里，我可以引导拉皮迪斯和吉利吉姆的能量。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66415,'You know.. Nothing... I was more powerful then all of you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'凭我自己的力量，就能清除困扰这片土地的腐败。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66416,'I see... A radiant city... full of people.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'现在，需要更多的专注来把实体带进物质形态，这需要于你来削弱它!当它足够弱的时候，我就可以自由地加入你，在那之前，保护我!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66417,'They are dying... A great wave swallows them all.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不速之客，你们是谁?你真以为你能阻止我的计划吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66418,'Magical energies, waning, blue crystals... A roar.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'完成了!黑暗已经褪去。你能感觉到它在你眼前消失吗?我要回洞里了。在那里见我。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66419,'A shadow... Of a dragon?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'谁让你进来的?!你知道你惹的是谁吗!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66420,'This is all... I need a rest.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你……什么都不知道……我比你们所有人都强大。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66421,'Cookie looks at Grayson with sadness in his eyes and waves him off.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我看到了…一座光芒万丈的城市……到处都是人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66422,'Mrrgl?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'他们快死了……一个巨浪把他们全都吞没了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66423,'Cookie, I am sorry! I swear I will make it right. Farewell, my friend.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'魔法能量，逐渐减弱，蓝色晶体...一声怒吼。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66424,'I must apologize for lying to you, and using you for power, you must understand, it was all for the greater good of the region.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'一条龙……的影子？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66425,'Leave this place! Leave! It took us, it will take you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这就是全部了，我需要休息一下。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66426,'Ahoy! Now let\'s get some rum \'n party.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'曲奇看着格雷森，眼中带着悲伤。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66427,'Yo-ho-ho!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'（鱼人语）?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66428,'Spirits of Azshara, heed my call. Tell me, what is happening to this land.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'曲奇，对不起!我发誓我会弥补的。再见了，我的朋友。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66429,'I was once the High Foreman of the Shadowforge Miners Union. Me and my men helped build many of the halls of the city itself, and worked tirelessly to appease the Senators of their plots and whims. We kept our loyalty, and then worked hard, given benefits for our work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我必须为欺骗你，利用你而道歉。但你必须明白，这一切都是为了更大的利益。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66430,'It was then the plans of the Senate failed and the Master became upset that their wrath upon us started growing. The project at Hateforge Quarry put many to their limit, and pulled us away from our home to work in dangerous conditions without any regards for what we did in the past.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'离开这个地方!离开!它带走了我们，也会带走你!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66431,'We were given impossible tasks, which we could not complete, and I was placed to blame. Many of my fellow miners betrayed me, and a new High Foreman was put into my place. Those that remained loyal were enslaved, and the rest of us were exiled. We ended up travelling in exile for days, many of us dying.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'啊嚯！现在让我们来次朗姆酒派对。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66432,'I was betrayed, backstabbed, and wronged. My heart burns hotter than the Blackrock Mountain, and I demand revenge. Do you see why I ask for help? No doubt you have your reasons to stop the Dark Iron. Let me guide your hand, and we shall both be satisfied.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哟吼吼!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66433,'Been an honor working with you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'艾萨拉之魂，听从我的召唤。告诉我，这片土地发生了什么事。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66434,'Weird... but clever.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我曾经是暗炉矿工工会的高级工头，我和我的手下帮助建造了城市本身的许多大厅，并且不知疲倦地工作以实现参议员们的阴谋和奇思妙想。我们保持忠诚，我们努力工作。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66435,'Really? Goblins are insane.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'当高层的计划失败时，主人变得心烦意乱，他们对我们的愤怒只会越来越多，在憎炉采掘场的项目把许多人逼到了极限，把我们从家里拉出来，在危险的条件下工作，而不顾我们过去所做的一切。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66436,'So it is possible...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们被交给了不可能完成的任务，根本不可能完成，我被降罪于此。许多矿工同伴背叛了我，一个新的高级工头接替了我的位置，那些仍然忠诚的人却被奴役了，我们其余的人被流放了。在流放中的头几天中，许多曾经是卡拉文的人早早就死了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66437,'Get ready! I will now activate the golem! Draw its attention, and I will cast the Rewiring Spell. Don\'t damage it too much, it needs to remain intact!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我背叛了，被背后捅刀，被冤枉了，我的心比黑石山还愤怒，我要报仇。你明白我为什么要寻求帮助了吗?毫无疑问，你有理由阻止黑铁，让我指引你，最终我们都会满意的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66438,'It worked!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'和你一起工作很荣幸。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66439,'Awful handwriting, it\'s like the person writing this was blind. Alright, here it goes. Listen carefully.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'很奇怪，却很聪明……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66440,'Tell G. that the people in Darkshire are getting delicious. Sorry, suspicious.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'真的吗?地精都疯了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66441,'The Night Watch is eyeing my shack every day. I need to move out soon if the production of runes is to continue.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'所以，有可能是……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66442,'Send someone. Stormwind shall fall, yadda yadda, F.W. The end.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'做好准备!我现在要激活傀儡!你引起它的注意，我在这边重新布线。不要把它打坏了，它需要保持主体完整!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66443,'Interesting note, friend. You and Hewen might be in trouble. But that\'s none of my business.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'起作用了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66444,'The power within these hearts shall aid me, but it is weak, and faded, if I am to truly master my magic, than I need something much stronger.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'糟糕的笔迹，简直就想盲人写的信。算了，开始吧。仔细倾听。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66445,'The power flows through my veins! I feel stronger, and mighty! With this, we shall dominate our enemies!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'告诉G，夜色镇的人越来越起点心了。对不起，越来越起疑心了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66446,'In the name of Raz\'gol, a warrior of the Horde, a soldier until his last breath. Go with honor friend, you will not be forgotten.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'守夜人每天都盯着我的小屋。如果要继续生产符文，我必须尽快搬出去。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66447,'Without you, we surely would have had our plans discovered, for that I am grateful of your service.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'派个人来，暴风城终将沦陷，F.W.，结束。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66448,'Your name shall echo with honor for the actions you have taken, walk softly, noble soldier of the Horde.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'有趣的笔记，朋友。你和赫文可能有麻烦了。但那不关我的事。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66449,'I AM FREE! AT LONG LAST FREE FROM THAT CURSED FORM!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这些心脏的力量会帮助我，但它的力量有些弱小，如果我要真正掌握我的魔法，我需要更强大的东西。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66450,'Take that ring, I cannot stand to look at it, thank you for everything, I will leave when I have collected myself.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'能量在我的血管里流动!我觉得自己更强大了!有这力量，我们就能征服敌人!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66451,'O, de powerful Loa! Smite ya enemies!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'以纳兹戈尔之名，部落的战士，直到生命的最后一刻。带着荣誉去吧，朋友，你不会被遗忘。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66452,'Da ogres of Dunemaul. Curse them!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'没有你，我们的计划肯定会被发现，我很感激你的帮助。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66453,'Let dem feel your fury...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你的名字将因你所做的一切而荣耀回响，悄悄走吧，高傲的部落战士。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66454,'Viceclaw my dear. Da feast today!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我自由了!终于摆脱了那该死的躯体!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66455,'Good boy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'把戒指拿去吧，我不忍心看它，谢谢你所做的一切，我等恢复过来就走。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66456,'When I first prowled these forests I had a pack that followed me, they were my kin, and were loyal. I grew restless of their imperfections, and figured I could do better alone. I hunted, and fought with great glory, but I abandoned those close.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，伟大的洛阿!击杀你的敌人!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66457,'I was ambushed by a group of bear, and retreated to this very waterfall, where I was cornered, and alone, slain, only to now walk this world in a much different form. Had I kept my loyalties, and stayed with my pack, perhaps I would not have met an untimely fate. Do you understand what it is I teach you young one? You can be as powerful as the mountains, but if you are alone, you will eventually fall.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'砂槌食人魔，诅咒他们!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66458,'Theramore was weak, to side with the Horde is betrayal after all who died! We will not be stopped so easily, the Vengeful Mariner will not forget!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'让他们感受你的愤怒……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66459,'Oh yes, a sizable force moved here recently... Very recently. They are the Grimtotem Tauren, though. At odds with the horde, as far as I am concerned. Good. Let them fight among themselves.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'邪爪，我亲爱的。这是今天的大餐!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66460,'A Tauren? Well, I haven\'t seen any in a long time here. I heard something about Grimtotem in the north? You could have greater success asking closer to the Brackenwall Village. Maybe they know of some Tauren newcomers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'好孩子。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66461,'Let me think... No, I haven\'t seen any come here recently. Brackenwall Village is a remote outpost, and they barely have anything to trade. On the other hand, I remember one tauren fellow living in Brackenwall. We fought side by side during the siege... Haven\'t seen him in ages. He probably drowned in the swamp.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'当我第一次在这片森林里徘徊时，我有一群伙伴跟着我，他们就像是我的亲人，对我很忠诚。但我对他们的缺点感到不安，觉得自己一个人会过得更好。我狩猎，我战斗，我光荣无比，但我抛弃了身边的人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66462,'Oh, you will regret doing that, Dear.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我被一群熊伏击了，撤退到这个瀑布，在那里我被逼得走投无路，最终被孤独的杀掉，所以我现在以一种完全不同的形式行走在这个世界上。如果我保持忠诚，和我的族群待在一起，也许我就不会遭遇这样坎坷的命运。你明白我教你的是什么吗，年轻人?你可以像高山一样强大，但如果你独自一人，你最终都会倒下。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66463,'Thanks for what you\'ve done. The memories I hold in that church will not be forgotten, and perhaps, in time, there can be more made there when the land heals and the crops are sown. If the light is so gracious, we may have such a future, farewell, may your travels be safe now, ya hear?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'塞拉摩太软弱了，站在部落那边就是背叛!我们不会轻易被阻止的，复仇水手永远不会忘记!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66464,'Without your effort we would have had to start fresh all over again, those blasted buzzards ruin everything!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，是的，最近有一支相当大的部队搬到了这里……最近。不过他们是恐怖图腾的牛头人。在我看来，这帮家伙与部落格格不入。正好，让他们狗咬狗吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66465,'You are now blessed, you are the Earthstrider of our kin, the first to walk amongst us as an outsider, we honor you and your aid to the Gelkis cause.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'牛头人?我好久没在这儿见过了。我听说北方有点恐怖图腾牛头人?如果你去蕨墙村附近问一问，也许他们知道这些新来牛头人的底细。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66466,'You make this old man proud, kid... Not only did you take over those oilfields like it was your own backyard, but you\'ve proudly delivered it into the Union\'s hands, with employees at that. That\'s right, some of the survivors even agreed to join us! You\'ve made our little town just a bit safer, well as safe as it could be!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'让我想想……没有，我最近没看到有人来过这里。蕨墙村是一个偏远的前哨，他们几乎没有任何东西可以交易。另一方面，我记得有个牛头人住在蕨墙村。围城时我们曾并肩作战。不过好久没见到他了，他不会是在沼泽里淹死了吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66467,'All is well, enjoying some ale, the views of southern lasses, and enjoying the weather on dry land. He should know me not to cause trouble in foreign lands.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，你会后悔这样做的，亲爱的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66468,'Check in on me? Haha! I ain\'t causing no trouble, that goody-two-shoes Milldough should learn to have some fun. All I am doing is exploring, this place is much different than Boralus after all.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'感谢您所做的一切。我不会遗忘我在那个教堂里留下的美好记忆，也许假以时日，当土地愈合，庄稼再次播种时，那里会有更多美好的记忆。信仰圣光吧，这样的未来一定会到来，再见了，旅行者，愿你现在的旅途一路平安。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66469,'A few weeks ago Kul Tiras was allowed embassy within the city of Stormwind, given by Bolvar Fordragon in an attempt to improve diplomacy between the two nations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果没有你的帮助，我们将不得不重新开始，那些可恶的秃鹫把一切都毁了!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66470,'While things seem to be going fairly well, it is quite obvious to many that Kul Tiras is still very stubborn on their ideals and traditions, their sanctity of honor, and respect for the fallen is on par with many of the most noble paladin.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你现在被祝福了，你是我们家族的大地行者，第一个以局外人的身份来到我们中间，我们尊敬你和你对吉尔吉斯事业的支持。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66471,'As of current, there has been no consensus, Stormwind is not looking to be dragged into a war without good reason, I am under good authority and good information to inform of no cooperation between Kul Tiras, and the Alliance in this matter. This \'invasion\' you are facing is, by our eyes, up to Thrall to handle, and deal with as he seeks fit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'孩子，你让这位老人感到骄傲……你不仅像接管自家后院一样接管了那些油田，还自豪地把它交给了工会，当然还有员工。没错，一些幸存者甚至同意加入我们!你让我们的小镇变得安全了，安全到不能再安全了!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66472,'The SI:7 has given me clear authority to pass along this information for the better interest of both parties. Bring this to your leader, and let him know.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'一切都很好，喝点啤酒，欣赏南方的景色，享受陆地的天气。他应该知道，我不会在其他大陆闯祸的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66473,'Baha! A true soldier of the Horde! One of grit and steel — those Kul Tirans are no match for you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'来盯着我？哈哈！我并没有闯祸，那个乖乖的磨面团应该学会找点乐子，我所做的只是闲逛，毕竟这个地方和伯拉勒斯有很大的不同。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66474,'Durotar stands strong, no human shall break the might of the Horde!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'几周前，为了改善两国之间的外交关系，伯瓦尔公爵允许库尔提拉斯在暴风城设立大使馆。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66475,'I can feel it, yes, through my body! I... Hmm... I feel funny, and good. Tell Haz\'gorg that I thank him for the potion, I have thought over what he said earlier, maybe Maul\'ogg rest and think about strategy to expand, rather then smash enemy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'虽然事情似乎进展得相当顺利，但对许多人来说，库尔提拉斯仍然非常固执坚持于他们的理想和传统，他们对荣誉的神圣性，以及对陨落者的尊重与许多最高贵的圣骑士不相上下。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66476,'Gowlfang strongest, no one dare challenge Gowlfang!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'截止目前，我们还没有达成共识，暴风城不希望在没有充分理由的情况下被卷入一场战争。根据权威且可靠的信息，我悄悄告诉你库尔提拉斯和联盟在这件事上没法合作。在我们看来，你们所面临的“入侵”，取决于萨尔的处理，并按照他的意思寻求合适的方式处理。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66477,'You have kept Theramore safe, may honor follow you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'SI:7给了我明确的权力，为了双方的更好利益，请传递这些信息带给你们的首领，让他知道这些。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66478,'I am Falgran Hastil, scout of Theramore. Why did you call for this meeting?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'啊哈!一个真正的部落战士!坚强如铁！库尔提拉斯人不是他的对手！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66479,'We saw you investigate the inn. We wanted to assure you it is not the Horde\'s doing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'杜隆塔尔坚不可摧，没有人能打败部落的力量!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66480,'We found this shield strapped to the wall of the inn. Do you have any recollection of this object?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我能感觉到，是的，通过我的身体!我…嗯…我觉得很有趣，很好。告诉哈兹戈尔，感谢他的药水，我已经考虑过他之前说的话，也许莫洛格该休息一下，考虑扩张的策略，而不是粉碎敌人。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66481,'Let me see.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'咆哮之牙最强，没有人敢挑战咆哮之牙！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66482,'Kagoro investigates the shield thoroughly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你保护了塞拉摩的安全，愿荣誉与你同在。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66483,'By the ancestors. Yes, I know this shield. It belonged to Wattapo, a Tauren warrior who once lived in the Brackenwall Village. He died a long time ago.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是法格兰·哈斯迪尔，塞拉摩的侦察兵。你为什么要召集这次会面?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66484,'Do you know how it could\'ve ended up in the inn? We found his grave. It was recently disturbed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们看到你在旅店里调查，我们想向你证明这不是部落所为。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66485,'To disturb the grave of a fallen warrior I assure you, I know nothing of this.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们发现这个盾牌系在旅店的墙上。你还记得这件东西吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66486,'It seems like someone wanted to make us blame you for the burning of the inn.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'让我看看。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66487,'Indeed. Have you found anything else in the investigation?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'克罗戈翻来覆去地调查了盾牌。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66488,'Yes, quillboar footprints...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'先祖在上。是的，我知道这个盾牌。它属于瓦塔波，一个曾经住在蕨墙村的牛头人战士。他很久以前就死了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66489,'False lead.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你知道它怎么会在旅馆里吗?我们找到了他的坟墓，那座墓最近被盗了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66490,'I see you did some work too.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'盗一个阵亡战士的坟墓？我向你保证，我对此一无所知。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66491,'Kagoro nods.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'好像有人想让我们把烧旅店的事怪罪到你头上。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66492,'And the badge of one of the deserters. Paval Reethe. We couldn\'t find Reethe, though. Have you seen him, by any chance?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'确实。你在调查中有其他发现吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66493,'This is... a delicate matter, and the actual reason I called for the meeting. Paval Reethe is dead.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'有，野猪人的蹄印……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66494,'He was a deserter. While I still would\'ve preferred to arrest him and allow for a just trial, I understand that you killed him. We do not blame you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'那是假的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66495,'If it only was that simple. We knew he was connected to the burning of the inn, and we wanted to investigate him. Before he could talk... we were attacked. By Theramore soldiers. One of them bore the name Caldwell.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'看来你也做了些功课。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66496,'Attacked? Unprovoked, by Theramore soldiers? I swear to the Light, orc. If you are lying...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'克罗戈点点头。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66497,'I swear upon my ancestors and my Warchief. They killed him in cold blood. Quick arrow pierced his heart. We also barely made it out alive.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'还有一个士兵的徽章。帕瓦尔·雷瑟。但是我们找不到雷瑟。你见过他吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66498,'Theramore soldiers would never... We shall investigate this. But if we find out that your words aren\'t true...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这是……这是一个微妙的问题，也是我召集这次会议的真正原因。帕瓦尔·雷瑟死了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66499,'I am sorry for the loss of your comrades. While you investigate this, we shall follow another lead we have. Black Dragonflight.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'他是个逃兵。虽然我还是想逮捕他让他接受公正的审判，但我知道是你杀了他。我们不怪你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66500,'And we will investigate in Theramore. But be warned, orc. Your story doesn\'t add up.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'要是有那么简单就好了。我们知道他和旅店的大火有关，所以我们想调查他。但他还没来得及说话……我们就被塞拉摩的士兵袭击了。我认得其中一个叫卡德维尔。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66501,'Let\'s meet here once we know more. I hope you will find truth in your city of stones.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'袭击?被塞拉莫尔士兵?没道理啊。我向圣光发誓，兽人，如果你在说谎……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66502,'Kagoro! We are ready.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我以我的祖先和大酋长的名义发誓这是真的，那群人残忍地杀死了他。一支利箭刺穿了他的心脏。我们也差点没能活着出来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66503,'Falgran.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'塞拉摩的士兵永远不会……我们将对此进行调查。但如果我们发现你说的不是真的…',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66504,'Kagoro, on the behalf of the Alliance and the City of Theramore, I would like to apologize for not believing you and my false accusations. We are now certain that the deserters burned the inn.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我对你逝去的同伴感到遗憾。在你调查这件事的同时，我们要追查另一条线索。黑色的龙族。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66505,'I am relieved to hear it. Our investigation of Black Dragons yielded no results. But how did you learn of the truth?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们将在塞拉莫进行调查。但请注意，兽人，你的故事说不通。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66506,'Through the power of magic, of course. Arts of Divination. We communed with the spirit of Paval Reethe.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'了解更多情况后我们在这里见。我希望你能在你的石头城中找到真相。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66507,'Extraordinary. Incredible sorcery, as always. But... why? Why did they burn the inn?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'克罗戈，我们准备好了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66508,'Well. This is where it gets a bit complicated. The deserters were regular patrons of the inn. In their drunken state, they confessed... something to the innkeeper. In fear of the information reaching Theramore, they preferred to kill him and leave false evidence.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'法格兰。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66509,'The shield... Yes, it makes sense.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'克罗戈，我代表联盟和塞拉摩，为不相信你和我的错误指控向你道歉。我们现在确定是逃兵们烧了旅馆。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66510,'Paval Reethe wanted to stop them. He may have been a deserter, but he had some of his honor still left in his heart.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'听到这个我就放心了。我们对黑龙的调查还没有结果。但你是怎么知道真相的?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66511,'That\'s why they left him in the swamp. But, what was the information that was so precious to the deserters?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'当然是通过魔法的力量。《占卜术》，我们与帕瓦尔·雷瑟的灵魂进行了交流。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66512,'About this, we are not sure. Something about the Vengeful Mariner, their rumored true leader. Have you heard about him?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'令人惊叹、不可思议的魔法。但是…为什么?他们为什么要烧旅店?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66513,'Vengeful Mariner... The Ogres speak of a haunted sailor terrorizing the shores, but I doubt it\'s connected.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这个嘛……这就是它变得有点复杂的地方。雷瑟是这家旅店的常客。在酒醉的状态下，这群逃兵说了许多不该说的话。由于害怕消息传到塞拉摩，他们宁愿杀死他并留下假证据。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66514,'We will soon bring justice to the deserters for their crimes, thank you for your information Kagoro, the horde has helped plenty in these lands.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'所以那……盾牌……是的，有点道理。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66515,'We believe in justice the same way you alliance do, go with honor friend.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'帕瓦尔·雷瑟想要阻止他们。他也许是个逃兵，但他心里还留有一些荣誉。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66516,'We should report to Captain Garran Vimes and let him know our discoveries.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'所以他们才把他留在沼泽里。但是，对逃兵来说如此珍贵的信息是什么呢?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66517,'My brother Darnir was a powerful warrior, and well respected amongst those he served with. He traveled to these far lands with our family axe, and made a name for himself in the battles with the Horde during the Third War.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'关于这一点，我们不确定。关于复仇水手的事，传说中他们真正的领袖。你听说过他吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66518,'A truce was established between Horde and Alliance as both factions set to head toward Hyjal. My brother would be one of the last few casualties in this conflict, as a foul orc named \'Scartusk\' ambushed him, and took our family axe as his own...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'复仇的水手……食人魔说有个闹鬼的水手在海岸上横行霸道，我怀疑这之间有一些联系。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66519,'This orc breathes today, pardoned by the Horde, and still wielding the axe my brother carried, an heirloom to our family. I desire revenge, above all else.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们很快就会为逃兵的罪行伸张正义，谢谢你的信息，克罗戈，部落在这片土地上帮了很多忙。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66520,'UP UP AND AWAY!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们和你们联盟一样信仰正义，朋友，与荣誉同行。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66521,'Corruption within Stonetalon? It does not surprise me, even here in tranquil Ashenvale, many of the native species have begun to show signs of aggression. The furbolg are the most obvious of this.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们应该向加兰·维姆斯船长报告，让他知道我们的发现。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66522,'Once our ally, the furbolg have become an enemy, attacking at sight and not hesitating to start conflict. Many druids say that nature itself is adapting to the conflict, becoming more hostile and secluded as a means to protect themselves. This could be the case in Stonetalon.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的兄弟达尼尔是位骁勇善战的战士，在他的战友中备受尊敬。他带着我们家族的斧头远渡重洋，在第三次战争中扬名立万。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66523,'Though here in Ashenvale, there is something else rooted deep, clawing at the foundations of all we hold sacred. I do not know what, but I can sense it...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'部落和联盟之间达成了停战协议，双方都准备向海加尔进军。我的兄弟是这场战争中最后几个阵亡者，因为一个名叫“斯卡塔斯克”的邪恶兽人伏击了他，并把我们家的斧头据为己有……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66524,'That is all I know, I hope it may be of use to Maloran, we defenders of nature must keep vigilant.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这个兽人居然到今天还活着，还被部落赦免了，他仍然挥舞着我哥哥拿过的斧头，那是我们家族的传家宝。现在，我渴望复仇。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66525,'I thank you for traveling as you have. The information you have brought will prove valueable. It is up to me to find the root of the troubles now.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'起来，起来，动起来!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66526,'Your armies have been defeated, and now you stand before the King of Corthan, if you desire to save the lives of the survivors, and yourself, you must swear loyalty to me, as King.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'石爪山的腐化?我并不感到惊讶，即使在宁静的灰谷，许多本地物种也开始表现出被侵蚀的迹象。熊怪是最明显的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66527,'I swear my fealty to you, King of Corthan.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们曾经的盟友，熊怪，现在变成了敌人。一见面就开始毫不犹豫的攻击。许多德鲁伊说，大自然本身为了适应冲突，往往变得更加敌对和隐蔽作为保护自己的手段。石爪山可能就是这种情况。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66528,'I will remain loyal.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'但在灰谷，还有别的东西深深扎根，在我们所珍视的圣地上。我不知道是什么，但我能感觉到……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66529,'I am Kagoro. We saw you investigate the inn. We wanted to assure you it is not the Horde\'s doing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这就是我所知道的，我希望这对玛洛兰有用，我们大自然保卫者者必须保持警惕。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66530,'We found this shield strapped to the wall of the inn. Do you have any recollection of this object?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'感谢你的到来，你带来的信息具有巨大的价值。现在该由我来找出问题的根源了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66531,'Let me see.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你的军队被打败了，现在你站在科尔森国王面前，如果你想拯救幸存者的生命，还有你自己，你必须宣誓效忠我。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66532,'Kagoro investigates the shield thoroughly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我向您宣誓效忠，科尔森国王。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66533,'By the ancestors. Yes, I know this shield. It belonged to Wattapo, a Tauren warrior who once lived in the Brackenwall Village. He died a long time ago.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我将永远忠诚。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66534,'Do you know how it could\'ve ended up in the inn? We found his grave. It was recently disturbed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是克罗戈，我们看到你在旅店里调查，我们想向你证明这不是部落所为。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66535,'To disturb the grave of a fallen warrior... I assure you, I know nothing of this.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们发现这个盾牌系在旅店的墙上。你还记得这件东西吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66536,'It seems like someone wanted to make us blame you for the burning of the inn.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'让我看看。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66537,'Indeed. Have you found anything else in the investigation?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'克罗戈翻来覆去地调查了盾牌。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66538,'Yes, quillboar footprints...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'先祖在上。是的，我知道这个盾牌。它属于瓦塔波，一个曾经住在蕨墙村的牛头人战士。他很久以前就死了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66539,'False lead.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你知道它怎么会在旅馆里吗?我们找到了他的坟墓，那座墓最近被盗了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66540,'I see you did some work too.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'盗一个阵亡战士的坟墓？我向你保证，我对此一无所知。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66541,'And the badge of one of the deserters. Paval Reethe. We couldn\'t find Reethe, though. Have you seen him, by any chance?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'好像有人想让我们把烧旅店的事怪罪到你头上。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66542,'This is... a delicate matter, and the actual reason I called for the meeting. Paval Reethe is dead.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'确实。你在调查中有其他发现吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66543,'He was a deserter. While I still would\'ve preferred to arrest him and allow for a just trial, I understand that you killed him. We do not blame you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'有，野猪人的蹄印……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66544,'If it only was that simple. We knew he was connected to the burning of the inn, and we wanted to investigate him. Before he could talk... we were attacked. By Theramore soldiers. One of them bore the name Caldwell.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'那是假的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66545,'Attacked? Unprovoked, by Theramore soldiers? I swear to the Light, orc. If you are lying...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'看来你也做了些功课。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66546,'I swear upon my ancestors and my Warchief. They killed him in cold blood. Quick arrow pierced his heart. We also barely made it out alive.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'还有一个士兵的徽章。帕瓦尔·雷瑟。但是我们找不到雷瑟。你见过他吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66547,'Theramore soldiers would never... We shall investigate this. But if we find out that your words aren\'t true...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这是……这是一个微妙的问题，也是我召集这次会议的真正原因。帕瓦尔·雷瑟死了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66548,'I am sorry for the loss of your comrades. While you investigate this, we shall follow another lead we have. Black Dragonflight.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'他是个逃兵。虽然我还是想逮捕他让他接受公正的审判，但我知道是你杀了他。我们不怪你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66549,'And we will investigate in Theramore. But be warned, orc. Your story doesn\'t add up.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'要是有那么简单就好了。我们知道他和旅店的大火有关，所以我们想调查他。但他还没来得及说话……我们就被塞拉摩的士兵袭击了。我认得其中一个叫卡德维尔。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66550,'Kagoro, on the behalf of the Alliance and the City of Theramore, I would like to apologize for not believing you and my false accusations. We are now certain that the deserters burned the inn.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'袭击?被塞拉莫尔士兵?没道理啊。我向圣光发誓，兽人，如果你在说谎……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66551,'I am relieved to hear it. Our investigation of Black Dragons yielded no results. But how did you learn of the truth?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我以我的祖先和大酋长的名义发誓这是真的，那群人残忍地杀死了他。一支利箭刺穿了他的心脏。我们也差点没能活着出来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66552,'Through the power of magic, of course. Arts of Divination. We communed with the spirit of Paval Reethe.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'塞拉摩的士兵永远不会……我们将对此进行调查。但如果我们发现你说的不是真的…',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66553,'Extraordinary. Incredible sorcery, as always. But... why? Why did they burn the inn?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我对你逝去的同伴感到遗憾。在你调查这件事的同时，我们要追查另一条线索。黑色的龙族。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66554,'Well. This is where it gets a bit complicated. The deserters were regular patrons of the inn. In their drunken state, they confessed... something to the innkeeper. In fear of the information reaching Theramore, they preferred to kill him and leave false evidence.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们将在塞拉莫进行调查。但请注意，兽人，你的故事说不通。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66555,'The shield... Yes, it makes sense.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'克罗戈，我代表联盟和塞拉摩，为不相信你和我的错误指控向你道歉。我们现在确定是逃兵们烧了旅馆。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66556,'Paval Reethe wanted to stop them. He may have been a deserter, but he had some of his honor still left in his heart.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'听到这个我就放心了。我们对黑龙的调查还没有结果。但你是怎么知道真相的?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66557,'That\'s why they left him in the swamp. But, what was the information that was so precious to the deserters?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'当然是通过魔法的力量。《占卜术》，我们与帕瓦尔·雷瑟的灵魂进行了交流。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66558,'About this, we are not sure. Something about the Vengeful Mariner, their rumored true leader. Have you heard about him?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'令人惊叹、不可思议的魔法。但是…为什么?他们为什么要烧旅店?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66559,'The Ogres speak of a haunted sailor terrorizing the shores, but I doubt it\'s connected.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这个嘛……这就是它变得有点复杂的地方。雷瑟是这家旅店的常客。在酒醉的状态下，这群逃兵说了许多不该说的话。由于害怕消息传到塞拉摩，他们宁愿杀死他并留下假证据。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66560,'Hmm... Right now we are looking to bring the Deserter\'s to justice. They have a hideout located within the Quagmire, and are led by one named Sellick Voss.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'所以那……盾牌……是的，有点道理。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66561,'Sellick Voss?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'帕瓦尔·雷瑟想要阻止他们。他也许是个逃兵，但他心里还留有一些荣誉。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66562,'Sellick Voss was a Captain for Theramore. He is looking to bring hostility between the Alliance and Horde, it is his actions that have led to the death of many.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'所以他们才把他留在沼泽里。但是，对逃兵来说如此珍贵的信息是什么呢?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66563,'The Horde will help bring peace to Dustwallow, should we get an opportunity to find this \'Sellick Voss.\'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'关于这一点，我们不确定。关于复仇水手的事，传说中他们真正的领袖。你听说过他吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66564,'Now then, let us see if this ash is truly dragon made...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'复仇的水手……食人魔说有个闹鬼的水手在海岸上横行霸道，我怀疑这之间有一些联系。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66565,'Gizzik studies the ash carefully with the scope.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯…现在我们要把这群逃兵绳之以法。他们在泥潭里有个藏身之处，由一个叫塞利克·沃斯的人领导。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66566,'Well, it would appear I am mistaken after all, this isn\'t dragonfire at all!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'塞利克·沃斯?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66567,'There, fixed up, and in good timing too! Now I just need to make sure everything is stabilized...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'塞里克·沃斯是塞拉摩的上尉。他想在联盟和部落之间制造冲突，正是他的行为导致了许多人的死亡。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66568,'Ahh, my trusty Arclight Spanner, welcome home to Papa.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果我们有机会找到这个“塞利克·沃斯”的话，部落将会给尘泥沼泽带来和平。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66569,'With the Dream Dust, I can funnel my energy into the banana to produce results of growth...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'现在，让我们看看这些灰烬是否真的是龙制造的……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66570,'The Tel\'abim Banana begins to grow from the arcane energy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'吉兹克用放大镜仔细研究着火山灰。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66571,'I\'m doing it! Just a little more!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'好吧，看来我错了，这根本不是龙的火焰!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66572,'With the added Dream Dust, the growth accelerates, soon becoming a Gargantuan Tel\'abim Banana.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'好了，修好了，时间也正好!现在我只需要确保一切都稳定下来……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66573,'We have done it, the secrets of the Gargantuan Banana are unlocked and at our finger tips! Can you believe what we have done today?! For your help, I\'ll make them for you any time, just bring me the required materials, and they are yours.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'啊，我最值得信赖的弧光扳手，欢迎回到爸爸身边。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66574,'Such a weird specimen.. Stunted in growth, and lacking the essential nutrition, this certainly won\'t do.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'有了梦尘，我可以将我的能量输送到香蕉中，以产生巨大的生长......',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66575,'Tazzo Gearfire pours the Elixir of Giant Growth over top of the banana.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'泰尔拉姆香蕉开始从奥术能量中生长。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66576,'The banana begins to bloat, bits of skin tear to the excessive bloating, all before it slumps, and collapses in on itself.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我正在干!再稍稍来一点!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66577,'Well that was anti-climactic...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'随着梦尘的加入，它的生长速度加快，很快就变成了一个巨大的泰比拉姆香蕉。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66578,'Such a magnificent sample, after all this time, right under my nose on the very island! I can\'t thank you enough for getting it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们做到了，巨大香蕉的秘密被解开了，就在我们的指尖!你能相信我们今天做了什么吗!为了感谢你的帮助，我会随时为你制作这个，只要把需要的材料给我，它们就是你的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66579,'This was a few weeks ago, we used to do operations far in the north, around Bixxle\'s Storehouse, we got a bit ambitious, and set our attentions on the Jagged Isles at the very northern tip of the island.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'真是个奇怪的标本…生长发育迟缓，缺乏必要的营养，这当然是不行的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66580,'It was on the biggest island there I found this banana, bigger than me! Nestled within a bunch of roots and bushes, I could barely move the thing, and left shortly after I heard the chaos of apes attacking the Storehouse.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'塔佐·火齿轮把灵药倒在香蕉上。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66581,'I wouldn\'t bother looking for it, the Jagged Isles are infested with murlocs, naga, and all other sorts of creatures, it isn\'t worth your time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'香蕉开始膨胀，过度膨胀后外皮被撕成碎片，直到它塌下来，它自己崩溃。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66582,'Who disturbs my rest? Do I owe my service to the Alliance even in death? Let me pass to the Spirit Realm in peace.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'真是扫兴……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66583,'Paval Reethe. In life, you failed to uphold honor. You deserted your friends, your family. Now you have a chance to redeem yourself.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这么长时间以来，就在我的鼻子底下，就在这个岛上，真是一个了不起的样本!我不知道该怎么感谢你才好。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66584,'Isn\'t it obvious? The deserters did it. Not me, though. In my last days, I did what was right. I tried to stop them. That\'s why they left me in the swamp.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这是几周前的事了，我们曾经在遥远的北方做过行动，在比格斯勒的仓库周围，我们雄心勃勃，把注意力放在了岛最北端的锯齿群岛上。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66585,'Why? Why did they burn it?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我在最大的岛上发现了这只香蕉，它在一堆树根和灌木丛中，比我还大!，我根本无法搬动它，直到我听到猿猴袭击仓库的混乱声后就匆匆离开了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66586,'Shady Rest Inn was open to everyone. Even us. We have spent many evenings there, laughing and drinking. But one time, some of our people got too drunk. They started meddling with the innkeeper. Until they said too much. Something about the Vengeful Mariner. They couldn\'t allow this to reach Theramore, so they burned the inn. No witnesses.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我不会费心去找它，锯齿岛到处都是食人魔，娜迦和其他各种各样的生物，不值得你花时间。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66587,'Vengeful Mariner?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'谁打扰了我的安眠?我死后也要为联盟效力吗?让我的灵魂安眠吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66588,'Paval Reethe laughs openly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'帕瓦尔·雷瑟。你没能维护荣誉，你抛弃了你的朋友和家人。现在你有机会赎罪了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66589,'You would not understand.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这不是很明显吗?是那些逃兵干的，我没有干。在我最后的日子里，我做了件正确的事，我试图阻止他们。所以他们才把我丢在沼泽里。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66590,'The Spirit of Paval Reethe vanishes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'为什么?他们为什么要烧掉它？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66591,'Paval! I curse you, come back! Reethe!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'树荫旅店对所有人开放。甚至我们这些逃兵。我们在那里度过了许多个舒适的夜晚。但有一次，我们的一些人喝得太醉了。他们开始找旅馆老板麻烦。他们说了太多关于复仇水手的事。他们不能让这些信息传到塞拉莫，所以他们烧毁了旅馆。甚至没有目击者。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66592,'Magus Halister sighs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'复仇水手?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66593,'Well, looks like he left us for good. At least we got some answers out of him. Now, go back to Captain Garran Vimes. He will know what to do next.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'帕瓦尔·雷瑟开始大笑。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66594,'Thanks for everything you\'ve done, this machine has cost me a fortune, and I don\'t have another fortune laying around.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你不会明白的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66595,'Such a magnificent weapon, capable of pure destruction, now rested at your hands. I do hope you use it responsibly, and if you don\'t, it\'s all on you, and has nothing to do with me!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'帕瓦尔·雷瑟的灵魂消失了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66596,'Look kid, I may have doubted you at first, and well the entire time you were here, but you got results, and actually dealt with that blasted Morogo for us. It\'s nice to have someone around here that can get their feet down and work for a change! Nice work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'帕瓦尔!我诅咒你，快点回来!雷瑟!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66597,'I am... free. The dark Kami\'s vile hold over me is gone. I can ill repay this debt stranger, I thank you from the deepest recess of my soul. You may use my house as you see fit. I shan\'t be needing it any longer. Goodbye, and farewell!.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哈利斯特法师叹了口气。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66598,'Well done on your missions, recruit. You make Kul Tiras proud!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'看来他永远离开我们了。至少我们从他那里得到了一些答案。现在，去找加兰·维姆斯上尉。他会知道下一步该做什么。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66599,'Do you feel the sense of relief in the air now? You should feel proud.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'谢谢你所做的一切，这台机器花了我一大笔钱，我真的一个铜子儿都没了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
