(66684,'I was sent on behalf of Haz\'gorg the Great Seer to remedy the situation with Lord Cruk\'Zogg.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我代表伟大的先知哈兹戈尔，我被派来解决克鲁克佐格大人的问题的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66685,'I have not spoken with Haz\'gorg in some time, but my people are also going through much the same as he, the Gor\'dosh have fallen on dark times, and are ruled by a tyrant. I hold no power any longer, but if I can help the Maul\'ogg then perhaps I have done something for the greater good.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我已经有一段时间没有和哈兹戈尔联系了，但是我的人民也在经历和他一样的事情，戈罗什被一个暴君统治着，如今陷入了黑暗时期，我已经没有权力了，但如果我能帮助摩尔奥格，也许我就做了一件好事。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66686,'Before the Tyrant King came into power, I had dabbled with the idea of making an elixir, a potion, or a spell to sway his mind into seeking less hostile means, perhaps this could work with Lord Cruk\'Zogg, to pacify him from being engulfed into madness, bring this information back to Haz\'gorg, perhaps he can figure out something that I could not.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在暴君王上台之前，我曾萌生过制作丹药、魔药或咒语的想法，以动摇他的思想，寻求不那么敌对的手段，也许这可以与克鲁克佐格合作，使他免于陷入疯狂，将这些信息带给哈兹戈尔，也许他能想出一些我无法弄清楚的事情。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66687,'Tak\'gar Deephate.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Tak\'gar Deephate.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
