(66689,'It is done! The power of the arcane flowed through my veins, and I was able to mimic the magic that once lingered upon the key. Now, the protection of the Horde can dominate our thought, and guide our next step.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'完成了!奥术的力量流淌在我的血管里，我能够模仿曾经徘徊在钥匙上的魔法。现在，部落的保护可以支配我们的思想，并指导我们下一步。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66690,'There! It took a considerable amount of focus, but I was able to mimic the magic upon the key, now we can turn our attention to the evil present beneath Karazhan.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在那里!这花了我很大的精力，但我能够模仿钥匙上的魔法，现在我们可以把注意力转向卡拉赞下面的邪恶了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66691,'I am ready to travel Inunquaq, let us head out!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我准备好去旅行了，伊农夸克，我们出发吧!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66692,'Inunquaq, I wish to return to Darkshore',NULL,NULL,NULL,'伊南夸克，我想回到黑海岸……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66693,'Teleport me to Bessy',NULL,NULL,NULL,'把我传送到贝茜那里',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66694,'I wish to hear the tale of the Azurestone.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我想听听天蓝宝石的故事。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66695,'Long, long ago, we first discovered the Azurestone when digging the very halls of Ironforge itself, at the beginning, it was simply seen as a beautiful blue jewel and held a natural value. Quite quickly thereafter, the power of the Azurestone was discovered by a dwarf naturally gifted with the arcana.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'很久很久以前，我们在挖掘铁炉堡的大厅时第一次发现了天蓝宝石，一开始，它只是被视为一颗美丽的蓝色宝石，具有自然价值。不久之后，天蓝宝石的力量被一个天生具有奥术的矮人发现了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66696,'Huidgrar Azurebrow was the one who studied the stone, and taught others of its power, the name \'Azurestone\' came from his name, and those that studied beneath him created \'The Azurestone Order\'. The Order has been pivotal in many key points in history, from the War of the Three Hammers, to when the orcs were getting close to Ironforge itself!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'灰格尔·蓝眉就是研究这种石头的那个人，他其他人传授宝石的力量，“天蓝宝石”这个名字来自他的名字，那些跟着他学习的人创建了“天蓝教团”。从三锤之战到兽人逼近铁炉堡，教团在历史上的许多关键时刻都起着举足轻重的作用!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66697,'When Huidgrar died from his rather long and vibrant life, the Azurestone Order fell with him, falling into obscurity with time. It is up to us, the naturally gifted of our kind to reignite this ancient group, and to show the world our prowess with fire, frost, and the arcane!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'当灰格尔在他漫长却充满传奇的一生中死去后，天蓝教团也随着他的逝去而消失，随着时间的流逝而变得默默无闻。现在，我们这类天赋异禀的人来重新点燃这个古老的团体，向世界展示我们使用火焰，冰霜和奥术的威力!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66698,'Spirits, it is I, Sage Palerunner, I call from the mortal plane to bring another into the fold. They have already braved the harsh wilds to gather the Spiritleaf required, they show true bravery in the face of adversity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'神灵们，是我，圣者帕勒纳，我从凡间召唤另一个人加入我们。他们已经勇敢地在严酷的野外采集了所需的灵叶，他们在逆境中表现出了真正的勇敢。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66699,'I ask of you to allow your magic to flow through into their body, and be blessed by the Earthmother\'s gift. They will be the bearer of our culture, and our traditions, from now until the end of time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我请求你允许你的魔法流过他们的身体，并赐予他们大地母亲的祝福。从现在开始，他们将是我们文化和传统的承载者。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66700,'The ritual is complete, they will see you, to see if you are truly worthy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'仪式完成了，他们会看着你，看你是否真的值得。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
