(66877,'Do ya even have a Mage around here? It\'s 1000 degrees out here! I guess I can set up shop and conjure up some water. For a price, of course! ... Oh, and uh, for the Horde!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你们这儿有法师吗?这里热的简直有1000度!我想我可以开个店，变出一些水来。当然是有代价的!…对了，为了部落!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66878,'I\'ve made some bad deals with demons, you orcs have made some bad deals with demons. You can sympathize, right? Thanks for takin\' us in.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我和恶魔做过一些糟糕的交易，你们兽人也和恶魔做过一些糟糕的交易。你会同情的，对吧?谢谢你收留我们。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66879,'Who cares about honor? Where\'s the food?!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'谁在乎荣誉?填饱肚子才是要紧?!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66880,'Gar\'thok laughs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'加托克大笑。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66881,'Very well, recruits. I\'ll give you the same chance as any orc or troll who arrives from the Valley of Trials. There is plenty of work for you in Razor Hill. Start here, earn the respect of your new allies, and bring honor to the Horde!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'很好，新兵们。我会给你和任何从试炼谷来的兽人或巨魔一样的机会。剃刀岭有很多工作等着你。从这里开始，赢得你的新盟友的尊重，为部落带来荣誉!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66882,'Alright, I\'ll be honest with you guys: The boss isn\'t gonna be happy we\'re not bringing him back his treasure. But I\'ve seen enough, and I think you have too, right?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'好吧，我跟你们说实话:我们不把他的宝藏带回来，老板会不高兴的。但我已经看够了，我想你也看够了，对吧?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66883,'We can\'t go back to the Venture Co. or we\'re all dead meat! There\'s no way the Steamwheedle Cartel will take us in. Not with all the bad blood between us already.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们不能回到风险投资公司，回去了就是死！热砂企业会收留我们，我们之间还没那么多不和。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66884,'So here we are. A bunch of smelly, grimy refugees without a single coin to our name. We\'ve only got one chance left, and that\'s kissing Thrall\'s feet.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'所以我们在这里。一群身无分文、又臭又脏的难民。我们只有一次机会了，那就是亲吻萨尔的脚。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
