(66887,'Do not be frightened, these troggs are small and weak. They\'re easy to take out alone. However, if they swarm the caravans, people could get hurt, and we cannot spare more men to deal with them while keeping the other threats out there away from the lodge.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不要害怕，这些穴居人又小又弱。它们很容易单独对付。然而，如果他们挤进商队，就会有人受伤，我们不能腾出更多的人来对付他们，同时也让其他威胁远离我们的小屋。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
