(66891,'We all knew there was a risk, but... she was practically here already! It could have been any of us!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们都知道有风险，但是…她实际上已经在这儿了!可能是我们中的任何一个人!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66892,'How could this have happened?! We survived the Scourge, the Wetlands, and the Horde only to have our possessions burned to a cinder while being kidnapped?! It\'s not fair!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'怎么会发生这种事?!我们从天灾，沼泽和部落中幸存了下来。却在这里被绑架！我们的财产也被烧成灰烬!这不公平!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66893,'I\'m sorry. I shouldn\'t burden you with this. We\'ve all struggled ever since we lost Quel\'Thalas, but you\'ve provided so much support for us.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我很抱歉，我不应该给你添麻烦。自从我们失去了奎尔萨拉斯，我们都很纠结，但你给了我们这么多支持。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66894,'The wood, the water, you\'ve even defeated those vile trogg creatures. You\re right, I must be calm. Perhaps my sister is still out there. She is the only family I have left, and if anyone can save her, it\'s you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'木材，水，你甚至打败了那些可恶的穴居人。你,你说得对，我必须冷静。也许我妹妹还在外面。她是我唯一的亲人，如果有人能救她，那就是你。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66895,'Go speak to that rogueish human woman who led the caravan escorts. Perhaps she can help!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'去和那个带领商队护送队的人类女人谈谈。也许她能帮上忙!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66896,'You\'ve saved my sister!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你救了我妹妹!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66897,'I can\'t overstate how honored I am to be able to call you my friend. Thanks to you, little Arisha is safe. We\'re all so overwhelmed by your heroism.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'能成为你的朋友，我感到无比荣幸。多亏了你，小阿莉沙才会安全归来。我们都被你的英雄行径感动了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66898,'Several wagons have moved on to Stormwind while you were away, but a lot of us have decided to stay here for the time being. Perhaps even forever.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你不在的时候，有几辆马车去了暴风城，但我们大多数人决定暂时留在这里。也有人或许永远留在这里。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66899,'I believe Kathy wishes to speak with you. Here is a present from me. Take care, okay? Wherever you may end up, remember that we\'ll always remain friends!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我相信凯茜想和你谈谈。这是我送给你的礼物。一定要好好保重。无论你在哪里，记住我们永远都是朋友!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66900,'I thought I\'d never see my sister again. Thank you, hero!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我以为我再也见不到我妹妹了。谢谢你，你是我的英雄!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66901,'I\'m ready, Ishalah. Teleport me to Goldshire!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我准备好了，伊沙拉。把我传送到闪金镇!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66902,'I hear Sturk owes The Rov a punching debt.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我听说斯特克欠罗夫一大笔钱。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66903,'Open a portal to Amani\'Alor.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'打开通往阿曼尼阿洛的传送门。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66904,'May the spirits be with ya and the Loa guide ya steps.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'愿万灵与你同在，愿万灵指引你的脚步。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66905,'Thank you, thank you, thank you! I am so happy! We should go to Stormwind. Let\'s find someone important who can help! I believe miss Tanilaeh in the Golden Dawn Institute can take us back!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'谢谢，谢谢，谢谢!我太高兴了!我们应该去暴风城。让我们找一个可以提供帮助的重要人物吧!我相信金色黎明学院的塔尼拉小姐能带我们回去!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66906,'Mommy is gone, but we will definitely find her! I am sure of it! Until then, I am happy and excited to adventure with you! We\'re the bestest friends now! We\'re going to have a lot of fun seeing the world! Hehe!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'妈妈不见了，但我们一定会找到她的!我敢肯定!在那之前，我很高兴也很兴奋能和你一起冒险!我们现在是最好的朋友了!我们要带着快乐的心情去看看这个世界!呵呵!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66907,'Oooh, this place is huge! Where do we go now? Let\'s start in the Mage District! We can also look at that weird-smelling place. The pub? I heard people drink special drinks there when they\'re sad! My mom is definitely sad without me.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，这地方真大!我们现在要去哪里?让我们从法师区开始吧!我们也可以看看那个奇怪气味的地方。那是酒吧吗?我听说那里的人伤心的时候会喝特别的饮料!找不到我，我妈妈一定很难过。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66908,'I feel the magic in the air! This place is nice, but not as pretty or magical as Silvermoon!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我感觉到了空气中的魔力!这地方真不错，虽然没有银月城那么漂亮和神奇!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66909,'Mommy isn\'t here... Let\'s keep moving!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'妈妈不在这里……让我们继续前进!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66910,'This place is scary. There\'s bad magic here, and it smells horrible! Can we leave?! Please?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这地方太可怕了。这里有邪恶的魔法，而且闻起来很难闻!我们走吧，好吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66911,'Look, it\'s a night elf priestess! And a moonwell! I love all the grass and glowing plants. This place is really nice. I bet Mommy would like it! Let\'s keep searching so that we can show it to her.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'看，是个暗夜精灵女祭司!还有月亮井!我喜欢所有的草坪和发光的植物。这地方真不错。我打赌妈妈会喜欢的!我们一定要找到她，这样就能带她看这些东西了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66912,'Yuck! This place smells. Would Mommy really be here?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'讨厌的东西!这地方很臭。妈妈真的会在这里吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66913,'Oooh, this place looks much kinder than the other one. But I\'m sure my mom didn\'t go to the dwarf lands.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这个地方看起来比另一个好很多。但我肯定我妈没去矮人王国。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66914,'This is the place where our people settled! It\'s pretty. Not as pretty as Silvermoon, but pretty. This place isn\'t large though, and Mommy isn\'t here. Let\'s keep looking!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这是我们的人定居的地方!它很漂亮。没有银月那么漂亮，但也很漂亮。不过这地方不大，妈妈也不在。我们继续找吧!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66915,'That looks so weird. The gnomes made this, right? I\'m sure Mommy isn\'t here. That tram leads to the dwarf city, I think. It\'s cold there, and Mommy hates the cold.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'看起来很奇怪。这是侏儒做的，对吧?妈妈肯定不在这里。我想那辆地铁是通往矮人城市的。那里很冷，妈妈讨厌寒冷。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66916,'The king lives there! We shouldn\'t disturb him, though, even if finding my mommy is super important. I know she isn\'t there either because they wouldn\'t allow her in. We don\'t have much. Mommy is very pretty, but we lost everything when Quel\'Thalas fell.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'国王就住在那儿!我们不应该打扰他。我知道妈妈也不在那里，因为他们不会让她进去。我们没多少钱。妈妈很漂亮，但奎尔萨拉斯倒下时我们失去了一切。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66917,'I heard that this place existed before the new town was built! There\'s so many shops, but the streets are all so crammed that it\'s a little bit scary.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我听说这个地方在新城区建成之前就存在了!这里有很多商店，但是街道上太拥挤了，让人有点害怕。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66918,'This place is smelly. Mommy isn\'t here either. I am really worried. Where else could she be?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这地方很臭。妈妈也不在。我真的很担心。她还能在哪儿呢?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66919,'The army is there. Could my mom have been arrested? But she didn\'t commit any crimes. I don\'t think this is the place, but we can come back here if we don\'t find her anywhere else.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'军队在那里。我妈妈会被逮捕吗?但她并没有犯罪。我觉得她不可能在这里，但如果我们在其他地方找不到她，我们可以再来这里。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66920,'It\'s the Cathedral! Wow, it\'s so huge! That\'s amazing!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'是大教堂!哇，好大啊!太神奇了!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66921,'If Mommy is really gone, then I could end up in that place. I don\'t even want to think about that. It makes me so sad that I could cry.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果妈妈真的走了，我可能会被关在那里。我连想都不想想，这我伤心得想哭。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66922,'Look at this place! It\'s amazing! Wow, it\'s breathtaking!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'看看这个地方!这太惊人了!哇，太令人激动了!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66923,'This looks awful, and it\'s gross and scary. Can we leave, please? I don\'t like the way that man in red is looking at me.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这儿看起来很糟糕，很恶心，很可怕。我们能走了吗?我不喜欢那个穿红衣服的人看我的样子。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66924,'This is bad. This is really bad. I don\'t like it here. Let\'s go, please? I\'m scared.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这很糟糕。这真的很糟糕。我不喜欢这里。我们走吧，好吗?我很害怕。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66925,'Oh, there\'s so many people here! I remember when we first arrived after flying on gryphon\'s back! Their feathers were really fluffy and soft. Could Mom be here?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，这里有这么多人！我记得我们第一次骑在狮鹫的背上飞来的时候！它们的羽毛非常蓬松柔软。妈妈会在这里吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66926,'Oh, in there! That\'s the Visitor\'s Center where we first checked in when we arrived. Maybe they might know something!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，那里是游客中心，我们刚到的时候就是在那里登记的。也许他们会知道些什么!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66927,'A young tree with few rings named Applebough came to us for guidance and expertise with his leaves. Will you offer your time to help us find a cure for his ailment?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'一棵名叫苹果枝的年轮很少的小树来找我们寻求帮助。你愿意花点时间帮我们找到治疗它的病的方法吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66928,'Ahh! Applebough. Of course. Here\'s the balm that will help.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'啊哈!苹果枝。当然可以。这是能起作用的药膏。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66929,'My leaves. They fall. Big sad.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的叶子，经常掉落。太悲伤了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66930,'Was green. Had fruits. Was happy...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我想变绿，结出果实，会很高兴……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66931,'I feel revitalized! The life is flowing back into my branches. Thank you. This is a kindness that I won\'t soon forget!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我觉得又充满了活力!生命回流到了我的枝头。谢谢你！我永远不会忘记你的恩情!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66932,'Loania and her sister Lieren are the daughters of a Human paladin named Dougan. I have known Dougan since the Second war when we fought the Horde together.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'洛妮娅和她的妹妹莉琳是一个名叫杜根的人类圣骑士的女儿。我认识杜根是从第二次战争开始，当时我们一起与部落作战。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66933,'During the Second war, Dougan, myself, and a dwarf of the Wildhammer clan known as Kardan were close companions. After the war, Dougan and his wife Adena settled down in Grand Hamlet.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在第二次战争期间，杜根、我和蛮锤氏族的一个名叫卡尔丹的矮人是亲密的伙伴。战后，杜根和他的妻子阿黛娜在一个大村庄定居下来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66934,'Grand Hamlet later fell under a curse and became known as Darkshire, but I digress. One day, Dougan heard reports of villagers disappearing in the nearby cursed tower known as Karazhan. He summoned Kardan and I, and together we entered the tower to attempt a rescue.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'大村庄后来遭到诅咒，被称为夜色镇。不好意思，我离题了。有一天，杜根听说有村民在附近那个被诅咒的卡拉赞塔里失踪。他叫来了卡尔丹和我，我们一起进入塔楼试图营救。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66935,'It didn\'t go well, Karazhan was far more treacherous than we could have anticipated... Dougan didn\'t make it, and his wife subsequently lost the will to live. Kardan and I each adopted one of his infant twin daughters and raised them as our own.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'事情进展得并不顺利，卡拉赞远比我们预想的要危险得多……杜根没能活下来，他的妻子随后也失去了活下去的希望。卡尔丹和我各自收养了他的一对双胞胎女儿中的一个，把她们当作自己的亲生女儿抚养。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66936,'I believe the girls have a destiny before them, perhaps you will play a part in it too. For now, take this as your reward with my blessing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我相信女孩们都有自己的命运，也许你也会参与其中。现在，把这个作为我祝福你的回报吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66937,'You\'re missing a few guards.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你少了几个守卫。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66938,'Rumors say you\'ve lost a couple of men, is that true?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'有传言说你损失了几个人，是真的吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66939,'Two other encampments have lost a few of their guards, did this also happen here?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'另外两个营地失去了一些守卫，这里也发生了这样的事吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66940,'Buy somethin\', will ya?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'买点东西，好吗?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66941,'I don\'t know how you obtained that information but yes, some Scarlet Remnants attacked one of my Deathguard patrols, some never made it back and the others are in a deep sleep. Before falling into this weird slumber one of the guards said they were heading for the Monastery.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我不知道你是怎么得到这个消息的，但的确是真的。一些血色残党袭击了我的一个死亡守卫巡逻队，一些没有回来，其他的在熟睡中。在进入这种奇怪的睡眠之前，一个卫兵说那些人正在前往血色修道院。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66942,'A small force of the Scarlet Crusade has reached far enough into the forest to attack one of the patrols, we found only one lying about who had this strange ichor drooling out of his mouth. One of the other Deathguards touched it and soon fell into a deep slumber, one whose relative may be Death itself.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'血色十字军的一支小部队已经深入森林袭击了一支巡逻队，我们发现只有一个人躺着。他嘴里流着奇怪的液体。另一个死亡守卫碰了碰液体，直接陷入了沉睡，这东西简直就是死神的东西。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66943,'Right on point, yes, our short numbers grew even shorter, we found no trail of their corpses yet we have found their weapons covered in mud yet no blood. It seems they didn\'t put up a fight.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'没错，我们的人越来越少了，我们没有发现他们尸体。但我们发现他们的武器，武器上沾满了泥却没有血迹。看起来他们并没有反抗。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66944,'I\'m taking you to the local law enforcement.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我要带你去当地执法部门。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66945,'This guy here is the only survivor of those who attacked the caravan that was ment to reach Aerie Peak, he yielded and I have spared his life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这家伙是袭击前往鹰巢山的商队的人中唯一的幸存者，他投降了，所以我饶了他一命。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66946,'Vladeus Springriver, from Lakeshire, is it?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'弗雷迪斯，来自湖畔镇，对吧?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66947,'You smash your right fist into his sides.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你用右拳猛击他的身体两侧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66948,'Vladeus remains silent while slightly nodding his head, the nod is followed by a cough. You assume his throat was parched after being in chains for so long.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'弗雷迪斯保持沉默，微微点了点头，然后咳嗽了一声。你认为他被锁了这么久喉咙很干。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66949,'Offer water to Vladeus.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'给弗雷迪斯递水。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66950,'Thank you, you\'re the one that captured me, right? I am grateful you spared my life but there\'s nothing I can tell you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'谢谢，是你抓住了我，对吧?你饶了我一命，我很感激，但我无话可说。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66951,'Please Vladeus, make this easier for both of us. You look like a decent man, the people of Lakeshire wanted me to bring all of you back.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'别这样，弗雷迪斯，让我们俩都好过点。你看起来是个正派的人，湖畔镇的人希望我把你们都带回家。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66952,'A bit late for that don\'t you think? Since you took the life of the rest, I have nothing to tell you, the man in the red hood would return home and ki... I have said too much.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你不觉得有点晚了吗?既然你夺走了其他人的性命，我就没有什么可告诉你的，那个戴红兜帽的人会回家，然后……我说得太多了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66953,'There is nothing to fear with me at your side, the Alliance will protect your family. The Scarlet Crusade already failed so many times.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'有我在你身边，没什么好怕的，联盟会保护你的家人。血色十字军已经失败过很多次了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66954,'Perhaps you are right. I didn\'t really want it to end this way, we were promised a better life, we... I... I didn\'t expect they\'d make me kill innocents, you have to believe me!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'也许你是对的。我真的不希望会以这种方式结束生命，他们承诺会让我们过上更好的生活，我们……没想到他们会让我滥杀无辜，你要相信我！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66955,'I do, take my word for it. Who recruited you and why?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我相信你。谁招募了你，为什么?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66956,'I didn\'t see his face clearly, he was wearing a red hood and was simply laughing every few minutes. Looking back, it was the stupidest choice I have ever made. As to why they recruited us, I am not really sure. He said we would be taken to a hidden place of the Crusade to be trained, he was complaining that their number was low and since the death of two of their leaders they became broken. I think he mentioned a name, Aventis or Adentis?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我看不清他的脸，他戴着一顶红色的帽子，每隔几分钟就笑一次。现在回想起来，这是我做过的最愚蠢的选择。至于他们为什么招募我们，我不太清楚。他说我们会被带到十字军的一个隐蔽的地方接受训练，他抱怨说他们的人数太少了，因为他们的两个首领死了，他们变得涣散了。我想他提到了一个名字，阿本提斯还是阿登蒂斯?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66957,'Abbendis?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'阿比迪斯？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66958,'Yes, that\'s the one! Please I don\'t know anything else, I wish to return home.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'是的，就是这个名字!求你了，其余我什么也不知道，我只想回家。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66959,'Abbendis?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'阿比迪斯？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66960,'Ugh, bastard! What was that for?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'是啊，混蛋！怎么了？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66961,'Vladeus grits his teeth.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'弗雷迪斯咬紧牙关。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66962,'Silence mongrel, you will start talking before I do more than that.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'闭嘴，杂种，在我对你做更多刑罚之前，你最好老实交待。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66963,'I won\'t te... tell you anything!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我不会……告诉你任何事!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66964,'Vladeus short speech is followed by a cough. You assume he must be thirsty after being chained for so long.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'弗雷迪斯简短说了几句之后咳嗽了一声。你以为他被锁了这么久一定渴了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66965,'Last time I visited the Monastery I remember your people using this tool.\n\n<You grab a hot poker and place it one Vladeus\' neck.>\n\nNow talk!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'上次我参观修道院时，我记得你们的人使用这个工具。\r\n\r\n<你抓起一根滚烫的拨火棍，将它放在弗拉迪乌斯的脖子上。>\r\n\r\n现在说吧！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66966,'I will say nothing to the one that murdered my companions!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我不会对杀害我同伴的人说什么！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66967,'Your COMPANIONS murdered innocents.\n\n<You reach for the prongs.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你的同伴滥杀无辜。。\r\n\r\n<准备刺他。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66968,'Stop! Please stop, I will talk. I didn\'t want it to end up this way, I swear! The Red Hooded man said if we don\'t comply he\'d kill my family, please, you have to understand!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'停!请停下来！我会说的，我发誓，我不想以这种方式结束!红兜帽男说如果我们不服从他就杀了我全家，求你了，你要明白!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66969,'He\'s not the one holding your life in his hands at this very moment.\n\n<You push the prongs close to his face.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'此时此刻，你的命不在他手里，而在我手里。<你把烙铁棍贴在他的脸上>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66970,'He... he said we were going to be taken to a hidden place to train. They were lacking numbers an- and since two of their leaders were dead they weren\'t doing very well. He also mentioned a name, Aventis or Adentis?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'他……他说我们要被带到一个隐蔽的地方训练。他们人手不足，而且由于他们的两位领袖已经死了，他们的现况很不好。他还提到了一个名字，阿本提斯还是阿登蒂斯?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66971,'Abbendis?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'阿比迪斯？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66972,'Yes, please, please. I don\'t know anything else.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'是的，求你了，其他的我什么都不知道。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66973,'Vladeus is utterly terrified.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'弗拉迪斯吓坏了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66974,'Kick him in his knee.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'踢他的膝盖。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66975,'Vladeus squeals in pain, so harshly it\'d be heard outside.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'弗雷迪斯痛苦地尖叫着，声音如此刺耳，外面都能听到。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66976,'Brigitte Abbendis is the daughter of the former High General Abbendis and utterly hates the undead, which is not a surprise when it comes to the Scarlet Crusade, I know.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'布丽奇特·阿比迪斯是前高级将军阿比迪斯的女儿，我知道她极端憎恨亡灵，大部分血色十字军都是这样。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66977,'The issue is she\'d go to any length and I mean any to achieve this purpose, given what you told me and the fate of the other leaders she probably broke and went insane by now.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'问题是她会不遗余力地达到这个目的，考虑到你告诉我的，以及十字军其他领导人的命运，她现在可能已经癫狂了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66978,'Last I heard she was in Tyr\'s Hand, but if there\'s a secret training place or whatever that prisoner called it the only one to know about it would be her, an information passed down from the Ashbringer to her father and from her father to her.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'上次我听说她在提尔之手，但如果真有个像那个囚犯所说秘密训练地点，那唯一知道的人就是她，这是灰烬使者传给她父亲，她父亲又传给她的消息。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(66979,'I am telling you, the Scarlet Crusade is indeed broken and we have seen better days but Abbendis will not stop at anything to take on the undead, be they Scourge or not.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我告诉你，血色十字军确实被打破了，他们已经到头了，但阿比迪斯不会停止任何行动，她会来对抗亡灵，无论他们是天灾还是部落。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
