(61644,'Welcome to the Gnomeregan Reclamation Facility! If you are looking for refuge from the cold snow, there is no better place.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到诺莫瑞根回收设施!如果你想躲避寒冷的雪，没有比这更好的地方了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(100405,'I hope you know how to swim, $r.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'希望你会游泳，$r。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'I hope you know how to swim, $r.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'希望你会游泳，$r。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61653,'The Wolfskull Clan was grown from a great vision of one pack struggling against the growing dark. A pack of Wolves within the Horde, one built upon honor, tradition and forgiveness. The corruption that I and so many others cruelly brought upon us. Now rejected as shown in Grom\'s death and in our future. It reminds me of days I can only struggle to remember when the old home of the Orcs was a brighter place. $B$BPerhaps you will join us on our hunt before the eyes of the Earth Mother close and the final darkening of the world comes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'狼颅氏族诞生于一个伟大的愿景，那是一个在黑暗中顽强抗争的族群。它是在部落中的一群狼，建立在荣誉、传统与宽恕的基础上。我和其他许多人都曾残酷地给这个氏族带来过腐败。然而，在格罗姆的牺牲以及我们的未来中，这种腐败已被我们所摒弃。这让我想起了那些只能在记忆中苦苦追寻的日子，那时兽人的古老家园还是一片光明之地。$B$B或许你会加入我们在地球母亲目光注视下的狩猎行动，赶在世界最终陷入黑暗之前。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30138,'You will not take what is mine!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你别想夺走属于我的东西！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30139,'Father...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'父亲……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(67035,'I would like to end the Vagrant\'s Challenge once and for all.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我想要彻底终结流浪者的挑战。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(92951,'<The flying machine whirrs in place, awaiting a passenger to fly to Blackstone Island.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<飞行机器在原地嗡嗡作响，等待着乘客乘坐前往黑石岛。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<The flying machine whirrs in place, awaiting a passenger to fly to Blackstone Island.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<飞行机器在原地嗡嗡作响，等待着乘客乘坐前往黑石岛。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61740,'If supplies are low, you gotta improvise! Some herbs here, some body parts there - as long as you can advertise it, someone WILL buy it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果补给短缺，就得随机应变！这里一些草药，那里一点肢体部件——只要你能宣传出去，总会有人买的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61739,'If you want to know how to gather some of the more sturdy herbs out there, ya gotta pay me. I ain\'t doing anything for free under these conditions!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果你想了解如何采集一些更为坚韧的草药，你得付我钱。在这样的条件下，我才不会免费教你任何东西呢！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61738,'The good thing about us goblins having only four fingers is that most people won\'t notice if one or two are missing. Neat, isn\'t it?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们地精只有四根手指的好处就是，就算少了一两根，大多数人都不会注意到。这不是很妙吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61737,'So many lazy workers around here. Such standards and practices would never stand in the Venture Co. I can\'t believe the Durotar Labor Union would even allow such good conditions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这里到处都是懒惰的工人。在风险投资公司，这样的标准和做法绝对行不通。我真不敢相信杜隆塔尔劳工联盟竟然会允许这么好的条件存在。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61733,'Our work quotas and schedules are being pushed up due to a manpower shortage. All of our workers are now grinding even longer shifts to pick up the slack from all those that keep quitting!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'由于人力短缺，我们的工作定额和日程都被迫提高了。现在所有工人都要加班加点地干活，来弥补那些不断离职者留下的空缺！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61732,'If you wanna start catching those big, profitable fish you\'re going to need all the help you can get. Check out my wares and you can find what you\'re looking for.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果你想开始捕捉那些非常大且能赚大钱的鱼，你得用上所有可能的帮手。看看我的商品，你会发现你需要的东西。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61730,'What now, Did Taxxlo send you?$B$B<Maxlo lets out a sigh of breath.>$B$BFor a brother, he sure is a bit overbearing. I\'m in charge of the supply around here, and whilst we have excess, it can all evaporate rather quickly if we get reckless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'现在怎么了？是塔克斯洛派你来的吗?$B$B<马克斯洛发出一声叹息。>$B$B作为一个兄弟，他确实有点专横。我负责这里的补给工作，虽然我们现在有富余物资，但如果行事鲁莽的话，这些资源很快就会消耗殆尽。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61729,'Pah, just look at them. Standing around, twiddling their thumbs. How is a good and honest goblin like myself gonna make some marginable profit with conditions like these? A group of armless gnomes is more productive than this bunch. Heck, even a group of gnomes WITH arms would do better.$B$BBlastentom is a cretin and amateur if he believes me to return with a positive business report. Now scram or I\'m giving you a headstart straight down myself for wasting my time AND money.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'呸，看看他们。站着无所事事，闲得抠手。在这种情况下，像我这样诚实勤劳的地精怎么能赚取合理的利润？一群没手的侏儒都比这帮家伙效率高。唉，就算是一群有手的侏儒也肯定会做得更好。$B$B要是布拉斯特恩特姆认为我能带着一份积极的商业报告回去，那他就是个白痴和门外汉。现在滚开吧，不然我就让你先一步见识一下浪费我时间和金钱的后果。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61728,'You looking to spice your life up? Those coal miners down there eat nothing but dirt. We here in the tower eat like kings. You learn a thing or two from me, and who knows, maybe you can eat like a king too.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你想给生活加点料吗？下面那些煤矿工人只能吃尘土。而我们在塔里的人吃得像国王一样。跟我学两手，说不准你也能吃得像个国王呢。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61726,'You really have to be careful out here! It\'s like all of nature itself is trying to kill an upstanding and working goblin from making a few copper. If you like I can show you how to make some bandages. They can really help out in the wild when some nasty critter gives you some vile wound.$B$BTrust me it\'s really worth the money.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在这儿真的要小心啊！感觉整个大自然都在跟一个正直勤劳的地精作对，就为了阻止我们赚几个铜板。如果你愿意的话，我可以教你如何制作绷带。在野外遇到讨厌的野兽给你造成恶心的伤口时，绷带真的能派上大用场。$B$B相信我，花这个钱绝对是值得的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61725,'What do you want? Do you know how much work needs to be done around here?! Unless you have got something important to tell me or some good news, get out of here.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你想干什么？你知道这里有多少工作要做吗？！除非你有重要的事情告诉我或者有什么好消息，否则快离开这里。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61724,'Welcome to Rustgate Ridge. I am going to assume you are friends of our supreme overseer himself, as he does not allow just anyone to reside within his tower.$B$BIf you are waiting to meet with him, I would suggest taking a seat and finding something warm to eat. His schedule has made him quite busy as of late. That and he has a very large temper.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到锈门山脊。我猜想你们是至高监督者的朋友，因为他不允许随便什么人进入他的塔中居住。$B$B如果你们在等待与他会面，我建议你们找个座位坐下，并找点热乎的食物吃。最近他的日程安排得很满，而且他脾气非常大。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61721,'You looking for a good deal? If so, you\'ve come to the right place, all of my wares are priced to perfection.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你在寻找好买卖吗？如果是的话，你来对地方了，我所有的商品都定价得恰到好处。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61720,'The only way to make it big as a goblin is by mining. You can very well make it, and become rich!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'作为一个地精，要想发大财，挖矿才是唯一的出路。你绝对可以借此成功，变得富有起来！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61755,'You might think I\'m lucky to be standing here, but the truth is I had quite a lot of gold on that ship, all dragged to the bottom of the ocean... I might rather be dead at this point.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你可能觉得我站在这里很幸运，但事实是，我的很多金子都在那艘船上，全沉到海底去了……我现在或许宁愿自己死了算了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61754,'What a catastrophe, how are we ever going to earn some coin now?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'真是场灾难，我们现在该怎么赚取金币呢？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61749,'You wouldn\'t happen to have some spare screws would you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你该不会有几颗多余的螺丝吧？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61748,'Well, hello there.$B$BWelcome to my Workshop. I do all sorts of tinkering projects around here, when I get the spare time, that is. Most of my work these days is dedicated to fixing up some things from Rustgate Ridge.$B$BThey can\'t even seem to keep a shredder operational around there. Rusted bolts, torn wiring, cracked frames, it\'s a real mess.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哎呀，你好啊。$B$B欢迎来到我的工坊。只要有空闲时间，我就会在这里进行各种修补工作。最近我大部分的工作都是在维修锈门山脊那边的一些设备。$B$B他们在那儿甚至都无法保持一台碎纸机正常运转。生锈的螺栓、破损的线路、裂开的框架，真是乱七八糟。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61747,'Not much foot traffic gets up around here.$B$BYou wouldn\'t happen to be one of those Venture Co. lurking around are you?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这附近很少有人来往。$B$B你该不会是风险投资公司派来的探子吧？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61746,'Let me guess, you\'re here from Rustgate Ridge asking about the water shortages?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'让我猜猜，你是从锈门山脊来的，是来询问水源短缺的问题的吧？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61744,'I have an important job here. Supplying water on Blackstone is about as important as it gets. If this pump was to ever stop working, or if I left my post, it\'d be utter chaos. No active pumps means no drinking water for Rustgate and his goons.$B$BYou\'d think I\'d be paid a little more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我在这里有一项重要的工作。在黑石岛上提供水源的重要性不言而喻。如果这台泵停止运转，或者我离开了岗位，那将会是一片混乱。没有运转的水泵意味着锈门和他的爪牙们将无水可饮。$B$B你可能会认为我应该得到更多的报酬才对。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61742,'If you\'re looking for a good weapon, or some decent protection, you have come to the right place.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'如果你想买一把好武器，或是想找些像样的防具，那么你来对地方了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61741,'I really do have my work cut out for me!$B$BA batch of miscalculated fuses and faulty wires has sent all of the robots into chaos here!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我确实有够忙的！$B$B一批计算错误的引信和故障电线导致这里的机器人全乱套了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30140,'Many of us Wildhammer do not kno\' much about our past, be it the united clans under High King Modimus or the fall of our great Grim Batol. It\'s the task of lorekeepers like myself to remind the fledglings of their roots before they take flight.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们蛮锤氏族中的许多人并不太了解我们的过去，无论是至高王莫迪姆斯统治下的联合氏族，还是我们伟大的格瑞姆巴托的陷落。像我这样的历史守护者就有责任在年轻一代展翅飞翔之前，提醒他们记住自己的根源。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61482,'Anduin might be just a boy now, but he will be a great leader one day. His heart is pure and filled with light. With his father missing, it falls to me to tutor him and rule the kingdom until he is of age.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'安度因现在虽然只是个孩子，但他将来一定会成为一个伟大的领袖。他的心灵纯洁且充满光明。随着他父亲的失踪，我有责任指导他，并在他成年前代为治理这个王国。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61481,'Within me is the earth itself. We are one. I am of it and it of me. I listen for the mountain\'s reply.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我体内蕴含着大地本身。我们是一体的。我是它的一部分，它也是我的一部分。我在倾听山岳的回答。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61480,'Greetings in Elune\'s light. Welcome to Darnassus, a haven born from the grace of the Moon Goddess.$B$BThis sacred place is our refuge following the Battle of Mount Hyjal, a place where our people were meant to find solace and renewal.$B$BAlas, our unity has been shattered, and no World Tree can mend this profound wound.$B$BTreachery, a malady more insidious than any foe we faced in battle, festers within the heart of our people.$B$BIt spreads like a blight, and the one responsible for this affliction resides comfortably within the confines of this very city.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在艾露恩的光芒中向你问候。欢迎来到达纳苏斯，这个诞生于月神恩泽下的避风港。$B$B这里是我们在海加尔山战役后所找到的圣所，是我们的人民寻求慰藉与重生的地方。$B$B然而，我们的团结已被打破，即便是世界之树也无法愈合这深刻的创伤。$B$B背叛如同战场上面对的任何敌人一样险恶，它潜伏在我们人民心中的深处，并且正在滋生蔓延。$B$B这种背叛犹如瘟疫般扩散开来，而引发这一痛苦祸患的罪魁祸首正安然地居住在这座城市之中。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61758,'Me boys are bundles of talent, but ye got to keep \'em in check. If they would stop bickerin\' for just one day, passin\' down te family traditions te them wouldn\'t be so hard fer me!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我那帮小伙子都是些有天赋的家伙，但得管教好他们。要是他们能有一天不争吵，把家族传统传授给他们就不用那么费劲了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61757,'The Bronzebeard dwarves down in Ironforge might pride themselves on their skills, but they pale in comparison to the Wildhammer\'s years of refined craftsmanship.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'铁炉堡的铜须矮人也许会为自己的技艺而自豪，但与我们蛮锤氏族历经多年锤炼出的精湛工艺相比，他们还是略逊一筹。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61756,'We Thunderforges are te best what Wildhammer smithin\' can offer ye! Blood, sweat an\' tears is what makes our craft one o\' a kind!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们雷铸铁匠是蛮锤氏族所能提供的最优秀的铁匠！血汗与泪水造就了我们独一无二的工艺！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30141,'Okay, boys. Listen up. I got yer weapons and to be frank with ye, I am disappointed. Not only did ye use this stranger for yer own benefit, but also misused the art of blacksmithing te bolster yer own little egos.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'好了，小子们，都听好了。我看了你们的武器，坦白说，我很失望。你们不仅利用了这个陌生人来满足自己的私利，还滥用锻造技艺来膨胀自己的小小自尊心。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30142,'Brok. Yer axe is as brittle as Sindri\'s confidence. Etched ore alone won\'t make a sturdy metal. Ye have to combine it with different materials or it\'s gonna end up like this. I bet I could break it if I sat my arse on it! Put more thought into yer work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'布罗克，你的斧头跟辛德里的自信一样脆弱。仅仅刻有矿石的斧头可造不出坚固的金属。你必须和其他材料结合使用，否则就会像这样不堪一击。我敢打赌，如果我坐在上面，都能把它坐断！在你的工作上多花点心思吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30143,'Sindri. Yer mace is well made in all the ways theory teaches us. But it lacks any soul. A blacksmith breathes life into their creations. Not ye, though. This thing has as much to say as Brok after his tenth ale. If ye don\'t learn to feel yer craft, ye not gonna craft weapons worthy of the Thunderforge name.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'辛德里，你的战锤在理论上讲制作得相当好。但它缺乏灵魂。铁匠是要将自己的生命注入到作品中去的。但你却没有做到这一点。这玩意儿就像布罗克喝到第十杯麦酒时那样没话可说。如果你学不会用心感受你的技艺，你就打造不出配得上雷铸之名的武器。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30144,'One last word: Start listenin\' te eachother. Yer brothers, fer Khardros\' sake! If ye stop thinking yer better than the other, ye\'d be able to smith a weapon like this lance here and impress me fer once in your life. Now get yer hammers and start swingin\'!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'最后说一句：开始互相倾听吧。为了卡德罗斯的名义，你们是兄弟！如果你们不再认为自己比别人更优秀，就能打造出像这柄长枪一样出色的武器，从而让我一生中难得地对你们感到满意一次。现在，拿起你们的铁锤，开始干活儿吧！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30145,'Yes, mother...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'是的，母亲……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30146,'I\'m all ears, Frig.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我洗耳恭听，弗里格。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(80131,'Can\'t you see I am busy sweeping around here?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你看不出我正在这里忙着打扫吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(47041,'No!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(47042,'God!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'天啊！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(47043,'No, god, please, no!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不，天啊，求求你，不要！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(47044,'NO! NO! NOOOOO!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'不！不！不要啊！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(47045,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'I have lost the will to live. Let the wild beasts take me.\r\n\r\nWhat do you mean there are no beasts in the city? What else do you call the monsters in government!\r\n\r\nI could have been rich beyond my wildest dreams, but they took it from me! It\'s a conspiracy to keep us poor forever.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'“我已经失去了生活的意志，就让野兽来吞噬我吧。什么？你说城市里没有野兽？那你怎么称呼那些政府里的恶魔！我本可以富甲一方，但他们从我手中夺走了这一切！这是一场阴谋，他们就是要让我们永远贫穷。”',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(47046,'SNAKES! RUN! EVERYONE RUN!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'蛇！快跑！大家快跑啊！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SNAKES! RUN! EVERYONE RUN!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'蛇！快跑！大家快跑啊！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(47047,'I will not forget this, $n!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我不会忘记这件事的，$n！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61761,'Those blasted Mudpaw drove us out of the mine. Our schedules are all kinds of messed up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'那些可恶的泥爪豺狼人把我们赶出了矿井。现在我们的工作计划全乱套了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61760,'Everything around here is practically in a state of disrepair. Gazzik does a good job helping when he has free time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'这里的每样东西几乎都处于失修的状态。加兹克在有空的时候确实帮了不少忙。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30147,'I am here for the overdue shipment of frameworks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是来取那些逾期未到的框架的。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30148,'Oh, those... Yes, they\'re in the warehouse. It\'s the building opposite of this one. We had to deal with... a few shortages in the workforce, so we weren\'t able to send \'em over to Rustgate.$B$BJust tell that to Maxlo and he\'s gonna understand, alright?$B$B<The goblin winks at you deviously.>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'哦，那些……是的，它们在仓库里。就在对面那栋楼里。我们最近遇到了……劳动力短缺的问题，所以没能及时送到锈门那边去。$B$B把这个情况告诉马克斯洛，他会理解的，对吧?$B$B<地精狡猾地对你眨眼。>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30149,'We\'re not gonna follow any of this tyrant\'s orders any longer!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们再也不听这个暴君的命令了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30150,'We were promised profits and riches, but this is just slave labour!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们被许诺了丰厚的利润和财富，但这里简直就是奴隶劳动！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61832,'Welcome to Brinthilien. I trust the journey hasn\'t been too arduous for you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到布林希尔林。我相信你的旅途不至于太过艰难吧。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61831,'Rest, weary traveler, for your burdens weigh heavy. In this newfound sanctuary, our collective haven, endure we shall, resilient against the trials that have befallen us.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'疲惫的旅人啊，请在此处歇息，你的重担很重。在这新找到的避难所，我们的共同家园中，我们将坚韧不拔地面对那些降临在我们身上的考验。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61807,'Welcome to Brinthilien. I hope the journey wasn\'t too hard on you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'欢迎来到布林希尔林。我希望你的旅途不至于太过艰辛。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61805,'Hm? Oh, bal’a dash, friend. Is there something I can help you with? As you can see, we are in the midst of quite the dilemma.$B$BWith the throne in play, I imagine it will be a rather dramatic debate. If nothing else, let none say that the Quel’dorei are not a passionate people.$B$BI wonder, who would you support in this clash?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'嗯？哦，你好啊朋友。有什么我可以帮到你的吗？如你所见，我们正处于一场相当棘手的困境之中。$B$B随着王位争夺战的展开，我预想将会有一场颇为激烈的辩论。无论如何，没有人可以说高等精灵不是一个充满激情的民族。$B$B我很好奇，在这场冲突中你会支持谁呢？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61804,'In a bygone era, I stood as the closest confidant and advisor to Prince Kael\'thas, watching with sorrow as he forsook us, seduced by the malevolent powers of the Legion.$B$BThough I yearn for his return, the wisps of foresight that caress my ancient senses reveal a path fraught with uncertainty.$B$BHope lingers, but I am no fool. In the absence of our prince, we must face the harsh reality and select a temporary leader to guide our people through these tumultuous times.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在那个久远的时代，我曾作为凯尔萨斯王子的最亲密顾问和知己，悲伤地看着他背弃了我们，被燃烧军团邪恶力量所诱惑。$B$B尽管我对他的回归充满渴望，但我古老的直觉中的远见卓识却揭示了一条充满不确定性的道路。$B$B希望犹存，但我并非愚人。在王子缺席的情况下，我们必须面对残酷的现实，选出一位临时领导者来引导我们的人民度过这段动荡不安的时期。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61803,'Vereesa\'s ineptitude in rallying Alliance forces to reclaim Quel\'Thalas marks the last straw. I refuse to witness our proud race reduced to a puppet state of Stormwind. With our reliance on the Alliance military, we stand exposed to the threats of both the Scourge and the resurgent Amani tribe.$B$BIt is only a matter of time until others recognize my rightful claim to leadership. The Sunsworn dynasty shall ascend, and under my rule, we will endure for countless millennia. The era of vulnerability and subservience is over; the dominion of the Quel\'dorei shall be reestablished, unyielding against external threats.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'温蕾萨在集结联盟力量收复奎尔萨拉斯方面的无能为力，已经是忍无可忍了。我拒绝看到我们骄傲的种族沦为暴风城的傀儡。由于依赖于联盟军队，我们在面对天灾军团和复苏的阿曼尼部族的威胁时显得不堪一击。$B$B这只是时间问题，直到其他人认识到我对领导权的正当要求。太阳誓约王朝必将崛起，在我的领导下，我们将延续无数个千年。脆弱与附属的时代已经结束；奎尔多雷的统治将会重新确立起来，坚决抵抗外部威胁。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61802,'Loathe though I am to do this to her, it seems that despite her best efforts Vereesa has not been able to handle her responsibilities on her own. For the good of our people we must look to someone else for leadership.$B$BSadly, some here cling to the past, hindering our progress. Perhaps the responsibility of the crown is too much for one head in these circumstances, yet reluctance is ever the companion of fear of change.$B$BWe must put our people first and cast aside antiquated loyalties to usher in a new, better era.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'尽管我非常不愿意这样做，但显然即使付出了最大的努力，温蕾萨也无法独自承担起她的职责。为了人民的福祉，我们必须另寻他人来领导我们。$B$B遗憾的是，这里有些人固守过去，阻碍了我们的进步。或许在当前形势下，王冠的责任对一个人来说太过沉重，然而对变革的恐惧总会伴随着犹豫不决。$B$B我们必须把人民放在首位，抛开过时的忠诚，以迎接一个崭新且更好的时代。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61801,'Once, in the echoes of a time that now feels like a distant fantasy, I dreamed of donning the mantle of Ranger-General. A vision painted with the vibrant hues of ambition danced before my eyes. Yet, the years have woven a different tapestry, one marked by the harsh brushstrokes of reality.$B$BThe coveted title, once a beacon of achievement, has transformed into a weighty burden resting heavily upon these weathered shoulders of mine.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'曾经，在一段如今已变得遥远如梦幻的记忆中，我梦想着披上游侠将军的战袍。一幅勃勃雄心绘制的生动画面在我眼前舞动。然而，岁月编织出了一个截然不同的挂毯，上面绘满了现实严峻的笔触。$B$B那曾象征荣耀与成就的尊贵头衔，如今却变成了一副沉重的担子，压在我的这些饱经风霜的肩膀上。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61800,'In the midst of our ceaseless debates on the fate of our people, the answer lies crystal clear before us. Time, a precious resource we squander in endless deliberations, is better spent on the singular, unyielding purpose that binds our hearts—we must reclaim Quel\'Thalas from the clutches of the Scourge, employing any means necessary to usher our homeland back into our embrace.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在我们对人民命运的无休止争论中，答案犹如明镜般显而易见。时间，这一我们在无尽讨论中挥霍的宝贵资源，应当更好地用在一个凝聚我们内心、不可动摇的目标上——我们必须不惜一切手段，从天灾军团的魔爪下收复奎尔萨拉斯，引领我们的家园回归我们的怀抱。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61799,'In the ashes of our once-proud kingdom, we find ourselves, hollow and scarred by the betrayals that have stripped us of everything.$B$BYet, in this desolation, a bitter resolve takes root, for we stand not as defeated remnants but as a united force, forged anew with a singular purpose. The future, once dictated by the whims of the traitorous prince, now lies open before us, a blank canvas upon which we can inscribe our own destiny.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在我们曾经骄傲王国的废墟中，我们找到了自己，空洞且因背叛而伤痕累累，失去了所有的一切。$B$B然而，在这荒芜之中，一种痛苦的决心开始生根发芽，因为我们并非作为战败的残余而站立，而是作为一个有着共同目标、重新熔铸而成的整体力量。未来，曾被叛逆王子的任性所左右，如今正敞开在我们面前，如同一张空白画布，等待我们书写自己的命运。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61849,'Lady Windrunner speaks true, and under her command, our people thrived. The Regency Council\'s treachery will never hold sway over warriors like us; our loyalty lies solely with Lady Windrunner.$B$BWe\'ll follow her lead, undeterred by the machinations of those who betray our kin. In the heat of battle, it\'s Lady Windrunner\'s banner we rally behind, forging our path with the unyielding strength of warriors who recognize true leadership.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'风行者女士所言极是，在她的领导下，我们的人民繁荣昌盛。摄政议会的背叛永远无法左右我们这样的勇士；我们的忠诚只属于风行者女士。$B$B我们将坚定地追随她的步伐，不受那些背叛我们同胞之人阴谋诡计的影响。在战斗的烈火中，我们集结在风行者女士的旗帜之下，以真正认识并尊重领导力的无畏战士之坚韧力量铸就前行的道路。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61846,'I love fishing. I came here to see if there\'s any new species of fish to catch here, and these waters do not disappoint.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我热爱钓鱼。我来这里是为了看看是否有新的鱼类可以捕捉，而这里的水域确实没有让我失望。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61842,'Ah, another young apprentice comes to me to learn about the secrets of nature.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'啊，又一位年轻的学徒来找我学习自然的奥秘了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61841,'I am of the firm belief that our pursuits should not be constrained by the moral dictates of the Regency Council. The arcane is a vast tapestry, woven with threads beyond our current understanding, and I am resolved to unveil its hidden secrets.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我坚信我们的追求不应受限于摄政议会的道德约束。奥术是一幅浩瀚的织锦，由我们目前尚无法完全理解的丝线编织而成，我决心揭示它隐藏的秘密。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61840,'I am the finest leatherworker in Alah\'Thalas. And I\'m willing to share my knowledge.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我是阿尔萨拉斯最出色的皮革匠人，我愿意分享我的技艺知识。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61837,'Before the fall of Quel\'Thalas, I served as the apprentice to the esteemed Ley-Technician Fenros. With his unfortunate demise, the responsibility now falls upon my shoulders as the sole bearer of this invaluable knowledge, entrusted with the task of passing it down to the generations that follow.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'在奎尔萨拉斯陷落之前，我曾作为尊敬的符文技师芬罗斯的学徒。随着他不幸的逝去，传承这份无价知识的责任现在落在了我的肩上，作为唯一掌握这一知识的人，我有责任将其传授给后世的继承者们。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61836,'The once-exquisite silks of our craftsmanship now lie ravaged and torn amidst the ruins of Silvermoon. It falls upon us, the artisans of the high elves, to weave anew and restore the resplendent glory that is rightfully ours.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们曾精美的工艺丝绸如今在银月城废墟中破损不堪。身为高等精灵的工匠，我们必须重新编织，恢复那本应属于我们的灿烂光辉。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61772,'Cursed by our gluttony, we now stand close to our soon-to-be demise. See us as we stand, shattered, broken, and wretched amidst the rubble and the unwanted muck of our brethren. They have cast us aside, claiming they shall seek the salvation we cannot desire.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们因贪婪而受到诅咒，如今正濒临毁灭的边缘。看我们站在这破碎、残破和悲惨之中，在废墟与同胞们遗弃的污秽中挣扎。他们抛弃了我们，并声称将追求我们无法企及的救赎。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61861,'What brings you around Powder Town? Are you seeking fortune, or do you like just a spark of danger in your life?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你来到火药镇是为何事？是为了寻找财富，还是喜欢生活中带点刺激火花呢？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30151,'Wine was a true warlock. Beneath the dark exterior laid the most genuine person we\'ve met. Warlock chat will never be the same without him.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'万恩是一位真正的术士，他的内心隐藏着我们所见过的最真诚的灵魂。没有了他的存在，术士们的闲聊将不再相同。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30152,'It was an honor to have Gallifrey in guild, to teach her all about the game and regard her as a friend. May you ride your white wolf forever!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'能够邀请加利弗雷加入公会，教导她游戏的一切，并视她为朋友，是一种荣幸。愿你永远驾驭着你的白狼前行！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61887,'Stonetalon has always held such natural beauty.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'石爪山脉一直以来都拥有如此自然的美景。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30153,'Thilasa\'sh aralin.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Thilasa\'sh aralin.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30154,'Sherl\'ma na shar.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Sherl\'ma na shar.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30155,'Ash\'drassil shalda ren.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Ash\'drassil shalda ren.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30156,'Aseph-ah-balla nah!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Aseph-ah-balla nah!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30157,'Rommath, my faithful servant. It has been too long since we last spoke.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'罗玛斯，我忠实的仆从。自从上次交谈以来，已过去太久了。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30158,'My Prince. I am relieved to see you alive and well. I have much to report...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我的王子。见到您安然无恙，我深感欣慰。我有许多情况需要汇报……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30159,'Yet, I have little time. Are my people well?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'然而，我时间紧迫。我的人民还好吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30160,'Yes, my Prince. Yet, many wither, as we are unable to sate our addiction. Also, the Regency Council is torn...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'是的，我的王子。然而，由于无法满足我们对魔法的依赖，许多人正在衰弱。此外，摄政议会内部也出现了分裂……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30161,'Do not bore me with politics, Rommath. I care little about it. Soon, our people will hunger no more. I will see to it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'罗玛斯，不要跟我谈论这些政治问题。我对此并不关心。很快，我们的人民将不再受此煎熬，我会确保此事。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30162,'When, my Prince? Many believe that you have forsaken us. They call you a traitor, I can no longer bear the insults...',NULL,NULL,NULL,'何时，我的王子？许多人认为您已经抛弃了我们。他们称您为叛徒，我再也无法忍受这些侮辱……',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30163,'Soon, Rommath. Maintain silence for now. Until my return, it is better  that they forget about me. They cannot afford to be dependent on a mere idea; they require tangible solutions. Do not sow false hope among our people. I will only return when I have discovered the path to our salvation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'很快，罗玛斯。现在请保持沉默。在我归来之前，他们最好忘记我。他们不能依赖一个抽象的概念，他们需要的是切实可行的解决方案。不要在我们的人民中播撒虚假的希望。只有当我找到通往我们救赎的道路时，我才会回来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30164,'I understand. We await your return.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我明白。我们在此等待您的归来。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30165,'And I cannot wait to be with my people once more. It won\'t be long, I promise.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我也迫不及待想要再次与我的人民在一起。不会太久的，我保证。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30166,'May you always remember the Light of the Sunwell, my Prince.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'愿您永远铭记太阳之井的光芒，我的王子。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61822,'Enchanting is a noble art. Can you handle it?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'附魔是一门高尚的艺术。你能掌握它吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30167,'Teleportation',NULL,NULL,NULL,'传送',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61773,'Our suffering knows no end. Can you help us?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们的苦难永无止境。你能帮助我们吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Our suffering knows no end. Can you help us?',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们的苦难永无止境。你能帮助我们吗？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61774,'I was not thirsty, but thank you for your kindness.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我不渴，但感谢您的好意。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'I was not thirsty, but thank you for your kindness.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我不渴，但感谢您的好意。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61775,'Stay away from me!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'离我远点！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Stay away from me!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'离我远点！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61894,'Our research here is proving to be quite extensive. To find the cure for the intense desire of arcane that molds our very essence is a monumental task. One only us elves may be worthy of discovering.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'我们在这里的研究相当深入。寻找能够治愈那种深深影响我们本质的奥术渴望的解药是一项艰巨的任务。或许只有我们精灵才配得上解开这个秘密。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30168,'You do not know the powers in which you interfere!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'你不知道自己正在干预的力量有多么强大！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61904,'The snow always makes me feel festive. Even with my cold, dark soul.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'雪总是让我感到喜庆，即使我拥有冰冷黑暗的灵魂，',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61903,'There is no better way to get into the festive spirit than to dress appropriately!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'没有什么比穿上合适的服装更能让人沉浸在节日的气氛中了！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(61902,'There\'s a thing or two to know about fashion darling. If you aren\'t sporting some designer brands or the newest most up to date threads you\'re not fashionable, it\'s that easy.$B$BI promise if you take one look at what we have, you\'ll be blown away by our quality!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'亲爱的，关于时尚，有那么一两件事你需要了解。如果你没穿设计师品牌或最新最潮的服装，那就谈不上时尚，就这么简单。$B$B我保证，只要你看一眼我们这里的商品，就会被我们的品质所震撼！',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
